#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "How BomLens is structured and which tool runs at each step of the scan pipeline, and in what order."
msgstr "BomLens 的整體結構，以及掃描管線的每個步驟由哪個工具、以什麼順序執行。"

#. type: Title #
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Architecture"
msgstr "架構"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:8
msgid ""
"This document describes the overall system structure of BomLens and explains "
"which tool runs at which step of the scan pipeline, and in what order."
msgstr ""
"這份文件說明 BomLens 的整體系統結構，以及掃描管線中每個工具在哪個步驟、以什麼"
"順序被呼叫。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:10
msgid ""
"For the per-input tool flow — source code (with the ScanCode and SCANOSS "
"options), firmware, a received SBOM, and an AI model — see [Pipeline by "
"input type](pipeline-by-input.md)."
msgstr ""
"各輸入類型的工具流程——原始碼（含 ScanCode 與 SCANOSS 選項）、韌體、收到的 "
"SBOM 與 AI 模型——請看[各輸入類型的流程](pipeline-by-input.md)。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "> This document reflects the 2-stage architecture as currently implemented. The Stage 1 routing in the source code (detect the language, then run the official cdxgen language image) is implemented and working in `scripts/scan-sbom.sh`.\n"
msgstr "> 這份文件以目前已實作的兩階段 (2-stage) 架構為準。原始碼的 Stage 1 分流（先偵測語言，再執行 cdxgen 官方語言映像檔）已在 `scripts/scan-sbom.sh` 實作並運作中。\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:13 docs/guides/by-input.md:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "At a glance"
msgstr "一覽"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:16
msgid ""
"BomLens is a 2-stage pipeline in which two kinds of Docker images work "
"together."
msgstr "BomLens 是一條由兩種 Docker 映像檔協力運作的兩階段管線。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:19
msgid ""
"**Stage 1 — Generation**: for source code, the official per-language cdxgen "
"images generate the SBOM (CycloneDX 1.6); for container images, binaries, "
"and directories, syft does."
msgstr ""
"**Stage 1——產生**：原始碼由 cdxgen 各語言的官方映像檔產生 SBOM (CycloneDX "
"1.6)；容器映像檔、二進位檔與目錄則由 syft 產生。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:19
msgid ""
"**Stage 2 — Post-processing**: the lightweight `bomlens` image takes the "
"SBOM and runs normalization, optional deep license detection, notice "
"generation, the security report, signing, and upload in order."
msgstr ""
"**Stage 2——後處理**：輕量的 `bomlens` 映像檔接手 SBOM，依序執行正規化、選用的"
"精確授權條款偵測、產生授權聲明、安全報告、簽章與上傳。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:21
msgid ""
"![BomLens two-stage pipeline: per-language cdxgen images or syft build "
"bom.json, and the bomlens image post-processes it](../images/diagrams/"
"architecture-overview.png)"
msgstr ""
"![BomLens 兩階段管線：各語言的 cdxgen 映像檔或 syft 產生 bom.json，再由 "
"bomlens 映像檔後處理](../images/diagrams/architecture-overview.png)"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:23
msgid ""
"The single entry point for orchestration is `scripts/scan-sbom.sh` (`scan-"
"sbom.bat` on Windows); this is the only script users invoke."
msgstr ""
"編排的單一進入點是 `scripts/scan-sbom.sh`（Windows 為 `scan-sbom.bat`），使用"
"者只需呼叫這一個指令碼。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "Why two stages"
msgstr "為什麼分成兩階段"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:29
msgid ""
"Previously, every language runtime plus every analysis tool lived in a "
"single huge image. The redesigned pipeline splits the responsibilities in "
"two."
msgstr ""
"過去所有語言執行環境加上所有分析工具都塞在一個龐大的映像檔裡。重新設計後的管"
"線把責任拆成兩半。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:36
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| | Stage 1 image | Stage 2 image (`bomlens`) |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| **Role** | **Generates** the SBOM from source | SBOM **post-processing** (normalization, notice, security, signing, upload) plus syft scans |\n"
"| **Contents** | Official **per-language** cdxgen images (java, python, node, ...) | **No** language toolchain — lightweight `debian:12-slim` |\n"
"| **Acquisition** | Pulled **on demand** after detecting the project language | Pulled once and reused |\n"
"| **Benefit** | cdxgen maintains up-to-date per-language toolchains | Small image; pinned tool versions ensure reproducibility |\n"
msgstr ""
"| | Stage 1 映像檔 | Stage 2 映像檔 (`bomlens`) |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| **角色** | 從原始碼**產生** SBOM | SBOM **後處理**（正規化、授權聲明、安全、簽章、上傳）以及 syft 掃描 |\n"
"| **內容** | cdxgen 官方**各語言**映像檔（java、python、node…） | **沒有**語言 toolchain——輕量的 `debian:12-slim` |\n"
"| **取得方式** | 偵測出專案語言後**按需下載** | 下載一次後重複使用 |\n"
"| **好處** | cdxgen 會維護各語言的最新 toolchain | 映像檔小；工具版本固定，確保可重現 |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "> For the five mainstream languages (java, python, node, dotnet, php), detection with the official cdxgen images is identical, and for go, ruby, and rust the toolchain preparation (`build-prep.sh`) is markedly better. For the measurement data, see [README \"Why a Docker image?\"](https://github.com/sktelecom/bomlens#why-a-docker-image-vs-plain-cdxgen).\n"
msgstr "> 五個主流語言（java、python、node、dotnet、php）用 cdxgen 官方映像檔的偵測結果完全相同；go、ruby 與 rust 則因為有 toolchain 的事前準備 (`build-prep.sh`) 而明顯更好。測量數據請看 [README「Why a Docker image?」](https://github.com/sktelecom/bomlens#why-a-docker-image-vs-plain-cdxgen)。\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:41
#, no-wrap
msgid "Tool inventory"
msgstr "工具清單"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:44
msgid ""
"The tools invoked by the pipeline and their **version pinning** status "
"(supply chain hygiene)."
msgstr "管線會呼叫的工具，以及它們的**版本固定**狀況（供應鏈衛生）。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:57
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Tool | Version | Stage | Role | Enabled when |\n"
"|------|------|------|------|-----------|\n"
"| **cdxgen** | bundled in the language image | Stage 1 | Generates the SBOM from source code (`--spec-version 1.6`) | `MODE=SOURCE` |\n"
"| **build-prep.sh** | — | Stage 1 | Dependency preparation right before cdxgen (cargo, go, bundle, mvn, pip) | `MODE=SOURCE` |\n"
"| **syft** | `v1.51.0` | Stage 1 | Scans images, binaries, and root filesystems | `MODE=IMAGE/BINARY/ROOTFS` |\n"
"| **jq** (`normalize-sbom.sh`) | — | Stage 2 | Normalizes and sorts the SBOM | Always |\n"
"| **ScanCode Toolkit** | `32.5.0` | Stage 2 | Precise license detection on first-party source | `--deep-license` (opt-in build) |\n"
"| **SCANOSS** | `1.54.2` | Stage 2 | Identify vendored open source in C/C++ source with no package manager | `--identify-vendored` |\n"
"| **jq** (`generate-notice.sh`) | — | Stage 2 | Generates the open source notice (NOTICE) | `--notice` / `--all` |\n"
"| **Trivy** | `v0.74.0` | Stage 2 | Vulnerability (CVE) security report | `--security` / `--all` |\n"
"| **Cosign** | `v2.6.5` | Stage 2 | Detached SBOM signature | `--sign` |\n"
"| **curl** | — | Stage 2 | Upload to Dependency-Track | Default (unless `--generate-only`) |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 工具 | 版本 | 階段 | 角色 | 啟用條件 |\n"
"|------|------|------|------|-----------|\n"
"| **cdxgen** | 隨語言映像檔一併提供 | Stage 1 | 從原始碼產生 SBOM (`--spec-version 1.6`) | `MODE=SOURCE` |\n"
"| **build-prep.sh** | — | Stage 1 | cdxgen 執行前的相依項目準備（cargo、go、bundle、mvn、pip） | `MODE=SOURCE` |\n"
"| **syft** | `v1.51.0` | Stage 1 | 掃描映像檔、二進位檔與根檔案系統 | `MODE=IMAGE/BINARY/ROOTFS` |\n"
"| **jq** (`normalize-sbom.sh`) | — | Stage 2 | 正規化並排序 SBOM | 一律執行 |\n"
"| **ScanCode Toolkit** | `32.5.0` | Stage 2 | 對自有原始碼進行精確的授權條款偵測 | `--deep-license`（opt-in 建置） |\n"
"| **SCANOSS** | `1.54.2` | Stage 2 | 識別被複製納入 (vendored) 到沒有套件管理器的 C/C++ 原始碼裡的開放原始碼 | `--identify-vendored` |\n"
"| **jq** (`generate-notice.sh`) | — | Stage 2 | 產生開放原始碼授權聲明 (NOTICE) | `--notice` / `--all` |\n"
"| **Trivy** | `v0.74.0` | Stage 2 | 弱點 (CVE) 安全報告 | `--security` / `--all` |\n"
"| **Cosign** | `v2.6.5` | Stage 2 | SBOM 的 detached 簽章 | `--sign` |\n"
"| **curl** | — | Stage 2 | 上傳到 Dependency-Track | 預設（除非用 `--generate-only`） |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:59
#, no-wrap
msgid "> Versions are pinned as `ARG`s in `docker/Dockerfile`. To keep the image lean, ScanCode is an **opt-in** build arg (`--build-arg SBOM_DEEP_LICENSE=true`). The SCANOSS client is included by default; build with `--build-arg SBOM_SCANOSS=false` to drop it. Firmware unpacking/identification (unblob, cve-bin-tool) ships in the separate opt-in `bomlens-firmware` image, and AI-model SBOM generation (OWASP AIBOM Generator) in `bomlens-aibom`. For the per-input tool flow, see [Pipeline by input type](pipeline-by-input.md).\n"
msgstr "> 版本以 `docker/Dockerfile` 裡的 `ARG` 固定。為了讓映像檔保持精簡，ScanCode 是 **opt-in** 的建置參數 (`--build-arg SBOM_DEEP_LICENSE=true`)。SCANOSS 用戶端預設包含在內，若要移除請用 `--build-arg SBOM_SCANOSS=false` 建置。韌體的解包與識別（unblob、cve-bin-tool）放在另一個 opt-in 的 `bomlens-firmware` 映像檔，AI 模型的 SBOM 產生 (OWASP AIBOM Generator) 則放在 `bomlens-aibom`。各輸入類型的工具流程請看[各輸入類型的流程](pipeline-by-input.md)。\n"

