#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:99
#, no-wrap
msgid "Stage 1 — SBOM generation"
msgstr "Stage 1——產生 SBOM"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:102
msgid "The generation tool depends on the target type."
msgstr "產生工具依目標類型而異。"

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:103
#, no-wrap
msgid "Source code (`MODE=SOURCE`) — cdxgen language image"
msgstr "原始碼 (`MODE=SOURCE`)——cdxgen 語言映像檔"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:106
msgid ""
"`scan-sbom.sh` detects the project language with `detect_lang()`, picks the "
"matching **official cdxgen language image** with `img_for_lang()`, pulls it, "
"and runs `build-prep.sh` inside that image (`scripts/scan-sbom.sh:138-208`). "
"The lightweight post-processing image has no language toolchain, so "
"generation is handled entirely by the language image."
msgstr ""
"`scan-sbom.sh` 會用 `detect_lang()` 偵測專案語言，再用 `img_for_lang()` 挑出"
"對應的 **cdxgen 官方語言映像檔**，下載後在該映像檔裡執行 `build-prep.sh`"
"(`scripts/scan-sbom.sh:138-208`)。輕量的後處理映像檔沒有語言 toolchain，因"
"此產生工作完全由語言映像檔負責。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:108
msgid ""
"The per-language cdxgen image mapping is as follows (`scan-sbom.sh:158-177`; "
"the tag is pinned via `CDXGEN_TAG`)."
msgstr ""
"各語言的 cdxgen 映像檔對應如下（`scan-sbom.sh:158-177`；標籤由 `CDXGEN_TAG` "
"固定）。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:121
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Detected language | Image |\n"
"|-----------|--------|\n"
"| rust | `cdxgen-debian-rust` |\n"
"| go | `cdxgen-debian-golang124` |\n"
"| ruby | `cdxgen-debian-ruby34` |\n"
"| java | `cdxgen-temurin-java21` |\n"
"| python | `cdxgen-python312` |\n"
"| node | `cdxgen-node20` |\n"
"| php | `cdxgen-debian-php84` |\n"
"| dotnet | `cdxgen-debian-dotnet9` |\n"
"| android | self-built `bomlens-android-sdk<API>` (compileSdk extracted automatically) |\n"
"| mixed / unknown | cdxgen all-in-one (`CDXGEN_ALLINONE`) |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 偵測到的語言 | 映像檔 |\n"
"|-----------|--------|\n"
"| rust | `cdxgen-debian-rust` |\n"
"| go | `cdxgen-debian-golang124` |\n"
"| ruby | `cdxgen-debian-ruby34` |\n"
"| java | `cdxgen-temurin-java21` |\n"
"| python | `cdxgen-python312` |\n"
"| node | `cdxgen-node20` |\n"
"| php | `cdxgen-debian-php84` |\n"
"| dotnet | `cdxgen-debian-dotnet9` |\n"
"| android | 自行建置的 `bomlens-android-sdk<API>`（compileSdk 會自動取出） |\n"
"| mixed / unknown | cdxgen all-in-one (`CDXGEN_ALLINONE`) |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:123
msgid "Two steps run inside the image:"
msgstr "映像檔內會執行兩個步驟："

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:125
msgid ""
"**`build-prep.sh`** (`docker/lib/build-prep.sh`) — dependency preparation "
"**right before** cdxgen. It creates lockfiles for ecosystems cdxgen cannot "
"resolve on its own (notably Rust and Go), exposing transitive dependencies. "
"POSIX `sh`, best-effort (it never fails the scan)."
msgstr ""
"**`build-prep.sh`** (`docker/lib/build-prep.sh`)——在 cdxgen **執行前**準備相"
"依項目。它會為 cdxgen 無法自行解析的生態系（尤其是 Rust 與 Go）建立 "
"lockfile，讓間接相依也能被看見。以 POSIX `sh` 撰寫，盡力而為（絕不會讓掃描失"
"敗）。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:133
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   | Ecosystem | Action | Notes |\n"
"   |--------|------|------|\n"
"   | Rust | `cargo generate-lockfile` | cdxgen does not run cargo automatically — **required** |\n"
"   | Go | `go mod download` (`-mod=mod`) | Resolves the module graph |\n"
"   | Ruby | `bundle lock` / `install` | Only when no lockfile exists |\n"
"   | Maven | `mvn dependency:resolve` | Lightweight safety net |\n"
"   | Python | `pip install -r requirements.txt` | Exposes transitive dependencies when no lockfile exists |\n"
msgstr ""
"   | 生態系 | 動作 | 備註 |\n"
"   |--------|------|------|\n"
"   | Rust | `cargo generate-lockfile` | cdxgen 不會自動執行 cargo——**必要** |\n"
"   | Go | `go mod download`(`-mod=mod`) | 解析出模組關係圖 |\n"
"   | Ruby | `bundle lock` / `install` | 只在沒有 lockfile 時執行 |\n"
"   | Maven | `mvn dependency:resolve` | 輕量的安全網 |\n"
"   | Python | `pip install -r requirements.txt` | 沒有 lockfile 時讓間接相依被看見 |\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:135
msgid ""
"**Run cdxgen** — `build-prep.sh` auto-detects the cdxgen binary path, which "
"differs per image, and runs `cdxgen -r --spec-version 1.6 -o bom.json` "
"(`build-prep.sh:60-73`). The generated SBOM is then handed to the Stage 2 "
"(`MODE=POSTPROCESS`) post-processing image."
msgstr ""
"**執行 cdxgen**——`build-prep.sh` 會自動偵測各映像檔不同的 cdxgen 執行檔路徑，"
"然後執行 `cdxgen -r --spec-version 1.6 -o bom.json`(`build-"
"prep.sh:60-73`)。產生的 SBOM 接著交給 Stage 2 (`MODE=POSTPROCESS`) 的後處理"
"映像檔。"

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:136
#, no-wrap
msgid "Image / binary / directory — syft"
msgstr "映像檔／二進位檔／目錄——syft"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:139
#, no-wrap
msgid "**syft**, included in the `bomlens` image, generates the SBOM directly. (`docker/entrypoint.sh`)\n"
msgstr "`bomlens` 映像檔內含的 **syft** 會直接產生 SBOM。(`docker/entrypoint.sh`)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:145
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| MODE | Input | syft invocation |\n"
"|------|------|-----------|\n"
"| `IMAGE` | Docker image | `syft <image> -o cyclonedx-json` (requires the docker.sock mount) |\n"
"| `BINARY` | Single file | `syft file:<path> -o cyclonedx-json` (falls back to a minimal SBOM on failure) |\n"
"| `ROOTFS` | Directory | `syft dir:<path> -o cyclonedx-json` |\n"
msgstr ""
"| MODE | 輸入 | syft 呼叫方式 |\n"
"|------|------|-----------|\n"
"| `IMAGE` | Docker 映像檔 | `syft <image> -o cyclonedx-json`（需要掛載 docker.sock） |\n"
"| `BINARY` | 單一檔案 | `syft file:<path> -o cyclonedx-json`（失敗時退回最小 SBOM） |\n"
"| `ROOTFS` | 目錄 | `syft dir:<path> -o cyclonedx-json` |\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:148
#, no-wrap
msgid "Stage 2 — post-processing pipeline"
msgstr "Stage 2——後處理管線"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:151
msgid ""
"The `bomlens` image's entry point `run-scan` (`docker/entrypoint.sh`) takes "
"the SBOM and runs the steps in a **fixed order**. Each step is enabled by an "
"environment variable (equivalent to a CLI flag), and outputs accumulate in "
"the `ARTIFACTS` list."
msgstr ""
"`bomlens` 映像檔的進入點 `run-scan`(`docker/entrypoint.sh`) 接手 SBOM，並以"
"**固定的順序**執行各步驟。每個步驟由一個環境變數開啟（等同於一個 CLI 旗標），"
"輸出會累積到 `ARTIFACTS` 清單裡。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:153
msgid ""
"![Stage 2 post-processing: eight fixed steps from normalize to upload, each "
"gated by its environment variable](../images/diagrams/architecture-stage2-"
"steps.png)"
msgstr ""
"![Stage 2 後處理：從 normalize 到上傳共八個固定步驟，每個步驟都由各自的環境變"
"數控制](../images/diagrams/architecture-stage2-steps.png)"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:155
msgid "Step details:"
msgstr "各步驟細節："

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:166
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| # | Step | Script / tool | Condition | Output |\n"
"|---|------|-----------------|------|--------|\n"
"| ① | **Normalize** | `normalize-sbom.sh` (jq) | Always (deterministic mode with `--byte-stable`) | Updates `bom.json` |\n"
"| ② | **Deep license** | `scancode` | `--deep-license` and `/src` exists | `_scancode.json` |\n"
"| ③ | **Notice** | `generate-notice.sh` (jq) | `--notice` / `--all` | `_NOTICE.txt`, `_NOTICE.html` |\n"
"| ④ | **Security report** | `scan-security.sh` (Trivy) | `--security` / `--all` | `_security.{json,md,html}` |\n"
"| ⑤ | **Signing** | `cosign sign-blob` | `--sign` and `COSIGN_KEY` | `bom.json.sig` |\n"
"| ⑥ | **Risk report** | `generate-risk-report.sh` | Default (skip with `--no-report`) | `_risk-report.{md,html}` (plus `_conformance.*` in ANALYZE mode) |\n"
"| ⑦ | **Copy to host** | `cp` | Always | Copied to `HOST_OUTPUT_DIR` |\n"
"| ⑧ | **Upload** | `curl` | Default (skipped with `--generate-only`) | Upload to a Dependency-Track server or TRUSCA's native ingest (select with `UPLOAD_TARGET`) |\n"
msgstr ""
"| # | 步驟 | 指令碼／工具 | 條件 | 輸出 |\n"
"|---|------|-----------------|------|--------|\n"
"| ① | **正規化** | `normalize-sbom.sh` (jq) | 一律執行（加上 `--byte-stable` 為決定性模式） | 更新 `bom.json` |\n"
"| ② | **精確授權條款** | `scancode` | `--deep-license` 且 `/src` 存在 | `_scancode.json` |\n"
"| ③ | **授權聲明** | `generate-notice.sh` (jq) | `--notice` / `--all` | `_NOTICE.txt`、`_NOTICE.html` |\n"
"| ④ | **安全報告** | `scan-security.sh` (Trivy) | `--security` / `--all` | `_security.{json,md,html}` |\n"
"| ⑤ | **簽章** | `cosign sign-blob` | `--sign` 且有 `COSIGN_KEY` | `bom.json.sig` |\n"
"| ⑥ | **風險報告** | `generate-risk-report.sh` | 預設（用 `--no-report` 略過） | `_risk-report.{md,html}`（ANALYZE 模式另有 `_conformance.*`） |\n"
"| ⑦ | **複製到主機** | `cp` | 一律執行 | 複製到 `HOST_OUTPUT_DIR` |\n"
"| ⑧ | **上傳** | `curl` | 預設（用 `--generate-only` 略過） | 上傳到 Dependency-Track 伺服器或 TRUSCA 的原生 ingest（用 `UPLOAD_TARGET` 選擇） |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:168
#, no-wrap
msgid "> **Why the order is fixed**: normalization stabilizes the input for every later step, so it runs first; signing must target the final `bom.json`, so it runs last. Each step is best-effort — failures are handled with `|| true` or a warning and do not abort the whole scan (signing and upload excepted).\n"
msgstr "> **為什麼順序是固定的**：正規化會把後續每個步驟的輸入穩定下來，所以最先執行；簽章必須針對最終的 `bom.json`，所以最後執行。每個步驟都是盡力而為——失敗時以 `|| true` 或警告處理，不會中止整次掃描（簽章與上傳例外）。\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:171
#, no-wrap
msgid "Branching by input type"
msgstr "依輸入類型分流"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:174
msgid ""
"`scan-sbom.sh` determines the mode automatically from `--git`/`--analyze`/`--"
"firmware` and the `--target` value."
msgstr ""
"`scan-sbom.sh` 會依 `--git`／`--analyze`／`--firmware` 以及 `--target` 的值自"
"動決定模式。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:176
msgid "The checks run top to bottom; the first matching branch wins."
msgstr "判定由上往下進行，第一個符合的分支勝出。"

#. type: Fenced code block (mermaid)
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:177
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"flowchart TD\n"
"    D1{\"--git URL<br/>or URL-like target?\"} -->|yes| R1[\"clone → MODE=SOURCE\"]\n"
"    D1 -->|no| D2{\"--target<br/>*.zip / *.tar.gz?\"}\n"
"    D2 -->|yes| R2[\"extract → MODE=SOURCE\"]\n"
"    D2 -->|no| D3{\"--analyze sbom?\"}\n"
"    D3 -->|yes| R3[\"MODE=ANALYZE<br/>validate + convert to CDX\"]\n"
"    D3 -->|no| D4{\"target omitted?\"}\n"
"    D4 -->|yes| R4[\"MODE=SOURCE<br/>current directory → cdxgen\"]\n"
"    D4 -->|no| D5{\"existing file?\"}\n"
"    D5 -->|\"yes · --firmware/extension\"| R5[\"MODE=FIRMWARE<br/>opt-in firmware image\"]\n"
"    D5 -->|\"yes · otherwise\"| R6[\"MODE=BINARY → syft\"]\n"
"    D5 -->|no| D6{\"existing directory?\"}\n"
"    D6 -->|yes| R7[\"MODE=ROOTFS → syft\"]\n"
"    D6 -->|no| R8[\"MODE=IMAGE → syft\"]\n"
msgstr ""
"flowchart TD\n"
"    D1{\"--git URL<br/>或類似 URL 的 target？\"} -->|是| R1[\"clone → MODE=SOURCE\"]\n"
"    D1 -->|否| D2{\"--target<br/>*.zip / *.tar.gz？\"}\n"
"    D2 -->|是| R2[\"解壓縮 → MODE=SOURCE\"]\n"
"    D2 -->|否| D3{\"--analyze sbom？\"}\n"
"    D3 -->|是| R3[\"MODE=ANALYZE<br/>驗證 + 轉成 CDX\"]\n"
"    D3 -->|否| D4{\"未指定 target？\"}\n"
"    D4 -->|是| R4[\"MODE=SOURCE<br/>目前目錄 → cdxgen\"]\n"
"    D4 -->|否| D5{\"存在的檔案？\"}\n"
"    D5 -->|\"是 · --firmware/副檔名\"| R5[\"MODE=FIRMWARE<br/>opt-in 韌體映像檔\"]\n"
"    D5 -->|\"是 · 其他\"| R6[\"MODE=BINARY → syft\"]\n"
"    D5 -->|否| D6{\"存在的目錄？\"}\n"
"    D6 -->|是| R7[\"MODE=ROOTFS → syft\"]\n"
"    D6 -->|否| R8[\"MODE=IMAGE → syft\"]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:195
#, no-wrap
msgid "> Independently of the branching above, `--ui` starts `MODE=UI` (the web server `server.py`) and runs subsequent scans through the form or file upload.\n"
msgstr "> 與上面的分流無關，`--ui` 會啟動 `MODE=UI`（網頁伺服器 `server.py`），後續的掃描則透過表單或檔案上傳執行。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:207
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Mode | Trigger | Generation tool | Notes |\n"
"|------|--------|-----------|------|\n"
"| `SOURCE` | No target, `--git <url>`, or `--target *.zip/*.tar.gz` | cdxgen | Language detection selects the per-language image. Git targets are cloned; archives are extracted and treated as source. (The web UI's SOURCE uses `syft dir:` inside the container) |\n"
"| `ANALYZE` | `--analyze <sbom>` (alias `--sbom`) | — | Validates a supplier SBOM (CycloneDX/SPDX), converts it to CDX, and re-aggregates. Produces `_conformance.*` |\n"
"| `FIRMWARE` | `--target <file> --firmware`, or a firmware file extension | unblob + syft + cve-bin-tool | **Opt-in image** `bomlens-firmware`. Details in the [firmware analysis guide](../guides/firmware.md) |\n"
"| `BINARY` | `--target <file>` | syft | `file:` scheme |\n"
"| `ROOTFS` | `--target <directory>` | syft | `dir:` scheme |\n"
"| `IMAGE` | `--target <image name>` | syft | docker.sock mount |\n"
"| `AIBOM` | `--model <owner/name>` | OWASP AIBOM Generator | **Opt-in image** `bomlens-aibom`. CycloneDX 1.7 ML-BOM from a HuggingFace model card; adds a G7 conformance check |\n"
"| `MODELFILE` | `--model-file <path>` | `identify-model-file.py` (stdlib) | Base image, offline. CycloneDX 1.7 ML-BOM read from a model file's own header (GGUF, safetensors, PyTorch, pickle, npz, npy, ONNX); adds the same G7 check |\n"
"| `UI` | `--ui` | — | Browser UI; runs every scan target type through the form or file upload |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 模式 | 觸發條件 | 產生工具 | 備註 |\n"
"|------|--------|-----------|------|\n"
"| `SOURCE` | 未指定目標、`--git <url>`，或 `--target *.zip/*.tar.gz` | cdxgen | 語言偵測決定要用哪個語言映像檔。git 目標會被 clone；壓縮檔會解開後當作原始碼處理。（網頁介面的 SOURCE 是在容器內使用 `syft dir:`） |\n"
"| `ANALYZE` | `--analyze <sbom>`（別名 `--sbom`） | — | 驗證供應者 SBOM (CycloneDX/SPDX)、轉成 CDX 並重新彙整。會產生 `_conformance.*` |\n"
"| `FIRMWARE` | `--target <file> --firmware`，或韌體副檔名 | unblob + syft + cve-bin-tool | **opt-in 映像檔** `bomlens-firmware`。細節請看[韌體分析指南](../guides/firmware.md) |\n"
"| `BINARY` | `--target <file>` | syft | `file:` scheme |\n"
"| `ROOTFS` | `--target <directory>` | syft | `dir:` scheme |\n"
"| `IMAGE` | `--target <image name>` | syft | 掛載 docker.sock |\n"
"| `AIBOM` | `--model <owner/name>` | OWASP AIBOM Generator | **opt-in 映像檔** `bomlens-aibom`。由 HuggingFace 模型卡產生 CycloneDX 1.7 ML-BOM，並加上 G7 符合性檢查 |\n"
"| `MODELFILE` | `--model-file <path>` | `identify-model-file.py`（標準函式庫） | 基礎映像檔，離線運作。從模型檔案自身的標頭讀出 CycloneDX 1.7 ML-BOM（GGUF、safetensors、PyTorch、pickle、npz、npy、ONNX）；加上同樣的 G7 檢查 |\n"
"| `UI` | `--ui` | — | 瀏覽器介面；所有掃描目標類型都透過表單或檔案上傳執行 |\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:210
#, no-wrap
msgid "Flag-to-step mapping"
msgstr "旗標與步驟的對應 {#flag-to-step-mapping}"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:213
msgid ""
"How CLI flags translate into environment variables and which steps they "
"enable (`scan-sbom.sh` converts them and passes them to `entrypoint.sh`)."
msgstr ""
"CLI 旗標會轉換成哪些環境變數、又會開啟哪些步驟（由 `scan-sbom.sh` 轉換後傳給 "
"`entrypoint.sh`）。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:231
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Flag | Environment variable | Steps enabled |\n"
"|--------|----------|-------------|\n"
"| (default) | `GENERATE_REPORT=true` (plus notice and security) | normalize + **risk report** + upload |\n"
"| `--no-report` | `GENERATE_REPORT=false` | Does not force-enable the risk report, notice, or security steps |\n"
"| `--notice` | `GENERATE_NOTICE=true` | ③ notice |\n"
"| `--security` | `GENERATE_SECURITY=true` | ④ security report |\n"
"| `--all` | Both of the above | ③ + ④ |\n"
"| `--git <url>` / `--branch` | (cloned on the host) | SOURCE input collection |\n"
"| `--analyze <sbom>` | `MODE=ANALYZE` | Supplier SBOM validation, conversion, and report |\n"
"| `--firmware` | `MODE=FIRMWARE` (firmware image) | Unpack, then syft + cve-bin-tool |\n"
"| `--model <owner/name>` | `MODE=AIBOM` (aibom image) | Generate an ML-BOM from a HuggingFace model, plus a G7 check |\n"
"| `--model-file <path>` | `MODE=MODELFILE` | Read one model file's header into an ML-BOM, offline, plus a G7 check |\n"
"| `--deep-license` | `DEEP_LICENSE=true` | ② scancode |\n"
"| `--byte-stable` | `BYTE_STABLE=true` | ① deterministic normalization (also the UI's Reproducible output toggle) |\n"
"| `--sign` | `SIGN_SBOM=true` (plus `COSIGN_KEY`/`COSIGN_PASSWORD`) | ⑤ signing |\n"
"| `--generate-only` | `UPLOAD_ENABLED=false` | ⑦ skips the upload |\n"
"| `--ui` | `MODE=UI` | Web UI |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 旗標 | 環境變數 | 開啟的步驟 |\n"
"|--------|----------|-------------|\n"
"| （預設） | `GENERATE_REPORT=true`（並含授權聲明與安全） | 正規化 + **風險報告** + 上傳 |\n"
"| `--no-report` | `GENERATE_REPORT=false` | 不會強制開啟風險報告、授權聲明或安全步驟 |\n"
"| `--notice` | `GENERATE_NOTICE=true` | ③ 授權聲明 |\n"
"| `--security` | `GENERATE_SECURITY=true` | ④ 安全報告 |\n"
"| `--all` | 以上兩者 | ③ + ④ |\n"
"| `--git <url>` / `--branch` | （在主機上 clone） | 收集 SOURCE 輸入 |\n"
"| `--analyze <sbom>` | `MODE=ANALYZE` | 供應者 SBOM 的驗證、轉換與報告 |\n"
"| `--firmware` | `MODE=FIRMWARE`（韌體映像檔） | 先解包，再執行 syft + cve-bin-tool |\n"
"| `--model <owner/name>` | `MODE=AIBOM`（aibom 映像檔） | 從 HuggingFace 模型產生 ML-BOM，並加上 G7 檢查 |\n"
"| `--model-file <path>` | `MODE=MODELFILE` | 離線讀取單一模型檔案的標頭產生 ML-BOM，並加上 G7 檢查 |\n"
"| `--deep-license` | `DEEP_LICENSE=true` | ② scancode |\n"
"| `--byte-stable` | `BYTE_STABLE=true` | ① 決定性的正規化（也就是網頁介面的「可重現的輸出」開關） |\n"
"| `--sign` | `SIGN_SBOM=true`（並含 `COSIGN_KEY`/`COSIGN_PASSWORD`） | ⑤ 簽章 |\n"
"| `--generate-only` | `UPLOAD_ENABLED=false` | ⑦ 略過上傳 |\n"
"| `--ui` | `MODE=UI` | 網頁介面 |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:233
#, no-wrap
msgid "> The **risk report** (`_risk-report.{md,html}`) is generated **by default** in every mode (it aggregates licenses and vulnerabilities). To support it, the notice and security scans are turned on automatically alongside it; disable with `--no-report`.\n"
msgstr "> **風險報告** (`_risk-report.{md,html}`) 在所有模式下都會**預設產生**（它會彙整授權條款與弱點）。為了支援它，授權聲明與安全掃描會自動一併開啟；要停用請用 `--no-report`。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:235
msgid ""
"For how to use each feature, see the [notice and security report guide](../"
"guides/reports.md)."
msgstr "各項功能的使用方式請看[授權聲明與安全報告指南](../guides/reports.md)。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:238
#, no-wrap
msgid "Artifacts"
msgstr "產出物"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:241
msgid ""
"`{P}` is the project name, `{V}` the version (special characters are "
"normalized to `_`)."
msgstr "`{P}` 是專案名稱，`{V}` 是版本（特殊字元會正規化為 `_`）。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:251
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| File | Generated when |\n"
"|------|-----------|\n"
"| `{Project}_{Version}_bom.json` | Always (CycloneDX 1.6; a 1.7 ML-BOM for AI models) |\n"
"| `{Project}_{Version}_NOTICE.txt` / `.html` / `.pdf` | `--notice` / `--all` / default risk report generation (PDF only in an `SBOM_PDF` build) |\n"
"| `{Project}_{Version}_security.json` / `.md` / `.html` | `--security` / `--all` / default risk report generation |\n"
"| `{Project}_{Version}_risk-report.md` / `.html` | Default (all modes) — skip with `--no-report` |\n"
"| `{Project}_{Version}_conformance.json` / `.md` / `.html` | `--analyze` (supplier SBOM validation) |\n"
"| `{Project}_{Version}_scancode.json` | `--deep-license` |\n"
"| `{Project}_{Version}_bom.json.sig` | `--sign` |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 檔案 | 產生條件 |\n"
"|------|-----------|\n"
"| `{Project}_{Version}_bom.json` | 一律產生（CycloneDX 1.6；AI 模型為 1.7 ML-BOM） |\n"
"| `{Project}_{Version}_NOTICE.txt` / `.html` / `.pdf` | `--notice` / `--all` / 預設產生風險報告時（PDF 只在 `SBOM_PDF` 建置中提供） |\n"
"| `{Project}_{Version}_security.json` / `.md` / `.html` | `--security` / `--all` / 預設產生風險報告時 |\n"
"| `{Project}_{Version}_risk-report.md` / `.html` | 預設（所有模式）——用 `--no-report` 略過 |\n"
"| `{Project}_{Version}_conformance.json` / `.md` / `.html` | `--analyze`（供應者 SBOM 驗證） |\n"
"| `{Project}_{Version}_scancode.json` | `--deep-license` |\n"
"| `{Project}_{Version}_bom.json.sig` | `--sign` |\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:254
#, no-wrap
msgid "Extension points"
msgstr "擴充點"

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:256
#, no-wrap
msgid "Adding support for a new language"
msgstr "新增一種語言的支援"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:260
msgid ""
"Check whether an official cdxgen image exists for the language — if so, add "
"it to the routing table."
msgstr "確認該語言是否有 cdxgen 官方映像檔——有的話就加進分流表。"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:260
msgid ""
"If cdxgen cannot resolve transitive dependencies automatically, add "
"preparation logic to `docker/lib/build-prep.sh`."
msgstr ""
"如果 cdxgen 無法自動解析間接相依，就在 `docker/lib/build-prep.sh` 加入準備邏"
"輯。"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:260
msgid ""
"Add an example project under `examples/{language}/` and a test case in "
"`tests/cases/test-{language}.sh`."
msgstr ""
"在 `examples/{language}/` 底下加一個範例專案，並在 `tests/cases/test-"
"{language}.sh` 加一個測試案例。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:262
msgid ""
"For the full procedure, see the [package manager guide](../contribute/"
"package-managers.md)."
msgstr "完整流程請看[套件管理器指南](../contribute/package-managers.md)。"

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:263
#, no-wrap
msgid "Adding a new post-processing step"
msgstr "新增一個後處理步驟"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:265
msgid ""
"Add a helper script under `docker/lib/`, call it from the shared pipeline "
"section of `entrypoint.sh` (after normalization) behind an environment "
"variable guard, and append its outputs to `ARTIFACTS`. Place it **before** "
"the signing step so its outputs are covered by the signature."
msgstr ""
"在 `docker/lib/` 底下加一個輔助指令碼，從 `entrypoint.sh` 的共用管線區段（正"
"規化之後）以環境變數守門的方式呼叫它，並把它的輸出附加到 `ARTIFACTS`。請把它"
"放在簽章步驟**之前**，這樣它的輸出才會被簽章涵蓋。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:268
#, no-wrap
msgid "Design principles"
msgstr "設計原則"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:276
msgid ""
"**Isolation** — all analysis runs in Docker containers; the host environment "
"stays untouched."
msgstr "**隔離**——所有分析都在 Docker 容器裡執行，主機環境不受影響。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:276
msgid ""
"**Separation of concerns** — generation (Stage 1) and post-processing (Stage "
"2) are split, keeping the post-processing image small."
msgstr ""
"**關注點分離**——把產生 (Stage 1) 與後處理 (Stage 2) 拆開，讓後處理映像檔保持"
"精簡。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:276
msgid ""
"**Reproducibility** — tool versions are pinned via `ARG`; `--byte-stable` "
"produces byte-identical output."
msgstr ""
"**可重現**——工具版本以 `ARG` 固定；`--byte-stable` 會產生位元組完全相同的輸"
"出。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:276
msgid "**Standards compliance** — conforms to the CycloneDX 1.6 specification."
msgstr "**符合標準**——遵循 CycloneDX 1.6 規格。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:276
msgid ""
"**Robustness** — post-processing steps are best-effort and do not abort the "
"whole scan."
msgstr "**強韌**——後處理步驟都是盡力而為，不會中止整次掃描。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:276
msgid ""
"**Single interface** — every language and mode is invoked through the one "
"`scan-sbom.sh`."
msgstr "**單一介面**——所有語言與模式都透過同一個 `scan-sbom.sh` 呼叫。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:279
#, no-wrap
msgid "Division of roles (TRUSCA)"
msgstr "角色分工 (TRUSCA)"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:282
msgid ""
"BomLens specializes in **generation**. **Governance** — company-wide project "
"management, vulnerability triage, and license policy gates — is delegated to "
"the sister project [TRUSCA](https://github.com/trustedoss/trusca) (formerly "
"TrustedOSS Portal). Both tools share cdxgen and Trivy, so the artifacts "
"(CycloneDX) are directly compatible."
msgstr ""
"BomLens 專精於**產生**。**治理**——全公司的專案管理、弱點分類與授權條款政策關"
"卡——則交給姊妹專案 [TRUSCA](https://github.com/trustedoss/trusca)（前身為 "
"TrustedOSS Portal）。兩個工具共用 cdxgen 與 Trivy，因此產出物 (CycloneDX) 可"
"以直接互通。"

#. type: Fenced code block (mermaid)
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:283
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"flowchart TB\n"
"    subgraph dev[\"Developer · single project\"]\n"
"        direction LR\n"
"        A[\"Source / image / binary\"] --> B[\"BomLens\"]\n"
"        B --> C[\"SBOM\"]\n"
"        B --> D[\"Notice\"]\n"
"        B --> E[\"Security report\"]\n"
"    end\n"
"    subgraph org[\"Organization · central management\"]\n"
"        direction LR\n"
"        F[\"TRUSCA\"] --> G[\"Vulnerability triage\"]\n"
"        F --> H[\"License policy gate\"]\n"
"        F --> I[\"Project dashboard\"]\n"
"    end\n"
"    C -. upload .-> F\n"
msgstr ""
"flowchart TB\n"
"    subgraph dev[\"開發者 · 單一專案\"]\n"
"        direction LR\n"
"        A[\"原始碼 / 映像檔 / 二進位檔\"] --> B[\"BomLens\"]\n"
"        B --> C[\"SBOM\"]\n"
"        B --> D[\"授權聲明\"]\n"
"        B --> E[\"安全報告\"]\n"
"    end\n"
"    subgraph org[\"組織 · 集中管理\"]\n"
"        direction LR\n"
"        F[\"TRUSCA\"] --> G[\"弱點 triage\"]\n"
"        F --> H[\"授權條款政策關卡\"]\n"
"        F --> I[\"專案儀表板\"]\n"
"    end\n"
"    C -. 上傳 .-> F\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:303
#, no-wrap
msgid "> **Related**: [Pipeline by input type](pipeline-by-input.md) | [Getting started](../start/first-scan.md) | [CLI reference](../reference/cli.md) | [Use the Docker image directly](../reference/docker-image.md)\n"
msgstr "> **相關文件**：[各輸入類型的流程](pipeline-by-input.md) | [快速開始](../start/first-scan.md) | [CLI 參考](../reference/cli.md) | [直接使用 Docker 映像檔](../reference/docker-image.md)\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#: docs/concepts/local-first.md:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Why BomLens runs locally by design — what stays on your machine, how it works offline, and where governance is handled instead."
msgstr "BomLens 為什麼刻意在本機執行——哪些內容留在你的機器上、如何在離線環境運作，以及治理工作交由何處處理。"

#. type: Title #
#: docs/concepts/local-first.md:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Local-first by design"
msgstr "本機優先的設計"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/local-first.md:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Nothing leaves your machine"
msgstr "分析對象不會離開你的機器"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/local-first.md:10
msgid ""
"BomLens runs locally, with no SaaS backend. What you analyze — source code, "
"firmware, or an SBOM someone handed you — is never sent to an external "
"service. The scan happens inside a local Docker container and ends there. "
"The outputs are written only to the directory you ran it from."
msgstr ""
"BomLens 在本機執行，沒有 SaaS 後端。你所分析的東西——原始碼、韌體，或別人交給"
"你的 SBOM——絕不會傳送到外部服務。掃描在本機的 Docker 容器中進行，也在那裡結"
"束。產出物只會寫到你執行指令時所在的目錄。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/local-first.md:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Works in closed and offline networks"
msgstr "可在封閉網路與離線環境使用"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/local-first.md:14
msgid ""
"BomLens runs on air-gapped and offline networks. The few features that need "
"an external lookup can be turned off, and everything else is still produced. "
"The security report's EPSS and CISA KEV enrichment is the main case: set "
"`SECURITY_ENRICH=false` to skip it and still generate the rest of the "
"report. License lookups can likewise be skipped with `FETCH_LICENSE=false`. "
"Going the other way, three checks that sound like they need the network do "
"not: end-of-life flagging, the malicious-package check and the outbound-"
"license conflict check all read data baked into the image at build time, so "
"they keep working with no connection at all."
msgstr ""
"BomLens 可在實體隔離 (air-gapped) 與離線網路中執行。少數需要對外查詢的功能可"
"以關閉，其餘一切照樣產生。安全報告的 EPSS 與 CISA KEV 補強是主要的例子：設定 "
"`SECURITY_ENRICH=false` 就會略過它，報告的其餘部分仍會產生。授權條款查詢同樣"
"可以用 `FETCH_LICENSE=false` 略過。反過來說，有三項檢查聽起來需要網路，其實不"
"需要：已終止支援標記、惡意套件檢查與對外授權條款衝突檢查，讀取的都是建置映像"
"檔時就寫進去的資料，因此完全沒有連線也照樣運作。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/local-first.md:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Standard, portable outputs"
msgstr "標準且可攜的產出物"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/local-first.md:18
msgid ""
"The outputs use standard formats — the SBOM is CycloneDX 1.6. They are not "
"tied to any single vendor, so you can verify and reuse them anywhere. When "
"you need a byte-for-byte identical SBOM for the same input, use `--byte-"
"stable`."
msgstr ""
"產出物採用標準格式——SBOM 是 CycloneDX 1.6。它們不綁定任何單一廠商，因此你可以"
"在任何地方驗證與再利用。若需要同一份輸入產生逐位元組完全相同的 SBOM，請使用 "
"`--byte-stable`。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/local-first.md:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "One scanner behind every entry point"
msgstr "每個入口背後都是同一個掃描器"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/local-first.md:22
msgid ""
"The three entry points — the CLI, the web UI, and the desktop app — all use "
"the same local scanner container. Only the way you drive the tool differs; "
"the behavior and the outputs are the same."
msgstr ""
"CLI、網頁介面與桌面版應用程式這三個入口，全都使用同一個本機掃描器容器。差別只"
"在你操作工具的方式，行為與產出物完全相同。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/local-first.md:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "BomLens generates; TRUSCA governs"
msgstr "BomLens 負責產生，TRUSCA 負責治理"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/local-first.md:26
msgid ""
"BomLens focuses on generation. Governance — organization-wide project "
"management, vulnerability triage, license policy gates — is delegated to the "
"sister project TRUSCA (formerly TrustedOSS Portal, <https://github.com/"
"trustedoss/trusca>). The two tools exchange CycloneDX outputs directly."
msgstr ""
"BomLens 專注於產生。治理——全組織的專案管理、弱點分級處理、授權條款政策閘門——"
"則交給姊妹專案 TRUSCA（前身為 TrustedOSS Portal，<https://github.com/"
"trustedoss/trusca>）。兩個工具直接交換 CycloneDX 產出物。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/local-first.md:27 docs/concepts/reports-explained.md:91
#, no-wrap
msgid "Related"
msgstr "相關文件"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/local-first.md:29
msgid ""
"For how the two-stage pipeline works, see [How BomLens works]"
"(architecture.md). For the kinds of outputs, see the [artifacts reference]"
"(../reference/artifacts.md)."
msgstr ""
"兩階段管線的運作方式請看[BomLens 運作方式](architecture.md)；產出物的種類請看"
"[產出物參考](../reference/artifacts.md)。"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#: docs/concepts/pipeline-by-input.md:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "How BomLens processes each input type — source code (with ScanCode and SCANOSS options), firmware, a received SBOM, and an AI model — showing which open-source tool runs at each step, with diagrams."
msgstr "BomLens 如何處理各種輸入類型——原始碼（含 ScanCode 與 SCANOSS 選項）、韌體、收到的 SBOM 與 AI 模型——並以圖解說明每個步驟由哪個開放原始碼工具執行。"

#. type: Title #
#: docs/concepts/pipeline-by-input.md:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Pipeline by input type"
msgstr "各輸入類型的流程"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/pipeline-by-input.md:8
msgid ""
"BomLens accepts several kinds of input — source code, firmware, an SBOM you "
"received, and an AI model. Each has its own **generation** step that builds "
"a CycloneDX SBOM, and then they all converge on one shared **post-"
"processing** pipeline (notice, security, risk report). This page walks the "
"tool flow for each input. For the high-level two-stage view, see "
"[Architecture](architecture.md)."
msgstr ""
"BomLens 接受多種輸入：原始碼、韌體、你收到的 SBOM，以及 AI 模型。每一種都有自"
"己的**產生**步驟來建立 CycloneDX SBOM，之後全部匯流到同一套共用的**後處理**管"
"線（授權聲明、安全、風險報告）。這一頁逐一說明各輸入的工具流程。兩階段的整體"
"樣貌請看[架構](architecture.md)。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/pipeline-by-input.md:10
msgid ""
"![Four input types converge on per-input generation and one shared post-"
"processing pipeline](../images/diagrams/pipeline-overview.png)"
msgstr ""
"![四種輸入各自經過對應的產生步驟，最後匯流到同一套共用的後處理管線](../"
"images/diagrams/pipeline-overview.png)"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/pipeline-by-input.md:12
msgid ""
"Every external tool below is open source; the table in [Open-source tools "
"used](#open-source-tools-used) lists each one's role, license, and project "
"link."
msgstr ""
"下面提到的外部工具全部都是開放原始碼；[使用到的開放原始碼工具](#open-source-"
"tools-used)表格整理了每個工具的角色、授權條款與專案連結。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/pipeline-by-input.md:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Source code"
msgstr "原始碼"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/pipeline-by-input.md:18
msgid ""
"A source folder, a GitHub URL, or a ZIP archive. Language detection picks "
"the matching official [cdxgen](https://github.com/CycloneDX/cdxgen) language "
"image, which prepares dependencies (`build-prep.sh`) and generates the SBOM. "
"When BomLens cannot run a sibling container (for example the web UI's source "
"scan), it falls back to [syft](https://github.com/anchore/syft) over the "
"directory, which captures direct dependencies from lock files."
msgstr ""
"原始碼資料夾、GitHub URL，或 ZIP 壓縮檔。語言偵測會挑出對應的官方 [cdxgen]"
"(https://github.com/CycloneDX/cdxgen) 語言映像檔，由它準備相依項目 (`build-"
"prep.sh`) 並產生 SBOM。BomLens 無法執行 sibling 容器時（例如網頁介面的原始碼"
"掃描），會後備改用 [syft](https://github.com/anchore/syft) 掃描該目錄，此時是"
"從鎖定檔案取得直接相依。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/pipeline-by-input.md:20
msgid "Two options apply to source scans only, and both are off by default."
msgstr "有兩個選項只適用於原始碼掃描，而且預設都是關閉。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/pipeline-by-input.md:23
msgid ""
"**Identify vendored OSS** (`--identify-vendored`, [SCANOSS](https://"
"github.com/scanoss/scanoss.py)) — for C/C++ and other code copied in without "
"a package manager. The SCANOSS client fingerprints files and queries the "
"hosted OSSKB service, then BomLens reconciles the matches against what the "
"package-manager scan already found and merges the rest into the SBOM."
msgstr ""
"**偵測複製進來的開放原始碼**（`--identify-vendored`，[SCANOSS](https://"
"github.com/scanoss/scanoss.py)）——適用於沒有套件管理器、直接複製納入的 C/C++ "
"等程式碼。SCANOSS 用戶端會為檔案建立指紋並查詢代管的 OSSKB 服務，接著 "
"BomLens 把比對結果與套件管理器掃描已經找到的東西相互核對，再把其餘的合併進 "
"SBOM。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/pipeline-by-input.md:23
msgid ""
"**Deep license detection** (`--deep-license`, [ScanCode Toolkit](https://"
"github.com/aboutcode-org/scancode-toolkit)) — scans first-party source for "
"license headers. It runs during post-processing and writes a separate "
"`_scancode.json`."
msgstr ""
"**精確授權條款偵測**（`--deep-license`，[ScanCode Toolkit](https://"
"github.com/aboutcode-org/scancode-toolkit)）——掃描自家原始碼裡的授權條款標"
"頭。它在後處理階段執行，並另外寫出一份 `_scancode.json`。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/pipeline-by-input.md:25
msgid ""
"![Source scan flow: language detection routes to a cdxgen image with a syft "
"fallback, then optional SCANOSS before shared post-processing](../images/"
"diagrams/pipeline-source.png)"
msgstr ""
"![原始碼掃描流程：語言偵測導向 cdxgen 映像檔並備有 syft 後備，接著在共用後處"
"理之前可選擇執行 SCANOSS](../images/diagrams/pipeline-source.png)"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/pipeline-by-input.md:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "> Container images, single binaries, and directories (root filesystems) skip cdxgen and are scanned directly by syft, then follow the same post-processing.\n"
msgstr "> 容器映像檔、單一二進位檔案與目錄（根檔案系統）會略過 cdxgen，由 syft 直接掃描，之後走同一套後處理。\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/pipeline-by-input.md:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "Firmware"
msgstr "韌體"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/pipeline-by-input.md:33
msgid ""
"A network-device firmware image (`.bin`, `.img.gz`, squashfs, and more), "
"handled by the opt-in `bomlens-firmware` image. Firmware packs an OS and "
"dozens of libraries into one sealed file, so BomLens first unpacks it, then "
"identifies components in two ways: package-manager metadata with syft, and "
"stripped static binaries with [cve-bin-tool](https://github.com/intel/cve-"
"bin-tool) (which also matches CVEs). The two results merge, and a CPE/SPDX "
"enrichment step fills identifiers for a curated list of well-known OSS "
"(busybox, dropbear, dnsmasq, …) so Trivy and the notice can use them."
msgstr ""
"網路裝置的韌體映像檔（`.bin`、`.img.gz`、squashfs 等），由 opt-in 的 "
"`bomlens-firmware` 映像檔負責。韌體把一套作業系統與數十個函式庫封在同一個檔案"
"裡，因此 BomLens 會先解開封裝，再以兩種方式識別元件：套件管理器的後設資料交"
"給 syft，經過 strip 的靜態二進位檔案交給 [cve-bin-tool](https://github.com/"
"intel/cve-bin-tool)（它同時也會比對 CVE）。兩份結果合併之後，還有一個 CPE/"
"SPDX 補強步驟，為一份人工整理的知名開放原始碼清單（busybox、dropbear、"
"dnsmasq…）填上識別碼，好讓 Trivy 與授權聲明能夠使用。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/pipeline-by-input.md:35
msgid ""
"Unpacking tries tools in order, using the first that succeeds: [unblob]"
"(https://github.com/onekey-sec/unblob) (primary), `unsquashfs` for standard "
"squashfs, `7z` for the container formats Windows deliveries arrive in, then "
"`binwalk`."
msgstr ""
"解開封裝會依序嘗試各個工具，用第一個成功的：[unblob](https://github.com/"
"onekey-sec/unblob)（主要）、標準 squashfs 用 `unsquashfs`、Windows 交付物所使"
"用的容器格式用 `7z`，然後是 `binwalk`。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/pipeline-by-input.md:37
msgid ""
"![Firmware flow: unpack, find the root filesystem, scan with syft and cve-"
"bin-tool in parallel, then merge, enrich, and post-process](../images/"
"diagrams/pipeline-firmware.png)"
msgstr ""
"![韌體流程：解開封裝、找出根檔案系統、以 syft 與 cve-bin-tool 並行掃描，接著"
"合併、補強並進行後處理](../images/diagrams/pipeline-firmware.png)"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/pipeline-by-input.md:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "> The firmware tools are GPL-family, so they live only in the `bomlens-firmware` image and the base image installs none of them. See the [firmware guide](../guides/firmware.md) and its limits.\n"
msgstr "> 韌體工具屬於 GPL 家族，因此只放在 `bomlens-firmware` 映像檔裡，基礎映像檔一個都不安裝。請看[韌體指南](../guides/firmware.md)以及它的限制。\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/pipeline-by-input.md:42
#, no-wrap
msgid "Received SBOM"
msgstr "收到的 SBOM"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/pipeline-by-input.md:45
msgid ""
"An SBOM (CycloneDX or SPDX) received from a supplier or another team — no "
"source code needed. BomLens first checks it against the quality criteria and "
"writes a conformance report, then normalizes the input to CycloneDX so the "
"rest of the pipeline can analyze it. SPDX is converted with `syft convert` "
"(a `jq` fallback handles SPDX JSON if syft is unavailable). Notice, "
"security, and the risk report are always produced in this mode."
msgstr ""
"從供應者或其他團隊收到的 SBOM（CycloneDX 或 SPDX），不需要原始碼。BomLens 會"
"先依品質標準檢查它並寫出符合性報告，接著把輸入正規化為 CycloneDX，讓管線的其"
"餘步驟能夠分析。SPDX 以 `syft convert` 轉換（syft 無法使用時，由 `jq` 後備處"
"理 SPDX JSON）。這個模式一律會產生授權聲明、安全與風險報告。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/pipeline-by-input.md:47
msgid ""
"![Received SBOM flow: validate for conformance, convert SPDX to CycloneDX, "
"then shared post-processing](../images/diagrams/pipeline-analyze.png)"
msgstr ""
"![收到的 SBOM 流程：驗證符合性、把 SPDX 轉為 CycloneDX，然後進入共用後處理]"
"(../images/diagrams/pipeline-analyze.png)"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/pipeline-by-input.md:49
#, no-wrap
msgid "> Validation is based on the original input before conversion, so SPDX is checked as SPDX. Details are in the [supplier SBOM guide](../guides/supplier-sbom.md).\n"
msgstr "> 驗證是以轉換前的原始輸入為準，所以 SPDX 會以 SPDX 的身分檢查。細節在[供應者 SBOM 指南](../guides/supplier-sbom.md)。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/pipeline-by-input.md:51
msgid ""
"A Yocto build directory enters here too. Pointing `--target` at one is "
"recognized, and the image SBOM the build published under `tmp/deploy/images/"
"` takes this same path — read by a dedicated parser that keeps the installed "
"package set and the vulnerability verdicts the build recorded, rather than "
"by the generic SPDX conversion."
msgstr ""
"Yocto 建置目錄也從這裡進來。把 `--target` 指向建置目錄會被辨識出來，建置發佈"
"在 `tmp/deploy/images/` 底下的映像檔 SBOM 就走這同一條路徑——不是交給一般的 "
"SPDX 轉換，而是由專用的解析器讀取，以保留已安裝的套件集合與建置當時記錄的弱點"
"判定。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/pipeline-by-input.md:54
#, no-wrap
msgid "AI model"
msgstr "AI 模型 {#ai-model}"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/pipeline-by-input.md:57
msgid ""
"A HuggingFace model id (`org/model`), handled by the opt-in `bomlens-aibom` "
"image. The [OWASP AIBOM Generator](https://github.com/GenAI-Security-Project/"
"aibom-generator) fetches the model-card metadata over the network and builds "
"a CycloneDX 1.7 ML-BOM centered on the model and its datasets. Post-"
"processing then adds a G7 minimum-element conformance check. Because an AI "
"model has no package CVEs, the security report is skipped."
msgstr ""
"HuggingFace 的模型 id (`org/model`)，由 opt-in 的 `bomlens-aibom` 映像檔負"
"責。[OWASP AIBOM Generator](https://github.com/GenAI-Security-Project/aibom-"
"generator) 會透過網路取得模型卡的後設資料，建立以模型與其資料集為核心的 "
"CycloneDX 1.7 ML-BOM。後處理接著加上 G7 最低要素的符合性檢查。AI 模型沒有套"
"件 CVE，因此會略過安全報告。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/pipeline-by-input.md:59
msgid ""
"![AI model flow: the OWASP AIBOM Generator builds a CycloneDX 1.7 ML-BOM "
"that goes through shared post-processing](../images/diagrams/pipeline-ai-"
"model.png)"
msgstr ""
"![AI 模型流程：OWASP AIBOM Generator 建立 CycloneDX 1.7 ML-BOM，再經過共用後"
"處理](../images/diagrams/pipeline-ai-model.png)"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/pipeline-by-input.md:61
msgid ""
"There is a second AI input that runs entirely in the base image: a model "
"**file** (`--model-file`, or a model upload in the web UI). No generator and "
"no network are involved — a stdlib reader parses the file's own header, "
"decides the format from its magic bytes rather than its name, hashes the "
"file, and writes the same CycloneDX 1.7 ML-BOM shape, which then takes the "
"identical post-processing. It is the path for weights a supplier sent you "
"and for models that were never published. What it can fill depends on the "
"format: GGUF declares a name, a license and an architecture, safetensors "
"usually declares only tensor shapes, and a file that declares neither still "
"contributes its integrity hash."
msgstr ""
"AI 輸入還有第二條路徑，完全在基礎映像檔裡執行：模型**檔案**（`--model-file`，"
"在網頁介面則是上傳模型檔案）。這條路徑不用產生器也不用網路——以標準函式庫寫成"
"的讀取器會解析檔案自身的標頭，依魔術位元組而非檔名判斷格式，計算檔案的雜湊"
"值，然後寫出同樣形狀的 CycloneDX 1.7 ML-BOM，之後的後處理完全相同。供應者交給"
"你的權重，以及從未發佈過的模型，走的就是這條路徑。能填入多少資訊取決於格式："
"GGUF 會宣告名稱、授權條款與架構，safetensors 通常只宣告張量形狀，而兩者都不宣"
"告的檔案至少還能提供它的完整性雜湊值。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/pipeline-by-input.md:63
#, no-wrap
msgid "> The model card's disclosure (weights, architecture, training data, training process) and the G7 result appear in the web UI's Models & datasets and G7 sections — see the [web UI reference](../reference/ui.md). For a step-by-step walkthrough, see the [AI model guide](../guides/ai-model.md).\n"
msgstr "> 模型卡的揭露項目（權重、架構、訓練資料、訓練過程）與 G7 判定結果會顯示在網頁介面的「模型與資料集」和 G7 區段——請看[網頁介面參考](../reference/ui.md)。逐步操作說明請看 [AI 模型指南](../guides/ai-model.md)。\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/pipeline-by-input.md:66
#, no-wrap
msgid "Shared post-processing"
msgstr "共用的後處理"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/pipeline-by-input.md:69
msgid ""
"Whatever the input, the SBOM flows through the same ordered steps. "
"Normalization runs first to stabilize the input for every later step; "
"signing runs last so it covers the final SBOM. Dashed steps are optional or "
"input-specific. Each step is best-effort — a failure is skipped with a "
"warning rather than aborting the scan (signing and upload excepted)."
msgstr "無論採用何種輸入，SBOM 都會依照相同的固定順序進行處理。首先執行正規化，以確保後續各步驟的輸入一致；最後執行簽章，以涵蓋最終產生的 SBOM。虛線表示選用或僅適用於特定輸入的步驟。除簽章與上傳外，各步驟均採盡力而為 (best-effort) 的方式執行；若執行失敗，會發出警告並略過該步驟，而不會中止整個掃描程序。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/pipeline-by-input.md:71
msgid ""
"![Shared post-processing steps in order from normalize to artifacts, with "
"optional steps dashed](../images/diagrams/pipeline-postprocess.png)"
msgstr ""
"![共用後處理步驟依序從正規化到產出物，選用步驟以虛線標示](../images/diagrams/"
"pipeline-postprocess.png)"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/pipeline-by-input.md:73
msgid ""
"The risk report is generated by default in every mode (it aggregates "
"licenses and vulnerabilities); skip it with `--no-report`. For the step-by-"
"step flag mapping, see [Architecture](architecture.md#flag-to-step-mapping)."
msgstr ""
"風險報告在每一種模式下都預設產生（它會彙整授權條款與弱點）；要略過就用 `--no-"
"report`。各旗標對應到哪個步驟，請看[架構](architecture.md#flag-to-step-"
"mapping)。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/pipeline-by-input.md:76
#, no-wrap
msgid "Open-source tools used"
msgstr "使用到的開放原始碼工具 {#open-source-tools-used}"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/pipeline-by-input.md:79
msgid ""
"Every analysis tool is open source. The tools installed into the base image "
"are permissively licensed; the GPL ones are isolated in the opt-in `bomlens-"
"firmware` image, and the AI generator in `bomlens-aibom`. Every image also "
"carries the GPL system packages of its Debian base, as any Linux image does "
"— see [Third-party licenses](https://github.com/sktelecom/bomlens/blob/main/"
"THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md)."
msgstr ""
"所有分析工具都是開放原始碼。裝進基礎映像檔的工具採用寬鬆式授權條款；GPL 的工"
"具隔離在 opt-in 的 `bomlens-firmware` 映像檔，AI 產生器則隔離在 `bomlens-"
"aibom`。就像任何 Linux 映像檔一樣，每個映像檔也都帶有其 Debian 基底的 GPL 系"
"統套件——請看[第三方授權條款](https://github.com/sktelecom/bomlens/blob/main/"
"THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md)。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/pipeline-by-input.md:94
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Tool | Role | Input | License | Image | Project |\n"
"|------|------|-------|---------|-------|---------|\n"
"| cdxgen | Generate the SBOM from source | source | Apache-2.0 | language images | [CycloneDX/cdxgen](https://github.com/CycloneDX/cdxgen) |\n"
"| syft | SBOM for images, binaries, directories, firmware rootfs | source (fallback), image, binary, rootfs, firmware | Apache-2.0 | base / firmware | [anchore/syft](https://github.com/anchore/syft) |\n"
"| SCANOSS (scanoss.py) | Identify vendored OSS via file fingerprints | source (`--identify-vendored`) | MIT | base | [scanoss/scanoss.py](https://github.com/scanoss/scanoss.py) |\n"
"| ScanCode Toolkit | Deep first-party license detection | source (`--deep-license`) | Apache-2.0 | base (opt-in) | [aboutcode-org/scancode-toolkit](https://github.com/aboutcode-org/scancode-toolkit) |\n"
"| unblob | Firmware unpacking (primary) | firmware | MIT | firmware | [onekey-sec/unblob](https://github.com/onekey-sec/unblob) |\n"
"| sasquatch | Vendor squashfs variants standard unsquashfs refuses | firmware | GPL-2.0 | firmware (opt) | [onekey-sec/sasquatch](https://github.com/onekey-sec/sasquatch) |\n"
"| cve-bin-tool | Stripped-binary identification + CVE matching | firmware | GPL-3.0 | firmware | [intel/cve-bin-tool](https://github.com/intel/cve-bin-tool) |\n"
"| OWASP AIBOM Generator | ML-BOM from a HuggingFace model card | AI model | Apache-2.0 | aibom | [GenAI-Security-Project/aibom-generator](https://github.com/GenAI-Security-Project/aibom-generator) |\n"
"| Trivy | Vulnerability (CVE) security report | all | Apache-2.0 | base | [aquasecurity/trivy](https://github.com/aquasecurity/trivy) |\n"
"| cosign | Detached SBOM signature | all (`--sign`) | Apache-2.0 | base | [sigstore/cosign](https://github.com/sigstore/cosign) |\n"
"| WeasyPrint | Optional PDF rendering of the notice | all (`SBOM_PDF` build) | BSD-3-Clause | base (opt-in) | [Kozea/WeasyPrint](https://github.com/Kozea/WeasyPrint) |\n"
"| jq | SBOM normalization, notice, report assembly | all | MIT | base | [jqlang/jq](https://github.com/jqlang/jq) |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 工具 | 角色 | 輸入 | 授權條款 | 映像檔 | 專案 |\n"
"|------|------|-------|---------|-------|---------|\n"
"| cdxgen | 從原始碼產生 SBOM | 原始碼 | Apache-2.0 | 語言映像檔 | [CycloneDX/cdxgen](https://github.com/CycloneDX/cdxgen) |\n"
"| syft | 映像檔、二進位檔案、目錄與韌體 rootfs 的 SBOM | 原始碼（後備）、映像檔、二進位檔案、rootfs、韌體 | Apache-2.0 | base / firmware | [anchore/syft](https://github.com/anchore/syft) |\n"
"| SCANOSS (scanoss.py) | 以檔案指紋偵測複製進來的開放原始碼 | 原始碼 (`--identify-vendored`) | MIT | base | [scanoss/scanoss.py](https://github.com/scanoss/scanoss.py) |\n"
"| ScanCode Toolkit | 自家原始碼的精確授權條款偵測 | 原始碼 (`--deep-license`) | Apache-2.0 | base (opt-in) | [aboutcode-org/scancode-toolkit](https://github.com/aboutcode-org/scancode-toolkit) |\n"
"| unblob | 韌體解開封裝（主要） | 韌體 | MIT | firmware | [onekey-sec/unblob](https://github.com/onekey-sec/unblob) |\n"
"| sasquatch | 標準 unsquashfs 拒絕處理的廠商變體 squashfs | 韌體 | GPL-2.0 | firmware（選用） | [onekey-sec/sasquatch](https://github.com/onekey-sec/sasquatch) |\n"
"| cve-bin-tool | 識別經過 strip 的二進位檔案 + 比對 CVE | 韌體 | GPL-3.0 | firmware | [intel/cve-bin-tool](https://github.com/intel/cve-bin-tool) |\n"
"| OWASP AIBOM Generator | 從 HuggingFace 模型卡產生 ML-BOM | AI 模型 | Apache-2.0 | aibom | [GenAI-Security-Project/aibom-generator](https://github.com/GenAI-Security-Project/aibom-generator) |\n"
"| Trivy | 弱點 (CVE) 安全報告 | 全部 | Apache-2.0 | base | [aquasecurity/trivy](https://github.com/aquasecurity/trivy) |\n"
"| cosign | SBOM 的 detached 簽章 | 全部 (`--sign`) | Apache-2.0 | base | [sigstore/cosign](https://github.com/sigstore/cosign) |\n"
"| WeasyPrint | 授權聲明的 PDF 輸出（選用） | 全部（`SBOM_PDF` 建置） | BSD-3-Clause | base (opt-in) | [Kozea/WeasyPrint](https://github.com/Kozea/WeasyPrint) |\n"
"| jq | SBOM 正規化、授權聲明與報告組裝 | 全部 | MIT | base | [jqlang/jq](https://github.com/jqlang/jq) |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/pipeline-by-input.md:96
#, no-wrap
msgid "> For the full license inventory and the GPL source-offer for the firmware image, see [THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md](https://github.com/sktelecom/bomlens/blob/main/THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md).\n"
msgstr "> 完整的授權條款清單，以及韌體映像檔的 GPL 源碼提供方式，請看 [THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md](https://github.com/sktelecom/bomlens/blob/main/THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md)。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/pipeline-by-input.md:99
#, no-wrap
msgid "> **Related**: [Architecture](architecture.md) | [Firmware guide](../guides/firmware.md) | [Supplier SBOM guide](../guides/supplier-sbom.md) | [Identify bundled OSS](../guides/identify-vendored.md)\n"
