#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#: docs/contribute/package-managers.md:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Add support for a new programming language or package manager to BomLens, step by step."
msgstr "一步一步為 BomLens 新增程式語言或套件管理器的支援。"

#. type: Title #
#: docs/contribute/package-managers.md:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Adding a package manager"
msgstr "新增套件管理器"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/contribute/package-managers.md:8
msgid ""
"This guide walks through adding support for a new programming language or "
"package manager, step by step."
msgstr "這份指南逐步說明如何為新的程式語言或套件管理器加上支援。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/contribute/package-managers.md:9 docs/guides/ai-model.md:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "Before you start"
msgstr "開始之前"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/contribute/package-managers.md:12
msgid "Check the following before adding a new language or package manager."
msgstr "新增語言或套件管理器之前，請先確認以下幾點。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/contribute/package-managers.md:16
msgid ""
"**cdxgen support**: Check the [cdxgen supported project types](https://"
"github.com/CycloneDX/cdxgen#supported-project-types). If an official cdxgen "
"language image exists, adding it to the routing table is enough."
msgstr ""
"**cdxgen 支援情況**：查看 [cdxgen 支援的專案類型](https://github.com/"
"CycloneDX/cdxgen#supported-project-types)。如果已經有官方的 cdxgen 語言映像"
"檔，只要把它加到路由表就夠了。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/contribute/package-managers.md:16
msgid ""
"**syft support**: If you need binary or image analysis, check the [syft "
"supported ecosystems](https://github.com/anchore/syft#supported-ecosystems)."
msgstr ""
"**syft 支援情況**：需要分析二進位檔案或映像檔時，查看 [syft 支援的生態系]"
"(https://github.com/anchore/syft#supported-ecosystems)。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/contribute/package-managers.md:16
msgid ""
"**Need for a custom analyzer**: Consider a custom analysis script only when "
"neither tool supports the ecosystem."
msgstr ""
"**是否需要自訂分析器**：只有在兩個工具都不支援該生態系時，才考慮自訂分析指令"
"碼。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/contribute/package-managers.md:18
msgid ""
"Source scanning is a two-stage design that routes to per-language official "
"cdxgen images rather than using a single image. See [Architecture](../"
"concepts/architecture.md) for the full picture."
msgstr ""
"原始碼掃描採用兩階段設計，會路由到各語言的官方 cdxgen 映像檔，而不是共用單一"
"映像檔。完整脈絡請看[架構](../concepts/architecture.md)。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/contribute/package-managers.md:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "Steps"
msgstr "步驟"

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/contribute/package-managers.md:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "1. Add language detection and image routing"
msgstr "1. 新增語言偵測與映像檔路由"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/contribute/package-managers.md:24
msgid ""
"`docker/lib/source-detect.sh` is the shared detection logic used by both the "
"CLI and the web UI. Modify two functions."
msgstr ""
"`docker/lib/source-detect.sh` 是 CLI 與網頁介面共用的偵測邏輯。要修改兩個函"
"式。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/contribute/package-managers.md:27
msgid ""
"`detect_lang()` — add a rule that detects the language from the project's "
"manifest files (for example, Kotlin checks for `build.gradle.kts` — Kotlin "
"is already covered by the `java` branch)."
msgstr ""
"`detect_lang()` —— 加上一條規則，從專案的 manifest 檔案判斷語言（例如 Kotlin "
"會檢查 `build.gradle.kts` —— Kotlin 已經涵蓋在 `java` 分支裡）。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/contribute/package-managers.md:27
msgid ""
"`img_for_lang()` — add the official cdxgen image that corresponds to the "
"detected language."
msgstr "`img_for_lang()` —— 加上對應該語言的官方 cdxgen 映像檔。"

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/contribute/package-managers.md:28
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# img_for_lang() example — add a new language entry\n"
"newlang) echo \"ghcr.io/cyclonedx/cdxgen-debian-newlang:$CDXGEN_TAG\" ;;\n"
msgstr ""
"# img_for_lang() 範例 —— 新增一個語言項目\n"
"newlang) echo \"ghcr.io/cyclonedx/cdxgen-debian-newlang:$CDXGEN_TAG\" ;;\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/contribute/package-managers.md:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "2. Update build-prep.sh if dependency preparation is needed"
msgstr "2. 需要準備相依項目時，修改 build-prep.sh"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/contribute/package-managers.md:36
msgid ""
"If cdxgen cannot resolve transitive dependencies in the ecosystem without a "
"lock file, add preparation logic to `docker/lib/build-prep.sh`, which "
"creates lock files right before cdxgen runs. Rust (`cargo generate-"
"lockfile`) and Go (`go mod download`) are existing precedents. Write the "
"preparation as best-effort so it never fails the scan."
msgstr ""
"如果該生態系在沒有鎖定檔案的情況下，cdxgen 無法解析間接相依，就把準備邏輯加"
"到 `docker/lib/build-prep.sh`——它會在 cdxgen 執行前建立鎖定檔案。Rust"
" (`cargo generate-lockfile`) 與 Go (`go mod download`) 是既有的先例。這段準備"
"要寫成盡力而為 (best-effort) 的形式，絕對不能讓掃描因此失敗。"

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/contribute/package-managers.md:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "3. Add an example project"
msgstr "3. 新增範例專案"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/contribute/package-managers.md:40
msgid "Add an example project under the `examples/` directory."
msgstr "在 `examples/` 目錄底下加入範例專案。"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: docs/contribute/package-managers.md:41
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"examples/kotlin/\n"
"├── README.md              # Example description\n"
"├── build.gradle.kts       # Build file\n"
"├── gradle.lockfile        # Lock file (required!)\n"
"└── src/main/kotlin/\n"
"    └── Main.kt\n"
msgstr ""
"examples/kotlin/\n"
"├── README.md              # 範例說明\n"
"├── build.gradle.kts       # 建置檔案\n"
"├── gradle.lockfile        # 鎖定檔案（必要！）\n"
"└── src/main/kotlin/\n"
"    └── Main.kt\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/contribute/package-managers.md:51
#, no-wrap
msgid "> **Why the lock file matters**: cdxgen extracts exact version information from lock files. Without one, dependency detection is incomplete.\n"
msgstr "> **為什麼鎖定檔案很重要**：cdxgen 會從鎖定檔案取出精確的版本資訊。沒有鎖定檔案，相依項目的偵測就不完整。\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/contribute/package-managers.md:52
#, no-wrap
msgid "4. Add a test"
msgstr "4. 新增測試"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/contribute/package-managers.md:55
msgid ""
"Create a `tests/cases/test-{언어}.sh` file. See the [testing guide]"
"(testing.md#writing-tests) for details on how to write it."
msgstr ""
"建立 `tests/cases/test-{語言}.sh` 檔案。撰寫方式的細節請看[測試指南]"
"(testing.md#writing-tests)。"

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/contribute/package-managers.md:56
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"#!/usr/bin/env bash\n"
"set -euo pipefail\n"
"\n"
"source \"$(dirname \"$0\")/../helpers/assert.sh\"\n"
"source \"$(dirname \"$0\")/../helpers/setup.sh\"\n"
"\n"
"TEST_NAME=\"Kotlin Gradle 소스 코드 분석\"\n"
"EXAMPLE_DIR=\"examples/kotlin\"\n"
"\n"
"setup_test \"$TEST_NAME\"\n"
"\n"
"run_scan \\\n"
"  --project \"KotlinExample\" \\\n"
"  --version \"1.0.0\" \\\n"
"  --target \"$EXAMPLE_DIR\" \\\n"
"  --generate-only\n"
"\n"
"assert_file_exists \"KotlinExample_1.0.0_bom.json\"\n"
"assert_json_field \".bomFormat\" \"CycloneDX\"\n"
"assert_json_field \".specVersion\" \"1.6\"\n"
"assert_components_count_gte 1\n"
"assert_purl_prefix \"pkg:maven/\"\n"
"\n"
"teardown_test\n"
msgstr ""
"#!/usr/bin/env bash\n"
"set -euo pipefail\n"
"\n"
"source \"$(dirname \"$0\")/../helpers/assert.sh\"\n"
"source \"$(dirname \"$0\")/../helpers/setup.sh\"\n"
"\n"
"TEST_NAME=\"Kotlin Gradle 原始碼分析\"\n"
"EXAMPLE_DIR=\"examples/kotlin\"\n"
"\n"
"setup_test \"$TEST_NAME\"\n"
"\n"
"run_scan \\\n"
"  --project \"KotlinExample\" \\\n"
"  --version \"1.0.0\" \\\n"
"  --target \"$EXAMPLE_DIR\" \\\n"
"  --generate-only\n"
"\n"
"assert_file_exists \"KotlinExample_1.0.0_bom.json\"\n"
"assert_json_field \".bomFormat\" \"CycloneDX\"\n"
"assert_json_field \".specVersion\" \"1.6\"\n"
"assert_components_count_gte 1\n"
"assert_purl_prefix \"pkg:maven/\"\n"
"\n"
"teardown_test\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/contribute/package-managers.md:84 docs/contribute/testing.md:121
msgid "Then register the new test in `tests/test-scan.sh`."
msgstr "接著在 `tests/test-scan.sh` 註冊這個新測試。"

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/contribute/package-managers.md:85
#, no-wrap
msgid "source \"$(dirname \"$0\")/cases/test-kotlin.sh\"\n"
msgstr "source \"$(dirname \"$0\")/cases/test-kotlin.sh\"\n"

