#. type: Plain text
#: docs/contribute/package-managers.md:112
msgid ""
"Kotlin uses the Gradle build system and runs on the JVM, so it reuses the "
"`java` branch of `detect_lang()` (which detects `*.gradle.kts`) and the "
"`cdxgen-temurin-java21` image as is."
msgstr ""
"Kotlin 使用 Gradle 建置系統，執行在 JVM 上，因此直接沿用 `detect_lang()` 的 "
"`java` 分支（它會偵測 `*.gradle.kts`）與 `cdxgen-temurin-java21` 映像檔。"

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/contribute/package-managers.md:113
#, no-wrap
msgid "How to generate a Gradle lock file"
msgstr "如何產生 Gradle 鎖定檔案"

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/contribute/package-managers.md:115
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"cd examples/kotlin\n"
"\n"
"# Add dependency locking to build.gradle.kts\n"
"cat >> build.gradle.kts << 'EOF'\n"
"dependencyLocking {\n"
"    lockAllConfigurations()\n"
"}\n"
"EOF\n"
"\n"
"# Generate the lock file\n"
"./gradlew dependencies --write-locks\n"
msgstr ""
"cd examples/kotlin\n"
"\n"
"# 在 build.gradle.kts 加上相依項目鎖定設定\n"
"cat >> build.gradle.kts << 'EOF'\n"
"dependencyLocking {\n"
"    lockAllConfigurations()\n"
"}\n"
"EOF\n"
"\n"
"# 產生鎖定檔案\n"
"./gradlew dependencies --write-locks\n"

