#: docs/contribute/testing.md:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "The BomLens test structure — how to run the suites, write new tests, and debug failures."
msgstr "BomLens 的測試結構——如何執行測試套件、撰寫新測試，以及對失敗除錯。"

#. type: Title #
#: docs/contribute/testing.md:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Testing guide"
msgstr "測試指南"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/contribute/testing.md:8
msgid ""
"This guide explains the test structure of BomLens, how to run and write "
"tests, and how to debug failures."
msgstr ""
"這份指南說明 BomLens 的測試結構、執行與撰寫測試的方式，以及失敗時的除錯步驟。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/contribute/testing.md:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Test structure"
msgstr "測試結構"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: docs/contribute/testing.md:11
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"tests/\n"
"├── test-scan.sh          # Integration test entry point (runs all tests)\n"
"├── helpers/\n"
"│   ├── assert.sh         # Assertion helper functions\n"
"│   └── setup.sh          # Test environment setup/teardown\n"
"└── cases/\n"
"    ├── test-java.sh      # Java test cases\n"
"    ├── test-nodejs.sh    # Node.js test cases\n"
"    ├── test-python.sh    # Python test cases\n"
"    ├── test-go.sh        # Go test cases\n"
"    └── test-docker.sh    # Docker image analysis tests\n"
msgstr ""
"tests/\n"
"├── test-scan.sh          # 整合測試進入點（執行全部測試）\n"
"├── helpers/\n"
"│   ├── assert.sh         # 斷言 (assertion) 輔助函式\n"
"│   └── setup.sh          # 測試環境的初始化／清理\n"
"└── cases/\n"
"    ├── test-java.sh      # Java 測試案例\n"
"    ├── test-nodejs.sh    # Node.js 測試案例\n"
"    ├── test-python.sh    # Python 測試案例\n"
"    ├── test-go.sh        # Go 測試案例\n"
"    └── test-docker.sh    # Docker 映像檔分析測試\n"

