#. type: Title ##
#: docs/contribute/testing.md:53
#, no-wrap
msgid "Execution modes"
msgstr "執行模式"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/contribute/testing.md:61
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Environment variable | Value | Output |\n"
"|-----------|-----|----------|\n"
"| (none) | — | Prints only the test result summary |\n"
"| `VERBOSE` | `true` | Prints key progress logs for each step |\n"
"| `DEBUG_MODE` | `true` | Includes Docker execution logs and full cdxgen/syft output |\n"
"| `LOG_FILE` | file path | Saves logs to a file |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 環境變數 | 值 | 輸出內容 |\n"
"|-----------|-----|----------|\n"
"| （無） | — | 只印出測試結果摘要 |\n"
"| `VERBOSE` | `true` | 印出每個步驟的主要進度日誌 |\n"
"| `DEBUG_MODE` | `true` | 包含 Docker 執行日誌，以及 cdxgen／syft 的完整輸出 |\n"
"| `LOG_FILE` | 檔案路徑 | 把日誌存到檔案 |\n"

