#. type: Title ##
#: docs/contribute/testing.md:85
#, no-wrap
msgid "Writing tests"
msgstr "撰寫測試 {#writing-tests}"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/contribute/testing.md:88
msgid ""
"When adding support for a new language, write a test case in the following "
"format."
msgstr "要新增一種語言的支援時，請照下面的格式撰寫測試案例。"

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/contribute/testing.md:89
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# tests/cases/test-kotlin.sh\n"
"\n"
"#!/usr/bin/env bash\n"
"set -euo pipefail\n"
"\n"
"source \"$(dirname \"$0\")/../helpers/assert.sh\"\n"
"source \"$(dirname \"$0\")/../helpers/setup.sh\"\n"
"\n"
"TEST_NAME=\"Kotlin Gradle source code analysis\"\n"
"EXAMPLE_DIR=\"examples/kotlin\"\n"
"\n"
"setup_test \"$TEST_NAME\"\n"
"\n"
"# Generate SBOM\n"
"run_scan \\\n"
"  --project \"KotlinExample\" \\\n"
"  --version \"1.0.0\" \\\n"
"  --target \"$EXAMPLE_DIR\" \\\n"
"  --generate-only\n"
"\n"
"# Assertions\n"
"assert_file_exists \"KotlinExample_1.0.0_bom.json\"\n"
"assert_json_field \".bomFormat\" \"CycloneDX\"\n"
"assert_json_field \".specVersion\" \"1.6\"\n"
"assert_components_count_gte 1\n"
"assert_purl_prefix \"pkg:maven/\"  # Kotlin uses the Gradle/Maven ecosystem\n"
"\n"
"teardown_test\n"
msgstr ""
"# tests/cases/test-kotlin.sh\n"
"\n"
"#!/usr/bin/env bash\n"
"set -euo pipefail\n"
"\n"
"source \"$(dirname \"$0\")/../helpers/assert.sh\"\n"
"source \"$(dirname \"$0\")/../helpers/setup.sh\"\n"
"\n"
"TEST_NAME=\"Kotlin Gradle 原始碼分析\"\n"
"EXAMPLE_DIR=\"examples/kotlin\"\n"
"\n"
"setup_test \"$TEST_NAME\"\n"
"\n"
"# 產生 SBOM\n"
"run_scan \\\n"
"  --project \"KotlinExample\" \\\n"
"  --version \"1.0.0\" \\\n"
"  --target \"$EXAMPLE_DIR\" \\\n"
"  --generate-only\n"
"\n"
"# 斷言\n"
"assert_file_exists \"KotlinExample_1.0.0_bom.json\"\n"
"assert_json_field \".bomFormat\" \"CycloneDX\"\n"
"assert_json_field \".specVersion\" \"1.6\"\n"
"assert_components_count_gte 1\n"
"assert_purl_prefix \"pkg:maven/\"  # Kotlin 使用 Gradle／Maven 生態系\n"
"\n"
"teardown_test\n"

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/contribute/testing.md:122
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Add inside tests/test-scan.sh\n"
"source \"$(dirname \"$0\")/cases/test-kotlin.sh\"\n"
msgstr ""
"# 加在 tests/test-scan.sh 內部\n"
"source \"$(dirname \"$0\")/cases/test-kotlin.sh\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/contribute/testing.md:128
msgid ""
"For the full procedure, see the [package manager guide](package-managers.md)."
msgstr "完整流程請看[套件管理器指南](package-managers.md)。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/contribute/testing.md:129
#, no-wrap
msgid "Assertion function reference"
msgstr "斷言函式參考"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/contribute/testing.md:139
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Function | Description |\n"
"|------|------|\n"
"| `assert_file_exists <file>` | Checks that a file exists |\n"
"| `assert_json_field <field> <expected>` | Checks a JSON field value |\n"
"| `assert_components_count_gte <count>` | Checks that the component count is at least N |\n"
"| `assert_purl_prefix <prefix>` | Checks the PURL prefix format |\n"
"| `assert_license_exists` | Checks that at least one license entry exists |\n"
"| `assert_no_empty_versions` | Checks that no version field is empty |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 函式 | 說明 |\n"
"|------|------|\n"
"| `assert_file_exists <file>` | 確認檔案存在 |\n"
"| `assert_json_field <field> <expected>` | 確認 JSON 欄位的值 |\n"
"| `assert_components_count_gte <count>` | 確認元件數量至少有 N 個 |\n"
"| `assert_purl_prefix <prefix>` | 確認 PURL 前綴格式 |\n"
"| `assert_license_exists` | 確認至少有一筆授權條款資訊 |\n"
"| `assert_no_empty_versions` | 確認沒有空白的版本欄位 |\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/contribute/testing.md:140
#, no-wrap
msgid "Test writing principles"
msgstr "撰寫測試的原則"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/contribute/testing.md:143
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Independence**: Each test must not depend on other tests. Results must stay the same regardless of test order.\n"
msgstr "**獨立性**：每個測試都不能依賴其他測試。無論執行順序如何改變，結果都必須一致。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/contribute/testing.md:145
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Cleanup**: Always delete generated files in `teardown_test` so they do not affect the next test.\n"
msgstr "**清理**：一定要在 `teardown_test` 刪除產生的檔案，避免影響下一個測試。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/contribute/testing.md:147
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Clear names**: `TEST_NAME` should clearly express what the test verifies.\n"
msgstr "**名稱明確**：`TEST_NAME` 要清楚表達這個測試驗證的是什麼。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/contribute/testing.md:149
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Minimal assertions**: Assert only what is needed and avoid excessive checks.\n"
msgstr "**斷言精簡**：只斷言必要的項目，避免過度檢查。\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/contribute/testing.md:150
#, no-wrap
msgid "Logging and debugging"
msgstr "記錄日誌與除錯"

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/contribute/testing.md:152
#, no-wrap
msgid "Inspecting the generated SBOM directly"
msgstr "直接檢查產生的 SBOM"

