msgstr "情境 3——本機 C/C++ 原始碼目錄 {#scenario-3--local-cc-source-directory}"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guides/by-input.md:95
msgid ""
"A team shared the source via a folder you copied locally (`~/project/c-"
