#. type: Plain text
#: docs/reference/cli.md:20
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"> **Windows**: the commands here are for macOS/Linux. Pick one of the following. See [Getting started](../start/first-scan.md) for installation.\n"
">\n"
"> - Replace `./scripts/scan-sbom.sh` with `scripts\\scan-sbom.bat` (needs Git Bash).\n"
"> - Under WSL2, run the commands as-is.\n"
"> - To work without a command line, double-click `scripts\\sbom-ui.bat`, or download the desktop app.\n"
msgstr ""
"> **Windows**：這裡的指令是以 macOS/Linux 為準。請從下列方式中選一種。安裝方式請看[快速開始](../start/first-scan.md)。\n"
">\n"
"> - 把 `./scripts/scan-sbom.sh` 換成 `scripts\\scan-sbom.bat`（需要 Git Bash）。\n"
"> - 在 WSL2 底下直接照原樣執行這些指令。\n"
"> - 不想用指令列的話，可以雙擊 `scripts\\sbom-ui.bat`，或是下載桌面版應用程式。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/reference/cli.md:56
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Option | Default | Description |\n"
"|--------|---------|-------------|\n"
"| `--project <name>` | — | **(required)** Project name |\n"
"| `--version <version>` | — | **(required)** Project version |\n"
"| `--target <target>` | current directory | What to analyze: a directory (source tree, or an OS rootfs / staging build output), a Docker image, a binary file, or a `.zip`/`.tar.gz` archive. A Yocto build directory is recognized as such, and the image SBOM it published under `tmp/deploy/images/` is analyzed instead of the build tree being walked (see the [supplier SBOM guide](../guides/supplier-sbom.md#yocto-images)) |\n"
"| `--git <url>` | — | Shallow-clone a git/GitHub URL and analyze it as source (private repos: `GIT_TOKEN` env var) |\n"
"| `--branch <ref>` | default branch | Branch, tag, or commit of the `--git` target (alias `--ref`) |\n"
"| `--firmware` | false | Force firmware mode on the `--target` file (opt-in firmware image) |\n"
"| `--analyze <sbom>` | — | Validate and analyze a supplier SBOM (alias `--sbom`). CycloneDX/SPDX. Mutually exclusive with `--target` |\n"
"| `--model <owner/name>` | — | Generate an AI SBOM (CycloneDX 1.7 ML-BOM) for a HuggingFace model via the OWASP AIBOM Generator (opt-in `bomlens-aibom` image; fetches model-card metadata over the network). Mutually exclusive with `--target`/`--analyze`/`--git`/`--merge` |\n"
"| `--model-file <path>` | — | Read one AI model file and describe it from its own header: GGUF, safetensors, PyTorch (`.pt`/`.pth`/`.ckpt`), pickle, npz, npy or ONNX. Offline, no HuggingFace account, and it works on a model that was never published. What can be filled depends on the format — GGUF carries a name, a license and an architecture, while safetensors usually carries only tensor shapes, and a field the file does not declare is left empty rather than guessed. A `.gguf`/`.safetensors`/`.pt`/… path passed to `--target` is read this way too. Mutually exclusive with `--target`/`--analyze`/`--git` |\n"
"| `--license <spdx-id>` | — | The outbound license the project is distributed under (e.g. `Apache-2.0`). Recorded on the SBOM's root component and used to flag dependencies whose terms clash with it. A source scan cannot infer this — cdxgen leaves the root license empty for maven and gradle — so without it no conflict verdict is produced. An existing root license (a supplier SBOM's own declaration) is never replaced |\n"
"| `--sbom-author <name>` | — | The entity that generated the SBOM — the organisation or person running the scan, not the tool and not whoever wrote the software. Recorded in `metadata.authors`, using the full name without acronyms. Nothing in a scan can discover it, so the field is left out of the SBOM when it is not given rather than filled with a placeholder |\n"
"| `--usage <scenario>` | — | Tailor the AI model risk assessment (`--model` and `--model-file`) to how the model will be used: `internal`, `product`, `redistribute` or `outputs-only`. Only the license conditions that bind that scenario decide the verdict, and the report states which scenario it was judged for. Unset judges against every condition |\n"
"| `--merge <a.json> <b.json> …` | — | Merge two or more CycloneDX SBOMs into one, dedupe by purl, and stamp the root component with `--project`/`--version`. Optional — for a server SBOM when an external system needs a single product BOM; otherwise keep the layers separate (see the [server SBOM guide](../guides/server-delivery.md)). Mutually exclusive with `--target`/`--analyze`/`--git` |\n"
"| `--merge-root <file>` | — | With `--merge`: keep this input's `specVersion` and root component (for example an ML-BOM's CycloneDX 1.7 root with its model card) instead of writing a fresh 1.6 root. Must be one of the `--merge` files; the preserved root is renamed to `--project`/`--version` |\n"
"| `--generate-only` | false | Save locally only, without uploading |\n"
"| `--upload-target <target>` | `dependency-track` | Upload destination: `dependency-track` (DT-compatible) or `trusca` (native ingest) |\n"
"| `--trusca <project_id>` | — | Upload to TRUSCA (= `--upload-target trusca` + project id). Needs `API_URL` and a Bearer `API_KEY` |\n"
"| `--notice` | (on by default) | Generate the open-source notice (NOTICE, txt+html) |\n"
"| `--security` | (on by default) | Generate the Trivy security report (json+md+html), including CVSS, EPSS, and CISA KEV priority signals |\n"
"| `--spdx` | false | Also export the SBOM as SPDX 2.3 JSON (`_bom.spdx.json`), converted from the final CycloneDX output |\n"
"| `--all` | — | `--notice --security --spdx` |\n"
"| `--no-report` | false | Skip the open-source risk report (see below) |\n"
"| `--lang <en\\|ko\\|zh-TW>` | `en` | Language for the human-facing conformance and AI-profile reports (`.md`/`.html`). The SBOM and the JSON reports stay English regardless |\n"
"| `--deep-license` | false | Precise license detection with scancode (opt-in image) |\n"
"| `--deep-cve` | false | Add a second CVE-matching pass via grype's NVD CPE matcher (opt-in `bomlens-deep-cve` image, pulled automatically). Recovers NVD-only CVEs that Trivy misses, mostly for older Maven libraries, since BomLens attaches an NVD-matchable CPE to Maven components specifically; implies `--security`. Findings not verified against the live NVD version range are flagged version-unverified in the report — see the [deep CVE matching guide](../guides/reports.md) |\n"
"| `--identify-vendored` | false | Identify open source copied (vendored) into C/C++ source that has no package manager. Matches file fingerprints against the OSSKB service (included in the published image; sends hashes, not source). See the [identify bundled OSS guide](../guides/identify-vendored.md) |\n"
"| `--byte-stable` | false | Deterministic (reproducible) SBOM output |\n"
"| `--sign` | false | cosign signature (`COSIGN_KEY` required) |\n"
"| `--output-dir <dir>` | current directory | Base directory for outputs (alias `-o`). Each scan lands in a `{Project}_{Version}/` subfolder under it, keeping the bundle together and out of the source tree |\n"
"| `--timestamp` | false | Append `_YYYYMMDD-HHMMSS` to the run subfolder so repeat scans of the same project and version are kept side by side instead of overwritten. Folder name only; SBOM bytes are unchanged |\n"
"| `--ui` | — | Launch the local web UI |\n"
"| `--mount <dir>` | — | With `--ui`: expose an extra host directory to the web UI as a read-only target for the **Directory path** input (repeatable). Lets the UI scan an OS tree outside the launch folder — including the running host OS with `--mount /`. Results still save under the launch folder |\n"
"| `--help` | — | Print help |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 選項 | 預設值 | 說明 |\n"
"|--------|---------|-------------|\n"
"| `--project <name>` | — | **（必要）**專案名稱 |\n"
"| `--version <version>` | — | **（必要）**專案版本 |\n"
"| `--target <target>` | 目前目錄 | 分析對象：目錄（原始碼樹，或是 OS rootfs、建置產出物的 staging 目錄）、Docker 映像檔、二進位檔案，或 `.zip`/`.tar.gz` 壓縮檔。Yocto 建置目錄會被辨識出來，此時不會走訪建置樹，而是改為分析建置發佈在 `tmp/deploy/images/` 底下的映像檔 SBOM（參考[供應者 SBOM 指南](../guides/supplier-sbom.md#yocto-images)） |\n"
"| `--git <url>` | — | 以淺層 clone (shallow) 取得 git/GitHub URL 並當作原始碼分析（私有儲存庫：`GIT_TOKEN` 環境變數） |\n"
"| `--branch <ref>` | 預設分支 | `--git` 目標的分支、標籤或 commit（別名 `--ref`） |\n"
"| `--firmware` | false | 強制以韌體模式處理 `--target` 指定的檔案（opt-in 韌體映像檔） |\n"
"| `--analyze <sbom>` | — | 驗證並分析供應者 SBOM（別名 `--sbom`）。支援 CycloneDX/SPDX。與 `--target` 互斥 |\n"
"| `--model <owner/name>` | — | 透過 OWASP AIBOM Generator 為 HuggingFace 模型產生 AI SBOM (CycloneDX 1.7 ML-BOM)；使用 opt-in 的 `bomlens-aibom` 映像檔，會透過網路取得模型卡後設資料。與 `--target`/`--analyze`/`--git`/`--merge` 互斥 |\n"
"| `--model-file <path>` | — | 讀取單一 AI 模型檔案，只依檔案自身的標頭來描述它：支援 GGUF、safetensors、PyTorch (`.pt`/`.pth`/`.ckpt`)、pickle、npz、npy 與 ONNX。離線運作，不需要 HuggingFace 帳號，連從未發佈的模型也能處理。可填入的資訊依格式而異——GGUF 帶有名稱、授權條款與架構，safetensors 通常只有張量形狀；檔案沒有宣告的欄位會留空，不會用猜測值填補。傳給 `--target` 的 `.gguf`/`.safetensors`/`.pt`/… 路徑也會以這種方式讀取。與 `--target`/`--analyze`/`--git` 互斥 |\n"
"| `--license <spdx-id>` | — | 專案對外散布時採用的授權條款（例如 `Apache-2.0`）。會記錄在 SBOM 的根元件上，並用來標記條款與它衝突的相依項目。原始碼掃描無法推斷這個值——cdxgen 在 maven 與 gradle 會把根授權條款留空——因此未指定時不會產生衝突判定。SBOM 中已有的根授權條款（供應者自己宣告的值）絕不會被取代 |\n"
"| `--sbom-author <name>` | — | 產生這份 SBOM 的主體——指執行掃描的組織或個人，既不是工具，也不是撰寫軟體的一方。以不含縮寫的完整名稱記錄在 `metadata.authors`。掃描過程無從得知這個值，因此未指定時會直接省略該欄位，而不是填入佔位字串 |\n"
"| `--usage <scenario>` | — | 依模型實際的使用方式調整 AI 模型風險評估（`--model` 與 `--model-file`）：`internal`、`product`、`redistribute` 或 `outputs-only`。只有約束該情境的授權條件會決定判定結果，報告中也會註明是以哪個情境判定。未指定時會以全部條件判定 |\n"
"| `--merge <a.json> <b.json> …` | — | 把兩份以上的 CycloneDX SBOM 合併成一份，依 purl 去除重複，並將根元件標記為 `--project`/`--version`。這是選用功能——當外部系統要求每個產品只有單一 BOM 時，可用來產生伺服器 SBOM；其他情況請讓各層維持獨立（參考[伺服器 SBOM 指南](../guides/server-delivery.md)）。與 `--target`/`--analyze`/`--git` 互斥 |\n"
"| `--merge-root <file>` | — | 搭配 `--merge` 使用：保留這個輸入檔的 `specVersion` 與根元件（例如帶有模型卡的 ML-BOM CycloneDX 1.7 根元件），而不是另外寫入一個全新的 1.6 根元件。必須是 `--merge` 的輸入檔之一；保留下來的根元件會被改名為 `--project`/`--version` |\n"
"| `--generate-only` | false | 只儲存在本機，不上傳 |\n"
"| `--upload-target <target>` | `dependency-track` | 上傳目的地：`dependency-track`（DT 相容）或 `trusca`（原生 ingest） |\n"
"| `--trusca <project_id>` | — | 上傳到 TRUSCA（等同 `--upload-target trusca` 加上 project id）。需要 `API_URL` 與 Bearer `API_KEY` |\n"
"| `--notice` | （預設開啟） | 產生開放原始碼授權聲明（NOTICE，txt+html） |\n"
"| `--security` | （預設開啟） | 產生 Trivy 安全報告 (json+md+html)，包含 CVSS、EPSS 與 CISA KEV 優先順序訊號 |\n"
"| `--spdx` | false | 額外把 SBOM 匯出為 SPDX 2.3 JSON (`_bom.spdx.json`)，內容由最終的 CycloneDX 輸出轉換而來 |\n"
"| `--all` | — | `--notice --security --spdx` |\n"
"| `--no-report` | false | 略過開放原始碼風險分析報告（見下文） |\n"
"| `--lang <en\\|ko\\|zh-TW>` | `en` | 給人閱讀的符合性報告與 AI 合規概況報告 (`.md`/`.html`) 所使用的語言。SBOM 與 JSON 報告不受此設定影響，一律維持英文 |\n"
"| `--deep-license` | false | 以 scancode 進行精確的授權條款偵測（opt-in 映像檔） |\n"
"| `--deep-cve` | false | 透過 grype 的 NVD CPE 比對器再加一輪 CVE 比對（opt-in `bomlens-deep-cve` 映像檔，會自動下載）。可補回 Trivy 漏掉的 NVD 專有 CVE，這類 CVE 大多出現在較舊的 Maven 函式庫，因為 BomLens 只為 Maven 元件附上可與 NVD 比對的 CPE；會一併開啟 `--security`。未與即時 NVD 版本範圍核對過的結果，會在報告中標示為版本未驗證——參考[深度 CVE 比對指南](../guides/reports.md) |\n"
"| `--identify-vendored` | false | 識別被複製納入 (vendored) 到沒有套件管理器的 C/C++ 原始碼裡的開放原始碼。會把檔案指紋與 OSSKB 服務比對（已包含在發佈的映像檔中；傳送的是雜湊值，不是原始碼）。參考[識別內含的開放原始碼指南](../guides/identify-vendored.md) |\n"
"| `--byte-stable` | false | 決定性（可重現）的 SBOM 輸出 |\n"
"| `--sign` | false | cosign 簽章（需要 `COSIGN_KEY`） |\n"
"| `--output-dir <dir>` | 目前目錄 | 產出物的基準目錄（別名 `-o`）。每次掃描都會落在它底下的 `{Project}_{Version}/` 子資料夾，讓同一次執行的檔案集中在一起，也不會散落到原始碼樹裡 |\n"
"| `--timestamp` | false | 在執行的子資料夾名稱後面加上 `_YYYYMMDD-HHMMSS`，讓同一個專案與版本重複掃描時能並存保留，而不是被覆寫。只影響資料夾名稱，SBOM 的位元組內容不變 |\n"
"| `--ui` | — | 啟動本機網頁介面 |\n"
"| `--mount <dir>` | — | 搭配 `--ui` 使用：把額外的主機目錄開放給網頁介面，作為**目錄路徑**輸入欄的唯讀掃描目標（可重複指定）。這讓介面能掃描啟動資料夾以外的 OS 樹，包括用 `--mount /` 掃描正在執行的主機 OS。結果仍然存放在啟動資料夾底下 |\n"
"| `--help` | — | 印出說明 |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/reference/cli.md:58
msgid "Environment variables adjust the behavior."
msgstr "環境變數可以調整行為。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/reference/cli.md:93
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Variable | Default | Description |\n"
"|----------|---------|-------------|\n"
"| `SBOM_SCANNER_IMAGE` | `ghcr.io/sktelecom/bomlens:latest` | Override the scanner image |\n"
"| `SBOM_FIRMWARE_IMAGE` | `ghcr.io/sktelecom/bomlens-firmware:latest` | Image used for firmware analysis |\n"
"| `SBOM_AIBOM_IMAGE` | `ghcr.io/sktelecom/bomlens-aibom:latest` | Image used for AI model (ML-BOM) generation |\n"
"| `SBOM_DEEP_CVE_IMAGE` | `ghcr.io/sktelecom/bomlens-deep-cve:latest` | Image used for `--deep-cve` (grype CPE matching), and by the same toggle in the web UI |\n"
"| `SBOM_OUTPUT_FLAT` | — | Set to `1` to write artifacts flat in the output base, with no per-run subfolder (the pre-isolation layout, for CI that expects the old paths) |\n"
"| `SBOM_OUTPUT_DIR` | `~/sbom-output` | Output base for the desktop app and web UI (the CLI uses `--output-dir` instead). Each scan still lands in a `{Project}_{Version}/` subfolder under it |\n"
"| `SBOM_UI_MOUNT_DIR` | — | For the Windows launcher `sbom-ui.bat`, which takes no CLI arguments: one extra folder to expose to the web UI as a read-only Directory path target (the double-click counterpart of `--ui --mount`). Use a path without `& ^ | < >` — the launcher rejects those rather than passing a mangled mount to Docker |\n"
"| `SBOM_LANG` | system locale | `en` or `ko`, for the Windows launchers and the desktop app. Anything that is not Korean gets English |\n"
"| `SBOM_PULL` | `missing` | Windows launcher download behavior. `missing` downloads only when the image is absent, `always` re-checks the registry every run (picks up a newer `:latest`), `never` never touches the network |\n"
"| `SBOM_IMAGE_TAR` | — | Path to an image tar from `docker save`. The Windows launcher loads it instead of pulling; a file named `bomlens-image.tar` next to the scripts is picked up automatically. Combined with `SBOM_PULL=never` this gives a fully offline install |\n"
"| `CVE_BIN_TOOL_MODE` | `auto` | Firmware CVE matching. `auto` uses the bundled CVE database if present, otherwise downloads from NVD when the network is reachable. `offline` matches only against the bundled database. `online` always updates from the network. `components-only` skips CVE matching and emits a component-only SBOM |\n"
"| `CVE_BIN_TOOL_HOME` | `/opt/cve-bin-tool-home` | Location of the bundled cve-bin-tool CVE database. cve-bin-tool reads `$CVE_BIN_TOOL_HOME/.cache/cve-bin-tool/cve.db` (it keys the cache off `HOME`) |\n"
"| `CVE_BIN_TOOL_DISABLE_SOURCES` | `GAD` | cve-bin-tool data sources to disable during a firmware scan. `GAD` (GitLab Advisory) is disabled by default because it crashes the bundled cve-bin-tool on fetch |\n"
"| `SCANOSS_API_URL` | OSSKB free API | Endpoint for `--identify-vendored`. Point at a SCANOSS commercial or self-hosted endpoint for air-gapped or high-volume use |\n"
"| `SCANOSS_API_KEY` | — | Credential for `SCANOSS_API_URL`, if the endpoint requires one |\n"
"| `SCANOSS_MIN_FILES` | `2` | Minimum number of files that must match a library before it is reported, to drop one-off downstream-fork noise. Set `1` to keep every single-file match |\n"
"| `GIT_TOKEN` | — | Token for cloning private git repositories |\n"
"| `HF_TOKEN` | — | HuggingFace read token for `--model` and for the dataset metadata lookups during AI SBOM analysis. Required for a private or gated repository, which is how you review a model before publishing it. `HUGGING_FACE_HUB_TOKEN` is accepted as an alias |\n"
"| `ENRICH_HF_SECURITY` | `true` | Read HuggingFace's own file-security scan results (ClamAV and picklescan, per file) for `--model` scans and record them in the ML-BOM. Metadata only, no file download. Set `false` to skip the lookup |\n"
"| `COSIGN_KEY` | — | Path to the signing key used by `--sign` |\n"
"| `FETCH_LICENSE` | `true` | Resolve dependency licenses during source scans. Set `false` to skip the lookup and run faster |\n"
"| `PROJECT_LICENSE` | — | Same as `--license`. The outbound license the project is distributed under, as an SPDX id. Drives the `bomlens:licenseConflict` verdicts and the risk report's conflict section |\n"
"| `SBOM_AUTHOR` | — | Same as `--sbom-author`. The entity that generated the SBOM, recorded in `metadata.authors` |\n"
"| `SECURITY_ENRICH` | `true` | Enrich the security report with EPSS and CISA KEV signals. Set `false` on air-gapped networks to skip the external lookups |\n"
"| `SECURITY_NVD_VERIFY` | `false` | With `--deep-cve`: verify each grype `nvd:cpe` finding against the live NVD version range and drop out-of-range false positives (needs `NVD_API_KEY` and network access; adds minutes). Off by default — findings are kept and flagged version-unverified |\n"
"| `NVD_API_KEY` | — | NVD API key for `SECURITY_NVD_VERIFY`. Passed to the container by name only, never inlined into the command |\n"
"| `API_URL` | — | Upload server URL (a DT server, or the TRUSCA base) |\n"
"| `API_KEY` | — | Upload credential. Used as `X-Api-Key` for DT, as a Bearer token for TRUSCA |\n"
"| `UPLOAD_TARGET` | `dependency-track` | Upload destination: `dependency-track` or `trusca` |\n"
"| `TRUSCA_PROJECT_ID` | — | TRUSCA project id (UUID). Required when `trusca` |\n"
"| `TRUSCA_REF` | `main` | Ingest ref label |\n"
"| `TRUSCA_RELEASE` | `--version` value | Ingest release label |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 環境變數 | 預設值 | 說明 |\n"
"|----------|---------|-------------|\n"
"| `SBOM_SCANNER_IMAGE` | `ghcr.io/sktelecom/bomlens:latest` | 覆寫掃描器映像檔 |\n"
"| `SBOM_FIRMWARE_IMAGE` | `ghcr.io/sktelecom/bomlens-firmware:latest` | 韌體分析所使用的映像檔 |\n"
"| `SBOM_AIBOM_IMAGE` | `ghcr.io/sktelecom/bomlens-aibom:latest` | 產生 AI 模型 (ML-BOM) 時所使用的映像檔 |\n"
"| `SBOM_DEEP_CVE_IMAGE` | `ghcr.io/sktelecom/bomlens-deep-cve:latest` | `--deep-cve`（grype CPE 比對）所使用的映像檔，網頁介面中同一個開關也會用它 |\n"
"| `SBOM_OUTPUT_FLAT` | — | 設為 `1` 時，產出物會平鋪寫在輸出基準目錄，不建立每次執行的子資料夾（隔離之前的舊配置，供仍預期舊路徑的 CI 使用） |\n"
"| `SBOM_OUTPUT_DIR` | `~/sbom-output` | 桌面版應用程式與網頁介面的輸出基準目錄（CLI 則改用 `--output-dir`）。每次掃描同樣會落在它底下的 `{Project}_{Version}/` 子資料夾 |\n"
"| `SBOM_UI_MOUNT_DIR` | — | 給不接受 CLI 參數的 Windows 啟動程式 `sbom-ui.bat` 使用：一個要開放給網頁介面、作為唯讀的目錄路徑掃描目標的額外資料夾（`--ui --mount` 的雙擊版對應做法）。請使用不含 `& ^ | < >` 的路徑——啟動程式遇到這些字元會直接拒絕，而不是把錯亂的掛載交給 Docker |\n"
"| `SBOM_LANG` | 系統語系 | `en` 或 `ko`，用於 Windows 啟動程式與桌面版應用程式。不是韓文的設定值一律顯示英文 |\n"
"| `SBOM_PULL` | `missing` | Windows 啟動程式的下載行為。`missing` 只在映像檔不存在時下載，`always` 每次執行都重新檢查 registry（可取得較新的 `:latest`），`never` 完全不碰網路 |\n"
"| `SBOM_IMAGE_TAR` | — | 由 `docker save` 產生的映像檔 tar 路徑。Windows 啟動程式會載入它，而不是從網路 pull；放在指令碼旁邊、檔名為 `bomlens-image.tar` 的檔案會被自動採用。搭配 `SBOM_PULL=never` 就能做到完全離線安裝 |\n"
"| `CVE_BIN_TOOL_MODE` | `auto` | 韌體的 CVE 比對方式。`auto` 在內建 CVE 資料庫存在時使用它，否則在網路可連線時從 NVD 下載。`offline` 只與內建資料庫比對。`online` 一律從網路更新。`components-only` 略過 CVE 比對，只產生僅含元件的 SBOM |\n"
"| `CVE_BIN_TOOL_HOME` | `/opt/cve-bin-tool-home` | 內建的 cve-bin-tool CVE 資料庫位置。cve-bin-tool 會讀取 `$CVE_BIN_TOOL_HOME/.cache/cve-bin-tool/cve.db`（它的快取是以 `HOME` 為索引） |\n"
"| `CVE_BIN_TOOL_DISABLE_SOURCES` | `GAD` | 韌體掃描時要停用的 cve-bin-tool 資料來源。`GAD`(GitLab Advisory) 預設停用，因為它在抓取資料時會讓內建的 cve-bin-tool 當掉 |\n"
"| `SCANOSS_API_URL` | OSSKB 免費 API | `--identify-vendored` 使用的端點。在封閉網路或大量使用的情境下，可指向 SCANOSS 的商業或自架端點 |\n"
"| `SCANOSS_API_KEY` | — | `SCANOSS_API_URL` 需要時所使用的認證資訊 |\n"
"| `SCANOSS_MIN_FILES` | `2` | 一個函式庫要被列出所需的最少相符檔案數，用來濾掉一次性的下游 fork 雜訊。設為 `1` 就會保留所有僅單一檔案相符的結果 |\n"
"| `GIT_TOKEN` | — | clone 私有 git 儲存庫所使用的權杖 |\n"
"| `HF_TOKEN` | — | `--model` 以及 AI SBOM 分析期間查詢資料集後設資料所使用的 HuggingFace 讀取權杖。私有或受管制 (gated) 的儲存庫必須提供，這也是在發佈模型之前先檢視它的做法。`HUGGING_FACE_HUB_TOKEN` 也可以當作別名使用 |\n"
"| `ENRICH_HF_SECURITY` | `true` | 在 `--model` 掃描中讀取 HuggingFace 自己執行的檔案安全掃描結果（逐檔的 ClamAV 與 picklescan），並記錄到 ML-BOM 裡。只讀取後設資料，不下載檔案。設為 `false` 可略過這項查詢 |\n"
"| `COSIGN_KEY` | — | `--sign` 所使用的簽章金鑰路徑 |\n"
"| `FETCH_LICENSE` | `true` | 在原始碼掃描期間解析相依項目的授權條款。設為 `false` 可略過查詢，執行得更快 |\n"
"| `PROJECT_LICENSE` | — | 與 `--license` 相同。以 SPDX 識別碼指定專案對外散布時採用的授權條款。它會決定 `bomlens:licenseConflict` 的判定，以及風險報告的衝突章節 |\n"
"| `SBOM_AUTHOR` | — | 與 `--sbom-author` 相同。產生這份 SBOM 的主體，記錄在 `metadata.authors` |\n"
"| `SECURITY_ENRICH` | `true` | 為安全報告補上 EPSS 與 CISA KEV 訊號。在封閉網路可設為 `false`，略過對外查詢 |\n"
"| `SECURITY_NVD_VERIFY` | `false` | 搭配 `--deep-cve` 使用：把 grype 的每一筆 `nvd:cpe` 結果與即時的 NVD 版本範圍核對，濾掉範圍外的誤判（需要 `NVD_API_KEY` 與網路連線，會多花幾分鐘）。預設關閉——結果會保留下來，並標示為版本未驗證 |\n"
"| `NVD_API_KEY` | — | `SECURITY_NVD_VERIFY` 使用的 NVD API 金鑰。只以名稱傳入容器，絕不會直接寫進指令中 |\n"
"| `API_URL` | — | 上傳伺服器的 URL（DT 伺服器，或 TRUSCA 的基準網址） |\n"
"| `API_KEY` | — | 上傳用的認證資訊。在 DT 用作 `X-Api-Key`，在 TRUSCA 用作 Bearer 權杖 |\n"
"| `UPLOAD_TARGET` | `dependency-track` | 上傳目的地：`dependency-track` 或 `trusca` |\n"
"| `TRUSCA_PROJECT_ID` | — | TRUSCA 的 project id (UUID)。目標為 `trusca` 時必填 |\n"
"| `TRUSCA_REF` | `main` | ingest 的 ref 標籤 |\n"
"| `TRUSCA_RELEASE` | `--version` 的值 | ingest 的 release 標籤 |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/reference/cli.md:100
msgid ""
"On Windows, environment variables set in a command prompt do not survive a "
"double-click. The launchers therefore also read `UI_PORT`, `SBOM_LANG`, "
"`SBOM_PULL`, `SBOM_IMAGE_TAR`, `SBOM_SCANNER_IMAGE`, `SBOM_OUTPUT_DIR` and "
"`SBOM_UI_MOUNT_DIR` from a plain text file: copy `scripts/"
"bomlens.settings.example.txt` to `bomlens.settings.txt` beside the scripts "
"(or to `%USERPROFILE%\\.bomlens\\settings.txt`).  A real environment "
"variable always wins over the file."
msgstr ""
"在 Windows 上，於命令提示字元設定的環境變數不會延續到雙擊執行。 因此啟動程式"
"也會從純文字檔讀取 `UI_PORT`、`SBOM_LANG`、 `SBOM_PULL`、`SBOM_IMAGE_TAR`、"
"`SBOM_SCANNER_IMAGE`、`SBOM_OUTPUT_DIR` 與 `SBOM_UI_MOUNT_DIR`：把 `scripts/"
"bomlens.settings.example.txt` 複製到指令碼旁邊並命名為 `bomlens.settings.txt`"
"（或放到 `%USERPROFILE%\\.bomlens\\settings.txt`）。 真正的環境變數一律優先於"
"這個檔案。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/reference/cli.md:102
msgid ""
"Output flags are detailed in the [reports guide](../guides/reports.md); "
"validating a received supplier SBOM is covered in the [supplier SBOM "
"validation](../guides/supplier-sbom.md)."
msgstr ""
"輸出旗標的細節請看[產生報告指南](../guides/reports.md)；收到供應者 SBOM 後的"
"驗證方式請看[供應者 SBOM 驗證](../guides/supplier-sbom.md)。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/reference/cli.md:103
#, no-wrap
msgid "Where outputs go"
msgstr "產出物存放位置 {#where-outputs-go}"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/reference/cli.md:106
msgid ""
"Each scan is isolated in its own `{Project}_{Version}/` subfolder, so the "
"files from one run stay together and the CLI never litters the source tree "
"it scans. That subfolder is created under a base directory:"
msgstr ""
"每次掃描都隔離在自己的 `{Project}_{Version}/` 子資料夾裡，因此同一次執行產生"
"的檔案會集中在一起，CLI 也絕不會弄亂它所掃描的原始碼樹。這個子資料夾會建立在"
"某個基準目錄底下："

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/reference/cli.md:109
msgid ""
"**CLI** (`scan-sbom.sh`): the base is the directory you ran the command in. "
"Override it with `--output-dir <dir>` (alias `-o`)."
msgstr ""
"**CLI** (`scan-sbom.sh`)：基準目錄就是你執行指令時所在的目錄。可用 `--"
"output-dir <dir>`（別名 `-o`）覆寫。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/reference/cli.md:109
msgid ""
"**Desktop app and web UI**: the base is `~/sbom-output` (`C:"
"\\Users\\<you>\\sbom-output` on Windows). Override it with the "
"`SBOM_OUTPUT_DIR` environment variable."
msgstr ""
"**桌面版應用程式與網頁介面**：基準目錄是 `~/sbom-output`（Windows 上是 `C:"
"\\Users\\<you>\\sbom-output`）。可用 `SBOM_OUTPUT_DIR` 環境變數覆寫。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/reference/cli.md:111
msgid ""
"For `--git` or archive ingestion the clone or extract happens in a temp "
"directory that is cleaned up on exit, and only the output subfolder remains."
msgstr ""
"使用 `--git` 或壓縮檔輸入時，clone 與解壓縮都在暫存目錄裡進行，結束時會清除，"
"最後只留下輸出的子資料夾。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/reference/cli.md:113
msgid ""
"A re-scan of the same project and version overwrites its subfolder by "
"default, keeping just the latest result. Add `--timestamp` to keep each run "
"instead: it appends `_YYYYMMDD-HHMMSS` to the folder name, for example "
"`MyApp_1.0.0_20260626-143000/`. The flag changes the folder name only, not "
"the SBOM file names or bytes, so it works together with `--byte-stable`."
msgstr ""
"重新掃描同一個專案與版本時，預設會覆寫它的子資料夾，只保留最新結果。想改成每"
"次執行都保留，就加上 `--timestamp`：它會在資料夾名稱後面加上 `_YYYYMMDD-"
"HHMMSS`，例如 `MyApp_1.0.0_20260626-143000/`。這個旗標只改資料夾名稱，不動 "
"SBOM 的檔名與位元組內容，所以可以和 `--byte-stable` 一起使用。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/reference/cli.md:115
msgid ""
"To restore the previous flat layout, where every file is written directly in "
"the base with no per-run subfolder, set `SBOM_OUTPUT_FLAT=1`. This is meant "
"for CI that expects the old paths."
msgstr ""
"想恢復先前的平鋪配置，也就是所有檔案直接寫在基準目錄、不建立每次執行的子資料"
"夾，請設定 `SBOM_OUTPUT_FLAT=1`。這是給仍然預期舊路徑的 CI 使用的。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/reference/cli.md:116
#, no-wrap
msgid "Pin the scanner image version"
msgstr "固定掃描器映像檔版本"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/reference/cli.md:119
msgid "Override the scanner image with `SBOM_SCANNER_IMAGE`."
msgstr "用 `SBOM_SCANNER_IMAGE` 覆寫掃描器映像檔。"

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/reference/cli.md:120
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"SBOM_SCANNER_IMAGE=\"ghcr.io/sktelecom/bomlens:1.8.0\" \\\n"
"  ./scripts/scan-sbom.sh --project \"MyApp\" --version \"1.0.0\" --generate-only\n"
msgstr ""
"SBOM_SCANNER_IMAGE=\"ghcr.io/sktelecom/bomlens:1.8.0\" \\\n"
"  ./scripts/scan-sbom.sh --project \"MyApp\" --version \"1.0.0\" --generate-only\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/reference/cli.md:127
#, no-wrap
msgid "Windows: no outputs appear"
msgstr "Windows：看不到任何產出物"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/reference/cli.md:130
msgid ""
"If the scan finishes but no output files show up, check that the folder you "
"ran from is inside a Docker file-sharing path. Anything under your home "
"directory (`C:\\Users\\...`) is shared by default in both Rancher Desktop "
"and Docker Desktop. From an unshared location the container cannot write "
"results to the host."
msgstr ""
"掃描結束了卻找不到輸出檔案時，請確認你執行指令的資料夾位在 Docker 的檔案共享"
"路徑內。家目錄 (`C:\\Users\\...`) 底下的路徑在 Rancher Desktop 與 Docker "
"Desktop 都預設共享。在未共享的位置執行時，容器無法把結果寫回主機。"

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/reference/cli.md:131
#, no-wrap
msgid "Docker permission error (Linux/WSL2)"
msgstr "Docker 權限錯誤 (Linux/WSL2)"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: docs/reference/cli.md:133
#, no-wrap
msgid "Got permission denied while trying to connect to the Docker daemon\n"
msgstr "Got permission denied while trying to connect to the Docker daemon\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/reference/cli.md:138
msgid ""
"Does not apply on Windows/macOS with Rancher Desktop or Docker Desktop. Add "
"your user to the `docker` group."
msgstr ""
"在使用 Rancher Desktop 或 Docker Desktop 的 Windows/macOS 上不會遇到這個問"
"題。請把你的使用者加入 `docker` 群組。"

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/reference/cli.md:139
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"sudo usermod -aG docker $USER\n"
"newgrp docker\n"
msgstr ""
"sudo usermod -aG docker $USER\n"
"newgrp docker\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/reference/cli.md:144
#, no-wrap
msgid "Out of disk space"
msgstr "磁碟空間不足"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: docs/reference/cli.md:146
#, no-wrap
msgid "no space left on device\n"
msgstr "no space left on device\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/reference/cli.md:151
msgid "Prune the Docker cache. From a terminal:"
msgstr "清理 Docker 快取。在終端機執行："

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/reference/cli.md:152
#, no-wrap
msgid "docker system prune -f\n"
msgstr "docker system prune -f\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/reference/cli.md:157
msgid ""
"With Rancher Desktop or Docker Desktop, the same cleanup is also available "
"from the app's own Preferences screen."
msgstr ""
"使用 Rancher Desktop 或 Docker Desktop 的話，也可以在應用程式本身的偏好設定"
" (Preferences) 畫面做同樣的清理。"

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/reference/cli.md:158
#, no-wrap
msgid "Anything else"
msgstr "其他問題"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: docs/reference/cli.md:163
msgid "Check verbose logs with `VERBOSE=true ./tests/test-scan.sh`."
msgstr "用 `VERBOSE=true ./tests/test-scan.sh` 查看詳細日誌。"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: docs/reference/cli.md:163
msgid ""
"Update the Docker image: `docker pull ghcr.io/sktelecom/bomlens:latest`."
msgstr "更新 Docker 映像檔：`docker pull ghcr.io/sktelecom/bomlens:latest`。"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: docs/reference/cli.md:163
msgid ""
"If it still fails, open a [GitHub Issue](https://github.com/sktelecom/"
"bomlens/issues) with your environment info and logs."
msgstr ""
"如果仍然失敗，請附上你的環境資訊與日誌，開一則 [GitHub Issue](https://"
"github.com/sktelecom/bomlens/issues)。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/reference/cli.md:164
msgid ""
"For how to use each mode, see the [input scenarios guide](../guides/by-"
"input.md); for the kinds of outputs, see the [artifacts reference]"
"(artifacts.md); for language detection, see [supported ecosystems]"
"(ecosystems.md)."
msgstr ""
"各模式的使用方式請看[依輸入類型的指南](../guides/by-input.md)；產出物的種類請"
"看[產出物參考](artifacts.md)；程式語言偵測請看[支援的生態系](ecosystems.md)。"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#: docs/reference/docker-image.md:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Call the BomLens scanner Docker image directly with docker run, for CI runners, Kubernetes jobs, and other environments where the script cannot live."
msgstr "以 docker run 直接呼叫 BomLens 掃描器 Docker 映像檔，適用於 CI runner、Kubernetes job 等無法放置指令碼的環境。"

#. type: Title #
#: docs/reference/docker-image.md:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the Docker image directly"
msgstr "直接使用 Docker 映像檔"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/reference/docker-image.md:8
msgid ""
"For everyday use we recommend the [`scan-sbom.sh`](../reference/cli.md) "
"script, which handles language detection, image selection, and volume mounts "
"for you. This document explains how to call the image directly with `docker "
"run` in environments where the script cannot live (CI runners, Kubernetes "
"jobs, and so on)."
msgstr ""
"平常使用時，我們建議用 [`scan-sbom.sh`](../reference/cli.md) 指令碼，它會替你"
"處理語言偵測、映像檔選擇與 volume 掛載。這份文件說明在無法放置指令碼的環境"
"（CI runner、Kubernetes job 等）裡，如何用 `docker run` 直接呼叫映像檔。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/reference/docker-image.md:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Images and tags"
msgstr "映像檔與標籤"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/reference/docker-image.md:17
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Image | Purpose |\n"
"|--------|------|\n"
"| `ghcr.io/sktelecom/bomlens` | Scanning and post-processing (canonical name) |\n"
"| `ghcr.io/sktelecom/sbom-generator`, `ghcr.io/sktelecom/sbom-scanner` | Aliases of the same image (former names, same digest) |\n"
"| `ghcr.io/sktelecom/bomlens-firmware` | Firmware analysis (includes GPL tools, opt-in) (legacy alias: sbom-scanner-firmware) |\n"
"| `ghcr.io/sktelecom/bomlens-deep-cve` | Bundles grype for deep CVE matching (opt-in). Used by the CLI's `--deep-cve` and by the web UI's Deep CVE matching toggle, both of which pull it automatically as a sibling container when it is not already the running image |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 映像檔 | 用途 |\n"
"|--------|------|\n"
"| `ghcr.io/sktelecom/bomlens` | 掃描與後處理（正式名稱） |\n"
"| `ghcr.io/sktelecom/sbom-generator`、`ghcr.io/sktelecom/sbom-scanner` | 同一個映像檔的別名（舊名稱，雜湊值相同） |\n"
"| `ghcr.io/sktelecom/bomlens-firmware` | 韌體分析（含 GPL 工具，opt-in）（舊別名：sbom-scanner-firmware） |\n"
"| `ghcr.io/sktelecom/bomlens-deep-cve` | 內含 grype 以進行深度 CVE 比對 (opt-in)。CLI 的 `--deep-cve` 與網頁介面的「深度 CVE 比對」開關都會用它；當目前執行的映像檔不是它時，兩者都會自動把它當作附屬容器下載 |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/reference/docker-image.md:19
msgid ""
"`latest` and version tags are available, and both `linux/amd64` and `linux/"
"arm64` are supported. Images are signed with cosign before publishing."
msgstr ""
"提供 `latest` 與版本標籤，並同時支援 `linux/amd64` 與 `linux/arm64`。映像檔在"
"發佈前會以 cosign 簽章。"

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/reference/docker-image.md:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "docker pull ghcr.io/sktelecom/bomlens:latest\n"
msgstr "docker pull ghcr.io/sktelecom/bomlens:latest\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/reference/docker-image.md:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "What is in the image"
msgstr "映像檔裡有什麼"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/reference/docker-image.md:27
msgid ""
"It is a lightweight image (based on python 3.12 slim) without language "
"toolchains. For source scans, transitive dependency resolution is handled by "
"the script, which pulls per-language cdxgen images separately. See "
"[Architecture](../concepts/architecture.md) for the structure."
msgstr ""
"這是一個不含語言 toolchain 的輕量映像檔（基於 python 3.12 slim）。原始碼掃描"
"的間接相依解析由指令碼負責，它會另外下載各語言的 cdxgen 映像檔。結構請看[架"
"構](../concepts/architecture.md)。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/reference/docker-image.md:35
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Tool | Version | Role |\n"
"|------|------|------|\n"
"| syft | v1.51.0 | Scans images, binaries, and directories |\n"
"| Trivy | v0.74.0 | Vulnerability report |\n"
"| cosign | v2.6.5 | SBOM signing |\n"
"| jq | — | SBOM normalization and notice generation |\n"
"| ScanCode Toolkit | 32.5.0 | Precise license detection (included only in opt-in builds) |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 工具 | 版本 | 角色 |\n"
"|------|------|------|\n"
"| syft | v1.51.0 | 掃描映像檔、二進位檔與目錄 |\n"
"| Trivy | v0.74.0 | 弱點報告 |\n"
"| cosign | v2.6.5 | SBOM 簽章 |\n"
"| jq | — | SBOM 正規化與產生授權聲明 |\n"
"| ScanCode Toolkit | 32.5.0 | 精確的授權條款偵測（只包含在 opt-in 的建置中） |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/reference/docker-image.md:37
msgid "Tool versions are pinned with `ARG` in `docker/Dockerfile`."
msgstr "工具版本以 `docker/Dockerfile` 裡的 `ARG` 固定。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/reference/docker-image.md:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "Running directly"
msgstr "直接執行"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/reference/docker-image.md:41
msgid ""
"Select the analysis mode with the `MODE` environment variable. All examples "
"below leave their outputs in the current directory and do not upload "
"anything (`UPLOAD_ENABLED=false`)."
msgstr ""
"用 `MODE` 環境變數選擇分析模式。以下所有範例都把輸出留在目前目錄，也不會上傳"
"任何東西 (`UPLOAD_ENABLED=false`)。"

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/reference/docker-image.md:42
#, no-wrap
msgid "Analyze a Docker image"
msgstr "分析 Docker 映像檔"

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/reference/docker-image.md:45
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"docker run --rm \\\n"
"  -v \"$(pwd)\":/host-output \\\n"
"  -v /var/run/docker.sock:/var/run/docker.sock \\\n"
"  -e MODE=IMAGE \\\n"
"  -e TARGET_IMAGE=\"nginx:alpine\" \\\n"
"  -e UPLOAD_ENABLED=false \\\n"
"  -e HOST_OUTPUT_DIR=/host-output \\\n"
"  -e PROJECT_NAME=\"Nginx\" \\\n"
"  -e PROJECT_VERSION=\"alpine\" \\\n"
"  ghcr.io/sktelecom/bomlens:latest\n"
msgstr ""
"docker run --rm \\\n"
"  -v \"$(pwd)\":/host-output \\\n"
"  -v /var/run/docker.sock:/var/run/docker.sock \\\n"
"  -e MODE=IMAGE \\\n"
"  -e TARGET_IMAGE=\"nginx:alpine\" \\\n"
"  -e UPLOAD_ENABLED=false \\\n"
"  -e HOST_OUTPUT_DIR=/host-output \\\n"
"  -e PROJECT_NAME=\"Nginx\" \\\n"
"  -e PROJECT_VERSION=\"alpine\" \\\n"
"  ghcr.io/sktelecom/bomlens:latest\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/reference/docker-image.md:58
#, no-wrap
msgid "Analyze a binary file"
msgstr "分析二進位檔案"

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/reference/docker-image.md:60
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"docker run --rm \\\n"
"  -v \"$(pwd)\":/target \\\n"
"  -v \"$(pwd)\":/host-output \\\n"
"  -e MODE=BINARY \\\n"
"  -e TARGET_FILE=/target/firmware.bin \\\n"
"  -e UPLOAD_ENABLED=false \\\n"
"  -e HOST_OUTPUT_DIR=/host-output \\\n"
"  -e PROJECT_NAME=\"Firmware\" \\\n"
"  -e PROJECT_VERSION=\"1.0\" \\\n"
"  ghcr.io/sktelecom/bomlens:latest\n"
msgstr ""
"docker run --rm \\\n"
"  -v \"$(pwd)\":/target \\\n"
"  -v \"$(pwd)\":/host-output \\\n"
"  -e MODE=BINARY \\\n"
"  -e TARGET_FILE=/target/firmware.bin \\\n"
"  -e UPLOAD_ENABLED=false \\\n"
"  -e HOST_OUTPUT_DIR=/host-output \\\n"
"  -e PROJECT_NAME=\"Firmware\" \\\n"
"  -e PROJECT_VERSION=\"1.0\" \\\n"
"  ghcr.io/sktelecom/bomlens:latest\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/reference/docker-image.md:73
#, no-wrap
msgid "Analyze a source directory"
msgstr "分析原始碼目錄"

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/reference/docker-image.md:76
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"docker run --rm \\\n"
"  -v \"$(pwd)\":/src \\\n"
"  -v \"$(pwd)\":/host-output \\\n"
"  -e MODE=SOURCE \\\n"
"  -e UPLOAD_ENABLED=false \\\n"
"  -e HOST_OUTPUT_DIR=/host-output \\\n"
"  -e PROJECT_NAME=\"MyApp\" \\\n"
"  -e PROJECT_VERSION=\"1.0.0\" \\\n"
"  ghcr.io/sktelecom/bomlens:latest\n"
msgstr ""
"docker run --rm \\\n"
"  -v \"$(pwd)\":/src \\\n"
"  -v \"$(pwd)\":/host-output \\\n"
"  -e MODE=SOURCE \\\n"
"  -e UPLOAD_ENABLED=false \\\n"
"  -e HOST_OUTPUT_DIR=/host-output \\\n"
"  -e PROJECT_NAME=\"MyApp\" \\\n"
"  -e PROJECT_VERSION=\"1.0.0\" \\\n"
"  ghcr.io/sktelecom/bomlens:latest\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/reference/docker-image.md:89
msgid ""
"In direct runs, `SOURCE` mode has syft read the package manifests inside the "
"container, so it may only capture direct dependencies. If you need "
"transitive dependencies, use `scan-sbom.sh`, which routes to the per-"
"language cdxgen images."
msgstr ""
"直接執行時，`SOURCE` 模式是讓 syft 在容器內讀取套件的宣告檔，因此可能只會抓到"
"直接相依。如果需要間接相依，請改用 `scan-sbom.sh`，它會分流到各語言的 cdxgen "
"映像檔。"

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/reference/docker-image.md:90
#, no-wrap
msgid "Notice and reports in one run"
msgstr "一次產生授權聲明與報告"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/reference/docker-image.md:93
msgid ""
"In direct runs, the notice and security reports are off by default. Turn on "
"the following variables to get the same outputs as the CLI's `--all`."
msgstr ""
"直接執行時，授權聲明與安全報告預設是關閉的。開啟下列變數，就能得到和 CLI `--"
"all` 相同的輸出。"

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/reference/docker-image.md:95
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"docker run --rm \\\n"
"  -v \"$(pwd)\":/host-output \\\n"
"  -v /var/run/docker.sock:/var/run/docker.sock \\\n"
"  -e MODE=IMAGE \\\n"
"  -e TARGET_IMAGE=\"nginx:alpine\" \\\n"
"  -e GENERATE_NOTICE=true \\\n"
"  -e GENERATE_SECURITY=true \\\n"
"  -e GENERATE_REPORT=true \\\n"
"  -e UPLOAD_ENABLED=false \\\n"
"  -e HOST_OUTPUT_DIR=/host-output \\\n"
"  -e PROJECT_NAME=\"Nginx\" \\\n"
"  -e PROJECT_VERSION=\"alpine\" \\\n"
"  ghcr.io/sktelecom/bomlens:latest\n"
msgstr ""
"docker run --rm \\\n"
"  -v \"$(pwd)\":/host-output \\\n"
"  -v /var/run/docker.sock:/var/run/docker.sock \\\n"
"  -e MODE=IMAGE \\\n"
"  -e TARGET_IMAGE=\"nginx:alpine\" \\\n"
"  -e GENERATE_NOTICE=true \\\n"
"  -e GENERATE_SECURITY=true \\\n"
"  -e GENERATE_REPORT=true \\\n"
"  -e UPLOAD_ENABLED=false \\\n"
"  -e HOST_OUTPUT_DIR=/host-output \\\n"
"  -e PROJECT_NAME=\"Nginx\" \\\n"
"  -e PROJECT_VERSION=\"alpine\" \\\n"
"  ghcr.io/sktelecom/bomlens:latest\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/reference/docker-image.md:111
#, no-wrap
msgid "Environment variables"
msgstr "環境變數 {#environment-variables}"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/reference/docker-image.md:147
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Variable | Required | Default | Description |\n"
"|-----------|------|--------|------|\n"
"| `MODE` | Yes | `POSTPROCESS` | Analysis mode: `SOURCE`, `IMAGE`, `BINARY`, `ROOTFS`, `FIRMWARE`, `ANALYZE` |\n"
"| `PROJECT_NAME` | Yes | — | Project name |\n"
"| `PROJECT_VERSION` | Yes | — | Project version |\n"
"| `TARGET_IMAGE` | Per mode | — | Image name for `IMAGE` mode (requires the docker.sock mount) |\n"
"| `TARGET_FILE` | Per mode | — | File path for `BINARY`/`FIRMWARE` mode (path inside the container) |\n"
"| `TARGET_DIR` | Per mode | — | Directory path for `ROOTFS` mode |\n"
"| `UPLOAD_ENABLED` | — | `true` | If `false`, save locally without uploading (same as CLI `--generate-only`) |\n"
"| `HOST_OUTPUT_DIR` | — | — | Mounted path to copy the outputs to |\n"
"| `GENERATE_NOTICE` | — | `false` | Generate the open-source notice (CLI `--notice`) |\n"
"| `GENERATE_SECURITY` | — | `false` | Generate the Trivy security report (CLI `--security`) |\n"
"| `GENERATE_REPORT` | — | `false` | Generate the open-source risk analysis report (off in direct runs, unlike the CLI default) |\n"
"| `ENRICH_MAVEN_CPE` | — | `true` | Attach an NVD-matchable `cpe:2.3` to maven components (derived from the groupId) so a CPE-aware engine can reach their NVD-only CVEs; unmapped groups get no CPE (skipped for AI SBOMs) |\n"
"| `ENRICH_GITHUB_CPE` | — | `true` | Attach an NVD-matchable `cpe:2.3` to a small, hand-verified set of `pkg:github/` components (source-repository-only coordinates, typical for large C/C++ projects with no package-manager ecosystem) so a CPE-aware engine can reach their NVD-only CVEs; anything not in the curated list gets no CPE (skipped for AI SBOMs) |\n"
"| `ENRICH_INTERPRETER_CPE` | — | `true` | Attach an NVD-matchable `cpe:2.3` to a small, hand-verified set of interpreter components (e.g. Python packaged as a conda or NuGet artifact) so a CPE-aware engine can reach their NVD-only CVEs; anything not in the curated list gets no CPE (skipped for AI SBOMs) |\n"
"| `SECURITY_NVD_VERIFY` | — | `false` | With `--deep-cve`: verify each grype `nvd:cpe` finding against the live NVD version range and drop out-of-range false positives (needs `NVD_API_KEY` + network; adds minutes). Off by default — findings are kept and flagged version-unverified |\n"
"| `NVD_API_KEY` | For `SECURITY_NVD_VERIFY` | — | NVD API key used by the deep-cve version filter; passed to the container by name only (never inlined) |\n"
"| `ENRICH_EOL` | — | `true` | Flag components past their upstream end-of-life from a bundled offline snapshot (skipped for AI SBOMs) |\n"
"| `ENRICH_MALICIOUS` | — | `true` | Flag components that are known-malicious packages (typosquats, hijacked accounts) from a bundled offline OSV snapshot. A separate signal from vulnerabilities: the response is removal and credential rotation, not an upgrade |\n"
"| `ENRICH_OS_CONTEXT` | — | `true` | Synthesize an `operating-system` component from distro package PURLs (rpm, deb, and apk). Trivy selects the distro vulnerability feed from that component, so without it the OS packages in a supplier SBOM or rootfs scan would get no OS CVE matches at all. No-op when the SBOM has no recognizable distro packages — including a distro Trivy carries no feed for, such as OpenWRT (skipped for AI SBOMs) |\n"
"| `STALENESS_ENRICH` | — | `false` | Add deps.dev version currency (how many releases behind latest); needs network access |\n"
"| `ENRICH_HF_SECURITY` | — | `true` | AIBOM mode: read HuggingFace's per-file security scan results (ClamAV + picklescan) into the ML-BOM; metadata only, no file download |\n"
"| `API_KEY`, `API_URL` | For uploads | — | Upload credential and server URL. DT uses `X-Api-Key`; TRUSCA uses a Bearer token |\n"
"| `UPLOAD_TARGET` | — | `dependency-track` | Upload destination: `dependency-track` (DT-compatible) or `trusca` (native ingest, not DT-compatible) |\n"
"| `TRUSCA_PROJECT_ID` | When `trusca` | — | Target TRUSCA project id (UUID). Must already exist (no auto-create) |\n"
"| `TRUSCA_REF` | — | `main` | Ingest ref label |\n"
"| `TRUSCA_RELEASE` | — | `PROJECT_VERSION` | Ingest release label |\n"
"| `BOMLENS_MAVEN_FULL_GRAPH` | — | — | Maven source scans: set `1` to keep the full resolved graph instead of filtering to compile/runtime scope |\n"
"| `BOMLENS_NODE_FULL_GRAPH` | — | — | Node.js source scans: set `1` to keep the full dev-plus-production graph instead of the production-only set |\n"
"| `BOMLENS_KEEP_BUILD_OUTPUT` | — | — | Source scans: set `1` to leave the resolved tree in place. By default the scan restores the files its resolvers rewrote (`go.mod`, `go.sum`, `Cargo.lock`, `Gemfile.lock`, `Package.resolved`) and removes the build directories they created, so the scanned project is handed back as it was |\n"
"| `CYCLONEDX_SPEC_VERSIONS` | — | `1.3 1.4 1.5 1.6` | Accepted CycloneDX spec versions for the conformance check (space-separated); overrides the default range |\n"
"| `AI_CYCLONEDX_SPEC_VERSIONS` | — | `1.3 1.4 1.5 1.6 1.7` | Accepted CycloneDX versions for AI SBOMs (ML-BOM), which additionally allow 1.7 |\n"
"| `SPDX_SPEC_VERSIONS` | — | `SPDX-2.2 SPDX-2.3` | Accepted SPDX spec versions for the conformance check |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 環境變數 | 必要 | 預設值 | 說明 |\n"
"|-----------|------|--------|------|\n"
"| `MODE` | 是 | `POSTPROCESS` | 分析模式：`SOURCE`、`IMAGE`、`BINARY`、`ROOTFS`、`FIRMWARE`、`ANALYZE` |\n"
"| `PROJECT_NAME` | 是 | — | 專案名稱 |\n"
"| `PROJECT_VERSION` | 是 | — | 專案版本 |\n"
"| `TARGET_IMAGE` | 依模式 | — | `IMAGE` 模式的映像檔名稱（需要掛載 docker.sock） |\n"
"| `TARGET_FILE` | 依模式 | — | `BINARY`/`FIRMWARE` 模式的檔案路徑（容器內的路徑） |\n"
"| `TARGET_DIR` | 依模式 | — | `ROOTFS` 模式的目錄路徑 |\n"
"| `UPLOAD_ENABLED` | — | `true` | 設為 `false` 時只儲存在本機，不上傳（等同 CLI 的 `--generate-only`） |\n"
"| `HOST_OUTPUT_DIR` | — | — | 用來複製輸出的掛載路徑 |\n"
"| `GENERATE_NOTICE` | — | `false` | 產生開放原始碼授權聲明 (CLI `--notice`) |\n"
"| `GENERATE_SECURITY` | — | `false` | 產生 Trivy 安全報告 (CLI `--security`) |\n"
"| `GENERATE_REPORT` | — | `false` | 產生開放原始碼風險分析報告（與 CLI 預設不同，直接執行時是關閉的） |\n"
"| `ENRICH_MAVEN_CPE` | — | `true` | 為 maven 元件附上可與 NVD 比對的 `cpe:2.3`（由 groupId 推導），讓支援 CPE 的引擎也能找到它們僅存在於 NVD 的 CVE；未能對應的 group 不會附上 CPE（AI SBOM 會略過） |\n"
"| `ENRICH_GITHUB_CPE` | — | `true` | 為一小批經人工驗證的 `pkg:github/` 元件（只以原始碼儲存庫座標識別，常見於沒有套件管理器生態系的大型 C/C++ 專案）附上可與 NVD 比對的 `cpe:2.3`，讓支援 CPE 的引擎也能找到它們僅存在於 NVD 的 CVE；不在人工整理清單裡的一律不附 CPE（AI SBOM 會略過） |\n"
"| `ENRICH_INTERPRETER_CPE` | — | `true` | 為一小批經人工驗證的解譯器元件（例如以 conda 或 NuGet 產出物形式散布的 Python）附上可與 NVD 比對的 `cpe:2.3`，讓支援 CPE 的引擎也能找到它們僅存在於 NVD 的 CVE；不在人工整理清單裡的一律不附 CPE（AI SBOM 會略過） |\n"
"| `SECURITY_NVD_VERIFY` | — | `false` | 搭配 `--deep-cve` 使用：把 grype 的每一筆 `nvd:cpe` 結果與即時的 NVD 版本範圍核對，濾掉範圍外的誤判（需要 `NVD_API_KEY` 與網路連線，會多花幾分鐘）。預設關閉——結果會保留下來，並標示為版本未驗證 |\n"
"| `NVD_API_KEY` | `SECURITY_NVD_VERIFY` 需要時 | — | deep-cve 版本篩選所使用的 NVD API 金鑰；只以名稱傳入容器（絕不會直接寫進指令中） |\n"
"| `ENRICH_EOL` | — | `true` | 依內建的離線快照，標記已終止支援（超過上游 end-of-life）的元件（AI SBOM 會略過） |\n"
"| `ENRICH_MALICIOUS` | — | `true` | 依內建的離線 OSV 快照，標記已知的惡意套件（名稱仿冒、帳號被劫持）。這是與弱點不同的訊號：應對方式是移除並輪替認證資訊，而不是升級版本 |\n"
"| `ENRICH_OS_CONTEXT` | — | `true` | 從發行版套件的 PURL（rpm、deb 與 apk）合成出一個 `operating-system` 元件。Trivy 會依這個元件挑選發行版的弱點資料來源，少了它，供應者 SBOM 或 rootfs 掃描裡的 OS 套件就完全比對不到 OS 的 CVE。SBOM 裡沒有可辨識的發行版套件時不會有任何作用——包含 Trivy 沒有提供資料來源的發行版，例如 OpenWRT（AI SBOM 會略過） |\n"
"| `STALENESS_ENRICH` | — | `false` | 加入 deps.dev 的版本新舊資訊（落後最新版幾個發行版本）；需要網路連線 |\n"
"| `ENRICH_HF_SECURITY` | — | `true` | AIBOM 模式：把 HuggingFace 逐檔的安全掃描結果 (ClamAV + picklescan) 讀進 ML-BOM。只讀取後設資料，不下載檔案 |\n"
"| `API_KEY`、`API_URL` | 上傳時 | — | 上傳用的認證資訊與伺服器 URL。DT 用作 `X-Api-Key`，TRUSCA 用作 Bearer 權杖 |\n"
"| `UPLOAD_TARGET` | — | `dependency-track` | 上傳目的地：`dependency-track`（DT 相容）或 `trusca`（原生 ingest，不與 DT 相容） |\n"
"| `TRUSCA_PROJECT_ID` | 目標為 `trusca` 時 | — | 要上傳的 TRUSCA project id (UUID)。必須事先存在（不會自動建立） |\n"
"| `TRUSCA_REF` | — | `main` | ingest 的 ref 標籤 |\n"
"| `TRUSCA_RELEASE` | — | `PROJECT_VERSION` | ingest 的 release 標籤 |\n"
"| `BOMLENS_MAVEN_FULL_GRAPH` | — | — | Maven 原始碼掃描：設為 `1` 時保留完整的解析關係圖，不篩選成 compile/runtime 範圍 |\n"
"| `BOMLENS_NODE_FULL_GRAPH` | — | — | Node.js 原始碼掃描：設為 `1` 時保留 dev 與 production 合併的完整關係圖，而不是只取 production 的集合 |\n"
"| `BOMLENS_KEEP_BUILD_OUTPUT` | — | — | 原始碼掃描：設為 `1` 時保留解析出的相依樹。預設情況下，掃描會還原解析器改寫過的檔案（`go.mod`、`go.sum`、`Cargo.lock`、`Gemfile.lock`、`Package.resolved`），並移除它們建立的建置目錄，讓被掃描的專案回到原樣 |\n"
"| `CYCLONEDX_SPEC_VERSIONS` | — | `1.3 1.4 1.5 1.6` | 符合性檢查所接受的 CycloneDX 規格版本（以空白分隔）；會覆寫預設範圍 |\n"
"| `AI_CYCLONEDX_SPEC_VERSIONS` | — | `1.3 1.4 1.5 1.6 1.7` | AI SBOM (ML-BOM) 所接受的 CycloneDX 版本，額外允許 1.7 |\n"
"| `SPDX_SPEC_VERSIONS` | — | `SPDX-2.2 SPDX-2.3` | 符合性檢查所接受的 SPDX 規格版本 |\n"

