#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#: docs/reference/ui.md:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Reference for the BomLens web UI and desktop app — how to launch it, the shell layout, scan targets, and the result sections."
msgstr "BomLens 網頁介面與桌面版應用程式參考——啟動方式、介面框架配置、掃描目標與結果區段。"

#. type: Title #
#: docs/reference/ui.md:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Web UI & desktop app"
msgstr "網頁介面與桌面版應用程式"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/reference/ui.md:8
msgid ""
"Scan from a browser without the CLI. The UI server is built into the scanner "
"image, so no extra install is needed."
msgstr ""
"不用 CLI，直接從瀏覽器掃描。介面伺服器已內建在掃描器映像檔裡，不需要額外安"
"裝。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/reference/ui.md:10
msgid "![The BomLens New scan screen](../images/web-ui.png)"
msgstr "![BomLens 的「新增掃描」畫面](../images/web-ui.png)"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/reference/ui.md:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "**macOS / Linux:**\n"
msgstr "**macOS / Linux：**\n"

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/reference/ui.md:12
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"cd ~/sbom-output      # output folder (anywhere is fine)\n"
"/path/to/bomlens/scripts/scan-sbom.sh --ui\n"
"# → opens http://localhost:8080 automatically\n"
msgstr ""
"cd ~/sbom-output      # 輸出資料夾（放哪裡都行）\n"
"/path/to/bomlens/scripts/scan-sbom.sh --ui\n"
"# → 會自動開啟 http://localhost:8080\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/reference/ui.md:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Windows — double-click (no command line):** in the unzipped folder, double-click `scripts\\sbom-ui.bat` and a browser opens `http://localhost:8080` shortly after. Docker just needs to be running, and `sbom-ui.bat` works on Rancher Desktop or Docker Desktop (on WSL2, run `scan-sbom.sh --ui` inside WSL).\n"
msgstr "**Windows——雙擊執行（不用指令列）：**在解壓縮後的資料夾裡雙擊 `scripts\\sbom-ui.bat`，稍後瀏覽器就會開啟 `http://localhost:8080`。只要 Docker 正在執行就行，`sbom-ui.bat` 在 Rancher Desktop 或 Docker Desktop 上都能用（在 WSL2 上請在 WSL 內執行 `scan-sbom.sh --ui`）。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/reference/ui.md:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "> The run location is the output base, and it scans that folder's source only when you choose \"Current folder\" as the scan target. If you use a GitHub URL, an upload, or a Docker image, the run location does not matter. Each scan is saved to its own `{Project}_{Version}/` subfolder; the base defaults and how to change them are in [Where outputs go](cli.md#where-outputs-go).\n"
msgstr "> 執行的位置就是輸出的基準目錄，而只有在掃描目標選「目前資料夾」時，才會掃描該資料夾裡的原始碼。使用 GitHub URL、上傳或 Docker 映像檔時，執行位置無關緊要。每次掃描都會存到自己的 `{Project}_{Version}/` 子資料夾；基準目錄的預設值與變更方式請看[產出物存放位置](cli.md#where-outputs-go)。\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/reference/ui.md:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "The shell"
msgstr "介面框架"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/reference/ui.md:25
msgid ""
"The interface has a top bar across the width, a left rail for the current "
"scan's sections, and a content area:"
msgstr ""
"介面由橫跨整個寬度的頂端列、放置目前掃描各區段的左側側邊欄，以及內容區組成："

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/reference/ui.md:29
msgid ""
"**Top bar** — the product mark (links home), the current project, a Re-scan "
"button (shown on a scan that still carries its settings, so you can re-run "
"the same target with the toggles prefilled), global search across components "
"and CVEs, the Scan management menu (the clock icon opens a list of past "
"scans with a delete control and a link to the full list), the New scan "
"button, and the language (KO / EN / TW) and light/dark toggles."
msgstr ""
"**頂端列**——產品標誌（點了回首頁）、目前的專案、「重新掃描」按鈕（只在仍保有"
"設定的掃描上出現，可用預先填入的開關設定重新掃描同一個目標）、橫跨元件與 CVE "
"的全域搜尋、掃描管理選單（點選時鐘圖示會展開過去的掃描清單，附有刪除按鈕與前"
"往完整清單的連結）、「新增掃描」按鈕，以及語言 (KO / EN / TW) 與淺色／深色切"
"換。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/reference/ui.md:29
msgid ""
"**Left rail** — two named links out of the scan (Scan management, New scan) "
"above the current scan's sections, which are grouped under Inventory, "
"Security, Compliance, AI and Outputs. The rail adapts to the scan: AI "
"sections appear only for AI/ML SBOMs, and a section appears only when its "
"data exists. It collapses to icons on narrow windows. With no scan open — "
"the home screen — there is no rail."
msgstr ""
"**左側側邊欄**——最上方是兩個離開目前掃描的具名連結（掃描管理、新增掃描），下"
"方才是目前掃描的各個區段，並歸在清冊、安全、合規、AI 與產出物之下。側邊欄會隨"
"掃描而變：AI 區段只在 AI/ML SBOM 才出現，而每個區段也只在有對應資料時才顯示。"
"視窗較窄時會收合成只剩圖示。沒有開啟任何掃描時，也就是首頁畫面，不會有側邊"
"欄。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/reference/ui.md:29
msgid ""
"**Content** — the home (Scan management) screen, the New scan form, the "
"running view, or the active result section."
msgstr ""
"**內容區**——首頁（掃描管理）畫面、「新增掃描」表單、執行中的畫面，或當前選定"
"的結果區段。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/reference/ui.md:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "The global actions (New scan, Scan management) live in the top bar, and the rail repeats them as labelled links above its sections so a result screen always shows a named way back. Every navigation element — the logo, New scan, the rail sections, the jump cards and the past-scan links — is a real link backed by a URL hash (`#/scan/<id>/<section>`), so Cmd/Ctrl or middle click opens it in a new tab.\n"
msgstr "全域動作（新增掃描、掃描管理）放在頂端列，側邊欄則在區段上方以帶文字的連結重複這兩項，因此結果畫面上永遠看得到一條寫著名字的回頭路。每個導覽元素——標誌、新增掃描、側邊欄的各區段、跳轉卡片與過去掃描的連結——都是有 URL hash (`#/scan/<id>/<section>`) 支撐的真正連結，因此 Cmd／Ctrl 點擊或中鍵點擊就能在新分頁開啟。\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/reference/ui.md:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "New scan"
msgstr "新增掃描 {#new-scan}"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/reference/ui.md:35
msgid ""
"The New scan screen is two panes. On the left, pick a source — grouped into "
"Code (current folder, a directory path, a GitHub URL, a ZIP upload), "
"Artifact (a Docker image, a package or build artifact, a firmware image), "
"SBOM (analyze an existing SBOM) and AI model (generate an ML-BOM from a "
"HuggingFace model, or from a model file you upload) — and fill in the source-"
"specific input below the tiles. On the right, enter the project name and "
"version, choose the outputs to generate, and start the scan."
msgstr ""
"「新增掃描」畫面分成兩欄。左欄挑選來源，分成程式碼（目前資料夾、目錄路徑、"
"GitHub URL、ZIP 上傳）、產出物（Docker 映像檔、套件或建置產出物、韌體映像"
"檔）、SBOM（分析既有的 SBOM）與 AI 模型（從 HuggingFace 模型產生 ML-BOM，或上"
"傳你自己的模型檔案），然後在來源方塊下方填入該來源專屬的輸入欄。右欄輸入專案"
"名稱與版本、挑選要產生的產出物，然後開始掃描。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/reference/ui.md:48
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Scan target | Input method | Backend mode |\n"
"|-------------|--------------|--------------|\n"
"| Current folder | scans the source in the UI's run folder | SOURCE |\n"
"| Directory path | a subfolder under the run folder (e.g. an OS rootfs), a folder mounted with `--ui --mount <dir>`, or — in the desktop app — a folder added with the Add folder button | ROOTFS, or ANALYZE when the folder is a [Yocto build directory](#yocto-build-directory) |\n"
"| GitHub URL | enter the repository URL | SOURCE (clone) |\n"
"| ZIP upload | upload a `.zip`/tar file | SOURCE (extract) |\n"
"| Package upload | upload a build artifact — `.jar`, `.war`, `.ear`, `.deb`, `.rpm`, `.whl` | BINARY (a wheel is unpacked and scanned as ROOTFS) |\n"
"| SBOM upload | upload an existing SBOM (JSON, or the `.spdx.tar.zst` a Yocto SPDX 2.2 build deploys) | ANALYZE |\n"
"| Firmware upload | upload a `.bin`, etc. | FIRMWARE |\n"
"| Docker image | enter the image name | IMAGE |\n"
"| AI model | enter a HuggingFace model id (`org/model`) | AIBOM |\n"
"| Model file | upload a `.gguf`, `.safetensors`, `.pt`, … (up to 8 GB) | MODELFILE |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 掃描目標 | 輸入方式 | 後端模式 |\n"
"|-------------|--------------|--------------|\n"
"| 目前資料夾 | 掃描介面執行資料夾中的原始碼 | SOURCE |\n"
"| 目錄路徑 | 執行資料夾底下的子資料夾（例如 OS rootfs）、以 `--ui --mount <dir>` 掛載的資料夾，或在桌面版應用程式中以「新增資料夾…」按鈕加入的資料夾 | ROOTFS；資料夾若是 [Yocto 建置目錄](#yocto-build-directory)，則為 ANALYZE |\n"
"| GitHub URL | 輸入儲存庫 URL | SOURCE (clone) |\n"
"| ZIP 上傳 | 上傳 `.zip`／tar 檔案 | SOURCE (extract) |\n"
"| 套件上傳 | 上傳建置產出物——`.jar`、`.war`、`.ear`、`.deb`、`.rpm`、`.whl` | BINARY（wheel 會先解開封裝，再以 ROOTFS 方式掃描） |\n"
"| SBOM 上傳 | 上傳既有的 SBOM（JSON，或 Yocto SPDX 2.2 建置所發佈的 `.spdx.tar.zst`） | ANALYZE |\n"
"| 韌體上傳 | 上傳 `.bin` 等檔案 | FIRMWARE |\n"
"| Docker 映像檔 | 輸入映像檔名稱 | IMAGE |\n"
"| AI 模型 | 輸入 HuggingFace 模型 id (`org/model`) | AIBOM |\n"
"| 模型檔案 | 上傳 `.gguf`、`.safetensors`、`.pt` 等（最大 8 GB） | MODELFILE |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/reference/ui.md:50
msgid ""
"Generation options are the open-source notice and the security "
"(vulnerability) report. A scan always writes the SBOM in CycloneDX; an SPDX "
"copy is exported afterwards from the results screen, so there is nothing to "
"decide here. Separately, an **Advanced scan options** section gathers the "
"toggles that change how the source is analyzed rather than which files are "
"produced. License scan (ScanCode) scans the project's own source files for "
"per-file license text (1st-party; it does not download the declared "
"dependencies) and applies to source-code scans (current folder, GitHub URL, "
"ZIP upload). File-level identification (SCANOSS) finds third-party open "
"source copied into the tree (mainly C/C++), also for source-code scans. For "
"firmware, the advanced option is OSV advisories. SCANOSS uses the free OSSKB "
"service, which is rate-limited and may return nothing under frequent use, so "
"add a token from scanoss.com for regular runs. Docker images, SBOM uploads "
"and AI models have no advanced options. Choosing SBOM upload (ANALYZE) "
"forces the notice and security reports on for the risk analysis, and an AI-"
"model scan produces the notice only (it has no package CVEs, so the security "
"report is skipped)."
msgstr ""
"產生選項有開放原始碼授權聲明與安全（弱點）報告。掃描一律以 CycloneDX 寫出 "
"SBOM，SPDX 副本則是在掃描結束後從結果畫面匯出，因此這裡沒有需要事先決定的事。"
"另外還有一個**進階掃描選項**區段，收攏的是改變原始碼分析方式、而非改變產生哪"
"些檔案的開關。逐檔授權條款掃描 (ScanCode) 會掃過專案自己的原始碼檔案，找出逐"
"檔的授權條款文字（自家程式碼；它不會下載已宣告的相依項目），適用於原始碼掃描"
"（目前資料夾、GitHub URL、ZIP 上傳）。偵測複製進來的開放原始碼 (SCANOSS) 會找"
"出複製進原始碼樹的第三方開放原始碼（主要是 C/C++），同樣適用於原始碼掃描。韌"
"體的進階選項則是更多弱點公告 (OSV)。SCANOSS 使用免費的 OSSKB 服務，該服務有"
"速率限制，頻繁使用時可能得不到結果，因此若要經常執行，請到 scanoss.com 取得權"
"杖填入。Docker 映像檔、SBOM 上傳與 AI 模型沒有進階選項。選擇 SBOM 上傳"
" (ANALYZE) 時，為進行風險分析會強制開啟授權聲明與安全報告；AI 模型掃描只會產"
"生授權聲明（它沒有套件 CVE，因此略過安全報告）。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/reference/ui.md:52
msgid ""
"A **Reproducible output** toggle produces byte-identical SBOMs across runs "
"(the UI equivalent of `--byte-stable`); it is available for source, image "
"and firmware scans, not for SBOM analysis or AI models."
msgstr ""
"**可重現的輸出**開關會讓每次執行都產生逐位元組完全相同的 SBOM（相當於 CLI 的 "
"`--byte-stable`）；原始碼、映像檔與韌體掃描可以使用，SBOM 分析與 AI 模型則沒"
"有這個選項。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/reference/ui.md:54
msgid ""
"An **Outbound license** field takes the SPDX id your project ships under, "
"such as `Apache-2.0` (the UI equivalent of `--license`). Fill it in and the "
"Licenses section reports which dependencies clash with it; leave it empty "
"and that check stays off, which the section says outright. It appears "
"wherever BomLens generates the SBOM, so not for an analyzed supplier SBOM "
"(which carries the supplier's own declaration) or an AI model."
msgstr ""
"**對外授權條款**欄位填入你的專案對外發行所採用的 SPDX 識別碼，例如 "
"`Apache-2.0`（相當於 CLI 的 `--license`）。填了之後，「授權條款」區段會列出哪"
"些相依項目與它衝突；留空則不做這項檢查，區段也會把這件事直接寫出來。這個欄位"
"只在 BomLens 自行產生 SBOM 時出現，因此分析供應者 SBOM（其中已帶有供應者自己"
"的宣告）與 AI 模型都沒有它。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/reference/ui.md:56
msgid ""
"Below the outputs, an optional **Upload** step can send the finished SBOM to "
"a server. Turn it on to pick the destination — Dependency-Track or TRUSCA — "
"and enter the server URL and an access token; TRUSCA also asks for the "
"target project id. The URL and token are used for that one run and are never "
"saved. It is the UI equivalent of the CLI upload options; see [Upload to "
"Dependency-Track / TRUSCA](../guides/upload.md)."
msgstr ""
"產出物下方是選用的**上傳**步驟，可以把完成的 SBOM 送到伺服器。開啟後挑選目的"
"地——Dependency-Track 或 TRUSCA——並輸入伺服器 URL 與存取權杖；TRUSCA 還會要求"
"填入目標專案 id。URL 與權杖只用於本次執行，絕不儲存。這相當於 CLI 的上傳選"
"項，詳見[上傳到 Dependency-Track / TRUSCA](../guides/upload.md)。"

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/reference/ui.md:57
#, no-wrap
msgid "Yocto build directory"
msgstr "Yocto 建置目錄 {#yocto-build-directory}"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/reference/ui.md:60
#, no-wrap
msgid "A folder picked with the Directory input can be a Yocto build directory, and BomLens recognizes it as one: it analyzes the image SBOM the build published under `tmp/deploy/images/<machine>/` instead of walking the build tree, which holds sysroots and native build tools that never ship in the image. The scan log names the folder and the document it read, the result page labels the scan a Yocto build directory, and the vulnerabilities carry the verdicts the build itself made — patched by a recipe, judged not applicable, or still open.\n"
msgstr "以「目錄」輸入欄挑選的資料夾若是 Yocto 建置目錄，BomLens 會把它辨識出來：此時不會走訪建置樹，而是分析建置發佈在 `tmp/deploy/images/<machine>/` 底下的映像檔 SBOM——建置樹裡放的是 sysroot 與原生建置工具，這些從來不會進到映像檔裡。掃描記錄會寫出它讀了哪個資料夾裡的哪份文件，結果頁面會把這次掃描標示為 Yocto 建置目錄，弱點也會帶著建置本身所做的判定——已由 recipe 修補、判定為不適用，或是仍然未處理。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/reference/ui.md:62
msgid ""
"The build gives the most when it was configured to emit an SBOM (`INHERIT += "
"\"create-spdx-3.0\"` and `INHERIT += \"vex\"` in `conf/local.conf`, on 5.0 "
"Scarthgap or later — 4.0 Kirkstone has no such class). SPDX 2.2 is read as "
"well, together with the `.spdx.tar.zst` beside it, though it carries no CVE "
"verdicts; a build with no SPDX at all is read from the manifests it wrote "
"anyway. Only a build directory with none of those stops the scan, rather "
"than falling back to a directory scan whose result would misrepresent the "
"image. The [supplier SBOM guide](../guides/supplier-sbom.md#yocto-images) "
"covers the behaviour and its limits; the CLI recognizes the same folder "
"through `--target`."
msgstr ""
"建置時若設定了產生 SBOM（在 `conf/local.conf` 加入 `INHERIT += \"create-"
"spdx-3.0\"` 與 `INHERIT += \"vex\"`，需要 5.0 Scarthgap 或更新的版本——4.0 "
"Kirkstone 沒有這個 class），能取得的資訊最完整。SPDX 2.2 也會連同旁邊的 "
"`.spdx.tar.zst` 一起讀取，只是不帶 CVE 判定；完全沒有 SPDX 的建置，則改讀它所"
"寫出的 manifest。只有三者皆無的建置目錄才會讓掃描停下來，而不是退回目錄掃描——"
"那樣的結果會與映像檔的實際內容不符。行為與限制請看[供應者 SBOM 指南](../"
"guides/supplier-sbom.md#yocto-images)；CLI 則透過 `--target` 辨識同一個資料"
"夾。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/reference/ui.md:63
#, no-wrap
msgid "Scan running"
msgstr "掃描進行中"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/reference/ui.md:66
msgid ""
"During a run the screen shows the pipeline stages — generate, normalize, "
"notices, security, report — advancing as the live log streams, so you can "
"see where the scan is and read any error (clone failure, no Docker socket, "
"an unsupported file) as it happens."
msgstr ""
"執行期間，畫面會顯示管線階段——產生 SBOM、正規化、授權聲明、安全、報告——隨著即"
"時記錄一段段推進，因此你能看到掃描進行到哪裡，也能在錯誤發生的當下就讀到它"
"（clone 失敗、沒有 Docker socket、不支援的檔案）。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/reference/ui.md:67
#, no-wrap
msgid "Result sections"
msgstr "結果區段 {#result-sections}"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/reference/ui.md:70
msgid ""
"When the scan finishes, the left rail fills with the sections for that scan."
msgstr "掃描結束後，左側側邊欄會填入該次掃描的各個區段。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/reference/ui.md:72
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Overview** opens by naming what was scanned — the folder path, the cloned URL, the container image reference, the uploaded file's name, or the AI model id — so a result read weeks later still says where its numbers came from. Then come the at-a-glance counts as cards that jump to each detail section, then what needs attention — known-malicious packages first, then a failed format conformance (for an analyzed supplier SBOM), critical or high vulnerabilities, and components flagged for license review. A malicious package leads because it is already running in the build and has to be removed, not scheduled for a patch. When the scan flags components past their upstream end-of-life, an \"End of life\" count tile joins the cards, with the ones that are also vulnerable shown in the risk colour (see [Component end-of-life](../concepts/reports-explained.md#component-end-of-life-eol)). A separate tile counts the components that have fallen behind their latest version (see [Version currency](../concepts/reports-explained.md#version-currency)). Below that, two risk axes sit side by side: the security severity distribution and the license classification. Click a band in either and you land in that section (Vulnerabilities or Licenses) with the filter already applied.\n"
msgstr "**總覽**一開頭就說明掃描了什麼——資料夾路徑、clone 來源的 URL、容器映像檔參照、上傳的檔案名稱，或 AI 模型 id——因此幾週後再回頭看這份結果，仍然知道這些數字是從哪裡來的。接著是一眼可見的統計數字，做成可跳到各詳細區段的卡片，然後才是需要注意的項目——已知的惡意套件排在最前，接著是格式符合性未通過（分析供應者 SBOM 時）、Critical（嚴重）或 High（高）等級的弱點，以及被標記為需要授權檢視的元件。惡意套件之所以排在最前面，是因為它已經在建置過程中執行，必須直接移除，而不是排進修補計畫。掃描若標記出上游已終止支援的元件，卡片區會多出一個「已終止支援」計數方塊，其中同時有弱點的元件會以風險色顯示（參考[元件已終止支援](../concepts/reports-explained.md#component-end-of-life-eol)）。另外還有一個方塊統計落後於最新版本的元件數（參考[版本新舊](../concepts/reports-explained.md#version-currency)）。再往下是並排的兩個風險軸：安全嚴重程度分布與授權分類。點選任一邊的其中一段，就會進到對應的區段（「弱點」或「授權條款」），而且篩選條件已經套用好。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/reference/ui.md:74
msgid ""
"If a scan finished with reduced analysis — for example cdxgen ran out of "
"Docker disk space and the SBOM fell back to direct dependencies only — a "
"banner here gives the reason and what to do. If a scan is still running, its "
"live log appears here on the Overview, not under every section."
msgstr ""
"掃描若是在分析縮減的情況下結束——例如 cdxgen 因 Docker 磁碟空間不足而未能執"
"行，SBOM 只好退回僅含直接相依項目——這裡會有橫幅說明原因與該怎麼做。掃描若還在"
"進行，即時記錄會顯示在「總覽」這裡，而不是每個區段底下都有一份。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/reference/ui.md:76
msgid ""
"![Overview — needs-attention, counts, severity and jump cards](../images/app-"
"results.png)"
msgstr ""
"![總覽——需要注意、統計數字、嚴重程度與跳轉卡片](../images/app-results.png)"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/reference/ui.md:78
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Components** lists everything detected, with search and filters (has vulnerabilities, direct only, needs review, end of life, outdated) and columns for Scope (direct vs transitive) and Risk (the worst vulnerability severity and count). A component the bundled OSV snapshot knows to be a malicious package carries a \"Malicious package\" badge, ahead of the others, with the advisory id and snapshot date in its tooltip. A component past its upstream end-of-life carries an \"End of life\" badge, with the EOL date where known. A component that is not on its latest version is marked as outdated; with deps.dev enrichment on (`STALENESS_ENRICH=true`) its detail shows how many releases it is behind and its last-release date (see [Version currency](../concepts/reports-explained.md#version-currency)). Large SBOMs render in pages. Click a row to expand its detail in place — the PURL, source/download location, copyright, licenses and any vulnerabilities. Where the detail reports vulnerabilities, it also links into the Vulnerabilities section filtered to that component, and a vulnerability's own detail links back to its package in Components, so an investigation moves between the two lists without retyping the name.\n"
msgstr "**元件**會列出所有偵測到的項目，附有搜尋與篩選（有弱點、僅直接相依、需人工檢視、已終止支援、非最新），以及「範圍」（直接或間接）與「風險」（最嚴重的弱點等級與數量）兩個欄位。內建的 OSV 快照認定為惡意套件的元件會帶上「惡意套件」標記，排在其他標記之前，公告識別碼與快照日期則放在它的提示 (tooltip) 裡。上游已終止支援的元件會帶上「已終止支援」標記，知道終止日期時也一併顯示。不是最新版本的元件會標示為「非最新」；開啟 deps.dev 補充資料 (`STALENESS_ENRICH=true`) 後，它的詳細資訊還會顯示落後幾個版本以及最後一次發行的日期（參考[版本新舊](../concepts/reports-explained.md#version-currency)）。大型 SBOM 會分頁顯示。點選資料列即可就地展開詳細資訊——PURL、來源／下載位置、著作權、授權條款，以及所有弱點。詳細資訊裡有弱點時，也會提供連結帶你到已篩選出該元件的「弱點」區段；弱點自己的詳細資訊則有連回「元件」中該套件的連結，因此追查時可以在兩份清單之間來回，不必重新輸入名稱。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/reference/ui.md:80
msgid ""
"![Components — Scope and Risk columns with filters](../images/web-ui-"
"components.png)"
msgstr "![元件——「範圍」與「風險」欄位及篩選](../images/web-ui-components.png)"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/reference/ui.md:82
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Vulnerabilities** sorts by severity then CVSS, with a CVSS column and the fixed version, and each row expands in place to show the CVSS vector, description and references. Click a band in the severity bar to filter to that severity, or search by CVE or package.\n"
msgstr "**弱點**先依嚴重程度、再依 CVSS 排序，並提供 CVSS 欄位與修正版本；每一列都能就地展開，顯示 CVSS 向量、說明與參考資料。點選嚴重程度長條中的一段即可篩選出該嚴重程度，也可以用 CVE 或套件名稱搜尋。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/reference/ui.md:84
msgid ""
"![Vulnerabilities — CVSS column and expandable rows](../images/web-ui-"
"vulns.png)"
msgstr "![弱點——CVSS 欄位與可展開的資料列](../images/web-ui-vulns.png)"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/reference/ui.md:86
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Dependencies** shows the relationships recorded in the SBOM as a graph or a tree. Direct dependencies are highlighted and packages with known vulnerabilities are marked with their severity. Switch to the tree to expand direct and transitive dependencies as a hierarchy.\n"
msgstr "**相依性**會把 SBOM 裡記錄的關聯以關係圖或樹狀呈現。直接相依會被強調，有已知弱點的套件則以其嚴重程度標示。切換到樹狀檢視，就能把直接相依與間接相依展開成階層。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/reference/ui.md:88
msgid ""
"![Dependencies — direct and vulnerable packages marked](../images/web-ui-"
"dependencies.png)"
msgstr ""
"![相依性——標示出直接相依與有弱點的套件](../images/web-ui-dependencies.png)"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/reference/ui.md:90
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Licenses** opens with a license classification axis that groups components by copyleft strength — network copyleft (AGPL), strong copyleft (GPL), weak copyleft (LGPL, MPL, EPL, …), permissive, review needed, and uncategorized. An unrecognised license is never assumed permissive; it falls to uncategorized so a person looks at it. Click a class to filter the rest of the section to it. Under the classification is the per-license distribution — how many components declare each license, busiest first, with the unlicensed bucket at the end. Picking a class narrows this list; clicking a license opens the Components table filtered to it, where it combines with the type, scope and risk filters. Below the distribution, when the scan declared an outbound license, come the dependencies whose terms clash with it — grouped worst first, each with the reasoning for its verdict. It is a documentation aid, not a legal determination. If no outbound license was declared the section says the check did not run and how to turn it on, rather than leaving an empty list to read as an all-clear. Then come the components whose terms need human review — AI behavioral-use (RAIL/Llama/Gemma) and non-commercial licenses.\n"
msgstr "**授權條款**一開頭是授權分類軸，依 Copyleft 強度把元件分組——網路型 Copyleft (AGPL)、強 Copyleft (GPL)、弱 Copyleft（LGPL、MPL、EPL…）、寬鬆式、需人工檢視與未分類。無法辨識的授權條款絕不會被當成寬鬆式，而是落到未分類，交由人來看。點選某個分類，區段的其餘部分就會篩選成該分類。分類之下是各授權條款的分布——每個授權條款有多少元件宣告，數量多的排在前面，沒有授權條款的那一組放在最後。選了分類會讓這份清單縮小；點選某個授權條款則會開啟已依它篩選的「元件」表格，在那裡還能與類型、範圍和風險篩選一起使用。分布下方，若這次掃描宣告了對外授權條款，會列出條款與它衝突的相依項目——最嚴重的排在前面，每一項都附上判定的理由。這是文件輔助資料，不是法律判定。若未宣告對外授權條款，區段會說明這項檢查沒有執行以及如何開啟，而不是留下一份空清單、讓人誤讀成沒有問題。再往下是條款需要人工檢視的元件——AI 行為限制（RAIL／Llama／Gemma）與非商業授權條款。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/reference/ui.md:92
msgid ""
"![Licenses — the classification axis and outbound-license conflicts](../"
"images/web-ui-licenses.png)"
msgstr ""
"![授權條款——授權分類軸與對外授權條款衝突](../images/web-ui-licenses.png)"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/reference/ui.md:94
#, no-wrap
msgid "**SBOM conformance** appears when you analyze an existing SBOM (the SBOM upload / ANALYZE mode), under Risk & compliance. An intro line says what the section measures: how well the SBOM meets the format and submission requirements — the regulatory crosswalk shown with it is for reference and makes no compliance determination. It shows the format verdict — pass or fail — and the base CycloneDX checks (timestamp, tools, top-level component, name and version coverage, PURL coverage, transitive dependencies), with the missing items listed for each failed check, plus a crosswalk roll-up of how the checks map to the regulatory baselines (EU CRA via BSI TR-03183-2, the US SBOM minimum elements of 2026). When the analyzed SBOM carries a machine-learning-model component, the G7 AI minimum-element checks (all advisory) appear here as a sub-block, grouped by the seven G7 clusters and tagged by data source — auto (read directly), inferred, declared, or review-needed when no automated source exists. The [AI model SBOM guide](../guides/ai-model.md#reading-the-conformance-report) explains the headline numbers and badges.\n"
msgstr "**SBOM 符合性**在你分析既有 SBOM（SBOM 上傳／ANALYZE 模式）時出現，歸在「合規」分組底下。區段開頭有一行說明它衡量的是什麼：這份 SBOM 符合格式與提交要求的程度——一併顯示的法規對照僅供參考，不構成合規判定。它會顯示格式判定——通過或未通過——以及基本的 CycloneDX 檢查（時間戳記、產生工具、最上層元件、名稱與版本涵蓋率、PURL 涵蓋率、間接相依性），每一項未通過的檢查都會列出缺漏的項目，另外還有一份法規對照彙總，說明這些檢查如何對應到法規基準（EU CRA 透過 BSI TR-03183-2、2026 年版的美國 SBOM 最低要素）。被分析的 SBOM 若帶有 machine-learning-model 元件，G7 AI 最低要素檢查（全部為建議性質）會以子區塊的形式出現在這裡，依 G7 的七個分組排列，並標示資料來源——自動（直接讀取）、推斷、已宣告，或在沒有自動化來源時標為需人工檢視。摘要數字與標記的含意由 [AI 模型 SBOM 指南](../guides/ai-model.md#reading-the-conformance-report)說明。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/reference/ui.md:96
msgid ""
"![Conformance — format verdict with the G7 advisory sub-block](../images/web-"
"ui-g7.png)"
msgstr "![符合性——格式判定與 G7 建議子區塊](../images/web-ui-g7.png)"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/reference/ui.md:98
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Artifacts** lists the generated files (SBOM, notice, risk report, security report, conformance) grouped by kind, downloadable per format or as a single ZIP.\n"
msgstr "**產出物**會把產生的檔案（SBOM、授權聲明、風險報告、安全報告、符合性報告）依種類分組列出，可依格式個別下載，也可以打包成單一 ZIP 下載。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/reference/ui.md:100
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Source tree** shows what the scan actually looked at, rather than only what it found. The tree on the left lists the files; picking one opens its text beside it. It appears for every scan that had files to read: a source scan, a directory or rootfs scan, a firmware image (after unpacking), a container image, and a build artifact that is an archive (jar, war, whl, zip, tar). A container image and an archive have no folder to walk, so BomLens unpacks a temporary copy, reads it, and deletes it before the scan ends. Symlinks are listed with the path they point at — in a container image nearly every command in `/bin` is a link into busybox, and leaving them out would show a tree in which those commands do not exist. When the scan ran with **License scan (ScanCode)** on, each file also carries the license detected in it.\n"
msgstr "**原始碼樹**顯示的是這次掃描實際看過哪些東西，而不只是它找到了什麼。左邊的樹列出檔案，挑一個就會在旁邊開啟它的內容。只要掃描有檔案可讀，這個區段就會出現：原始碼掃描、目錄或 rootfs 掃描、韌體映像檔（解開封裝之後）、容器映像檔，以及本身是壓縮檔的建置產出物（jar、war、whl、zip、tar）。容器映像檔與壓縮檔沒有可走訪的資料夾，因此 BomLens 會解開一份暫存副本、讀完它，然後在掃描結束前刪除。符號連結會連同它指向的路徑一起列出——在容器映像檔裡，`/bin` 底下幾乎每個指令都是指向 busybox 的連結，把它們排除掉，樹狀結構看起來就會像那些指令根本不存在。掃描若開啟了**逐檔授權條款掃描 (ScanCode)**，每個檔案還會帶上在其中偵測到的授權條款。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/reference/ui.md:102
msgid ""
"The captured text is bounded so a scan's output folder stays a reasonable "
"size: text files only, up to 256 KB each and 8 MB in total, and licence "
"texts and package manifests are taken first so the evidence behind a finding "
"is the part that survives a tight budget. A file with no text on screen says "
"why — it is binary, or the capture reached its limit — and the line above "
"the tree reports how many files were captured and how many were left out. "
"Nothing is silently dropped."
msgstr ""
"擷取的內容設有上限，好讓掃描的輸出資料夾維持合理大小：只收文字檔，每個檔案最"
"多 256 KB、全部合計 8 MB，並且優先擷取授權條款文字與套件 manifest，讓額度緊縮"
"時留下來的正是判斷結果背後的佐證。畫面上沒有內容的檔案會說明原因——它是二進位"
"檔，或是擷取已達上限——而樹上方那一行會寫出擷取了幾個檔案、又略過了幾個。沒有"
"任何檔案是被無聲丟掉的。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/reference/ui.md:104
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Submitted SBOM** appears when the scan read an SBOM someone else produced (SBOM upload / ANALYZE). Every other screen describes the CycloneDX document BomLens converted that input into, so this one describes the input itself: the format and spec version it was written in, its document name and identifier, when it was created, the tool that produced it, and the supplier or authors it names. Fields the supplier did not fill in are left out rather than shown blank — on a compliance screen a confident-looking wrong value costs more than a missing one. The entries themselves are not repeated here; the section links to Components, which lists them with sorting, filters and risk.\n"
msgstr "**提交的 SBOM**在掃描讀取的是他人產生的 SBOM 時出現（SBOM 上傳／ANALYZE）。其他每個畫面描述的都是 BomLens 把該輸入轉換成的 CycloneDX 文件，因此這個區段描述的是輸入文件本身：它以什麼格式與規格版本撰寫、文件名稱與識別碼、建立時間、產生它的工具，以及它所記載的供應者或作者。供應者沒有填寫的欄位會直接省略，而不是留白顯示——在合規畫面上，一個看起來很篤定的錯誤值，代價比缺漏更大。項目本身不會在這裡重複；區段會連到「元件」，那裡列出它們並附有排序、篩選與風險資訊。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/reference/ui.md:106
msgid ""
"![Artifacts — files grouped by kind, with the SPDX export button on the SBOM "
"card](../images/web-ui-artifacts.png)"
msgstr ""
"![產出物——依種類分組的檔案，SBOM 卡片上有 SPDX 匯出按鈕](../images/web-ui-"
"artifacts.png)"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/reference/ui.md:108
msgid ""
"The SBOM card in that section carries an **Export as SPDX 2.3** button. It "
"converts the finished CycloneDX BOM into `{Project}_{Version}_bom.spdx.json` "
"and starts the download at once, without rescanning. The converted file then "
"joins the card as an ordinary download chip and is included in the ZIP, and "
"the button is no longer offered for a scan that already has an SPDX file. "
"CycloneDX stays the primary format, and CycloneDX-only data "
"(vulnerabilities, `bomlens:*` properties) is not carried over. Signing is "
"available only in the CLI (`--spdx --sign`), so a file exported here is "
"unsigned like every other artifact the UI produces."
msgstr ""
"該區段的 SBOM 卡片上有一個**匯出為 SPDX 2.3**按鈕。它會把完成的 CycloneDX "
"BOM 轉換成 `{Project}_{Version}_bom.spdx.json` 並立刻開始下載，不需要重新掃"
"描。轉換後的檔案會以一般的下載項目加入卡片，也會納入 ZIP；已經有 SPDX 檔案的"
"掃描則不再提供這個按鈕。CycloneDX 仍然是主要格式，只存在於 CycloneDX 的資料"
"（弱點、`bomlens:*` 屬性）不會一併帶過去。簽章只有 CLI 支援 (`--spdx --"
"sign`)，因此這裡匯出的檔案和介面產生的其他產出物一樣都沒有簽章。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/reference/ui.md:110
msgid ""
"Conversion needs syft. The scanner image ships it, so the usual deployment "
"converts on the spot. Where it is missing, such as the desktop app's base UI "
"image, BomLens runs the scanner image as a separate container to do the "
"conversion, which downloads that image once on first use. Where neither is "
"possible, the button is not shown."
msgstr ""
"轉換需要 syft。掃描器映像檔內含 syft，因此一般的部署方式會就地完成轉換。syft "
"不存在時——例如桌面版應用程式的基礎 UI 映像檔——BomLens 會另外啟動掃描器映像檔"
"的容器來做轉換，首次使用時會下載該映像檔一次。兩者都做不到時，按鈕就不會顯"
"示。"

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/reference/ui.md:111
#, no-wrap
msgid "AI surfaces"
msgstr "AI 專屬區段"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/reference/ui.md:114
msgid ""
"For an AI/ML SBOM (a CycloneDX SBOM with a machine-learning-model "
"component), the rail adds:"
msgstr ""
"若是 AI/ML SBOM（帶有 machine-learning-model 元件的 CycloneDX SBOM），側邊欄"
"會多出："

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/reference/ui.md:116
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Models & datasets** — each model card's identifier, architecture, task, license, supplier and integrity, a four-axis disclosure panel (weights / architecture / training data / training process, as documented in the BOM), and the datasets the model references. When the SBOM carries a model risk assessment, the card opens with the overall grade badge (ok / conditional / caution / review), the per-axis verdicts (license, file security, datasets — an unevaluated axis shows a dash), the reasons behind the grade, the quoted custom-license wording and lineage warning when present, and the usage scenario the verdict was judged for; each dataset row carries its own grade badge. The section ends with the reminder that the assessment is guidance, not legal advice. For AI model scans, the New scan form adds a usage-context selector (internal / product / redistribute / outputs-only) that tailors this assessment.\n"
msgstr "**模型與資料集**——每張模型卡的識別碼、架構、任務、授權條款、供應者與完整性，一個四軸揭露面板（權重／架構／訓練資料／訓練過程，依 BOM 中記載的程度），以及該模型引用的資料集。SBOM 若帶有模型風險評估，卡片一開頭會顯示整體等級標記（未發現限制訊號／有條件使用／注意／需人工檢視）、各軸判定（授權條款、檔案安全、資料集——未評估的軸會顯示破折號）、等級背後的原因、自訂授權條款摘錄與上游承襲警告（有的話），以及判定所依據的用途；資料集的每一列也各有自己的等級標記。區段最後會提醒：這項評估僅供參考，並非法律意見。AI 模型掃描時，「新增掃描」表單會多出一個使用情境選擇器（內部檢視與研究／產品整合／微調並再散布／僅使用輸出），用來調整這項評估。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/reference/ui.md:120
msgid ""
"The G7 AI minimum-element checks appear inside the **SBOM conformance** "
"section above — they are added only when the SBOM has a model component."
msgstr ""
"G7 AI 最低要素檢查出現在上面的**SBOM 符合性**區段裡——只有 SBOM 含有模型元件時"
"才會加上。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/reference/ui.md:122
msgid ""
"That section also shows an AI compliance profile card: a one-glance rollup "
"of the G7 result, the number of license-flagged components, and regulatory "
"framework coverage (EU AI Act, Korea AI Basic Act). It is advisory, not a "
"certification, and the same data is written to the `_ai-profile` files (see "
"[Artifacts](artifacts.md))."
msgstr ""
"該區段還會顯示一張 AI 合規概況卡片：把 G7 結果、被標記需檢視授權的元件數，以"
"及法規框架涵蓋範圍（EU AI Act、韓國 AI 基本法）彙整成一覽摘要。它僅供參考，不"
"是認證，同一份資料也會寫入 `_ai-profile` 檔案（參考[產出物](artifacts.md)）。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/reference/ui.md:123
#, no-wrap
msgid "Scan management"
msgstr "掃描管理"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/reference/ui.md:126
msgid ""
"The home screen — opened from the rail's Scan management link, the logo, or "
"the top bar's Scan management (clock) menu — lists every past scan saved on "
"this machine. Each scan's `{Project}_{Version}/` subfolder under the output "
"base is one entry. A search box and scan-type filter chips (only the types "
"that exist — Source, Container, RootFS, Firmware, AI model, SBOM) narrow the "
"list. The type comes from what the scan was pointed at and, where that "
"leaves it open, from the root component the SBOM declares — an analyzed "
"supplier document reads as SBOM rather than as the Source its root usually "
"claims to be. Three summary cards show the total scans, how many are at risk "
"(click that card to filter to them), and the project count. The table sorts "
"by scan, generated time, components or top severity. Click a row to re-open "
"its results, or delete one to remove its subfolder — a prompt confirms "
"first, because the files are removed from disk and nothing is kept to "
"restore. This is local files only — no account, no database."
msgstr ""
"首頁畫面可以從側邊欄的「掃描管理」連結、標誌，或頂端列的掃描管理（時鐘）選單"
"開啟，它會列出這台機器上儲存的所有過去掃描。輸出基準目錄底下每個掃描的 "
"`{Project}_{Version}/` 子資料夾就是一筆項目。搜尋框與掃描類型篩選標籤（只列出"
"實際存在的類型——原始碼、容器、RootFS、韌體、AI 模型、SBOM）可以縮小清單。類型"
"取自這次掃描指向的對象；若這樣還無法確定，才看 SBOM 宣告的根元件——分析供應者"
"文件時會判讀為 SBOM，而不是它的根元件通常自稱的「原始碼」。三張摘要卡片顯示掃"
"描總數、其中有幾筆有風險（點這張卡片就會篩選出它們），以及專案數。表格可依掃"
"描、產生時間、元件或最高嚴重程度排序。點選資料列可重新開啟該筆結果，刪除則會"
"移除它的子資料夾——刪除前會先跳出確認，因為檔案會從磁碟移除，而且沒有留下任何"
"可還原的副本。這裡只用本機檔案——沒有帳號，也沒有資料庫。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/reference/ui.md:127
#, no-wrap
msgid "Notes"
msgstr "補充說明"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/reference/ui.md:133
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"> The firmware upload tile appears automatically whenever the Docker engine is running. See the\n"
"> [firmware guide](../guides/firmware.md) for how it works and how to point it at a different image tag.\n"
">\n"
"> **Note:** the UI's source scan (current folder / ZIP / GitHub) analyzes the directory with syft inside the container. Components are captured only when there is a lock file (`package-lock.json`, `go.sum`, and so on) or installed dependencies. If you only have a manifest and need deeper resolution, use the CLI source mode (cdxgen).\n"
msgstr ""
"> 只要 Docker 引擎正在執行，韌體上傳方塊就會自動出現。運作方式以及如何改指向其他映像檔標籤，\n"
"> 請看[韌體指南](../guides/firmware.md)。\n"
">\n"
"> **注意：**介面的原始碼掃描（目前資料夾／ZIP／GitHub）是在容器內以 syft 分析目錄。只有存在鎖定檔（`package-lock.json`、`go.sum` 等）或已安裝的相依項目時，才會擷取到元件。如果你只有資訊清單 (manifest) 而需要更深入的解析，請改用 CLI 的原始碼模式 (cdxgen)。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/reference/ui.md:135
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Changing the port / on a conflict:** if the default port (8080) is taken by another service, specify a different port:\n"
msgstr "**變更連接埠／發生衝突時：**預設連接埠 (8080) 已被其他服務占用時，請指定不同的連接埠：\n"

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/reference/ui.md:135
#, no-wrap
msgid "UI_PORT=9090 ./scripts/scan-sbom.sh --ui      # http://localhost:9090\n"
msgstr "UI_PORT=9090 ./scripts/scan-sbom.sh --ui      # http://localhost:9090\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/reference/ui.md:140
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Reaching the UI from another machine:** the UI is published to the loopback interface, so it answers only on the machine that started it. It runs scans through the engine socket, which is why it is not offered to the network by default. If you do need it elsewhere, set the bind address and put an authenticating proxy in front of it:\n"
msgstr "**從其他機器連上介面：**介面只發佈在 loopback 介面上，因此只在啟動它的那台機器上回應。它是透過引擎 socket 執行掃描，這也是預設不對外開放到網路的原因。如果確實需要在別處使用，請設定綁定位址，並在它前面架一層會做身分驗證的代理伺服器：\n"

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/reference/ui.md:140
#, no-wrap
msgid "UI_BIND_ADDRESS=0.0.0.0 ./scripts/scan-sbom.sh --ui\n"
msgstr "UI_BIND_ADDRESS=0.0.0.0 ./scripts/scan-sbom.sh --ui\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/reference/ui.md:144
#, no-wrap
msgid "> **Note:** even though the UI is easy, a Docker engine must be installed and running (free: WSL2 + docker-ce, or Rancher Desktop). The launcher detects a missing or stopped Docker and shows the install link.\n"
msgstr "> **注意：**介面雖然簡單，仍然必須先安裝並啟動 Docker 引擎（免費方案：WSL2 + docker-ce，或 Rancher Desktop）。啟動程式會偵測到 Docker 未安裝或未執行，並顯示安裝連結。\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#: docs/start/first-scan.md:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install BomLens and generate your first SBOM. The fastest path needs no command line — download the desktop app and double-click; or use the web UI or the CLI to produce a CycloneDX SBOM, an open-source notice, and a security report."
msgstr "安裝 BomLens 並產生第一份 SBOM。最快的路徑不需要指令列——下載桌面版應用程式雙擊即可；也可以用網頁介面或 CLI 產生 CycloneDX SBOM、開放原始碼授權聲明與安全報告。"

#. type: Title #
#: docs/start/first-scan.md:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Getting started"
msgstr "快速開始"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/start/first-scan.md:8
msgid ""
"From install to your first [SBOM](../concepts/what-is-sbom.md), step by "
"step. The fastest path needs no command line — download the app and double-"
"click."
msgstr ""
"從安裝到第一份 [SBOM](../concepts/what-is-sbom.md)，一步一步帶你完成。最快的"
"路徑不需要指令列——下載應用程式並雙擊即可。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/start/first-scan.md:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "> Just want an SBOM or a notice quickly, no commands? Start with the [no-CLI quick start](../start/no-cli.md).\n"
msgstr "> 只想快速產生 SBOM 或授權聲明、不想碰指令？請從[免指令列快速開始](../start/no-cli.md)看起。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/start/first-scan.md:12
msgid ""
"BomLens runs on a Docker engine, but the desktop app and web UI set it up "
"and pull the image for you. You only manage Docker yourself for the CLI — "
"see [Requirements](#requirements) below if you still need to install one."
msgstr ""
"BomLens 在 Docker 引擎上執行，但桌面版應用程式與網頁介面會替你完成設定並下載"
"映像檔。只有使用 CLI 時才需要自己管理 Docker——如果還沒有安裝引擎，請看下方的"
"[系統需求](#系統需求)。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/start/first-scan.md:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Start without the command line (recommended)"
msgstr "不用指令列開始（建議）"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/start/first-scan.md:16
msgid ""
"Download [BomLens for Windows (.exe)](https://github.com/sktelecom/bomlens/"
"releases/latest/download/BomLens-Setup.exe) and double-click it; the UI "
"opens with no console window. On first run it checks Docker, pulls the "
"scanner image (about 250 MB), and opens http://localhost:8080. The app is "
"unsigned for now, so if Windows SmartScreen warns, click **More info**, then "
"**Run anyway**. A click-by-click walkthrough is in the [no-CLI quick start]"
"(../start/no-cli.md)."
msgstr ""
"下載 [BomLens Windows 版 (.exe)](https://github.com/sktelecom/bomlens/"
"releases/latest/download/BomLens-Setup.exe)後雙擊執行，介面會直接開啟，不會出"
"現主控台視窗。首次執行時會檢查 Docker、下載掃描器映像檔（約 250 MB），然後開"
"啟 http://localhost:8080。目前這個應用程式尚未簽章，因此若 Windows "
"SmartScreen 出現警告，請點選 **更多資訊**，再點 **仍要執行**。逐步點選的操作"
"說明在[免指令列快速開始](../start/no-cli.md)。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/start/first-scan.md:18
msgid ""
"![BomLens desktop app — the startup screen shows Docker checks, image "
"download progress, and container startup](../images/desktop-startup-en.png)"
msgstr ""
"![BomLens 桌面版應用程式——啟動畫面顯示 Docker 檢查、映像檔下載進度與容器啟動"
"狀況](../images/desktop-startup-en.png)"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/start/first-scan.md:20
msgid ""
"Prefer scripts over an installer? The `sbom-ui.bat` alternative is covered "
"step by step in [Path B of the no-CLI quick start](../start/no-cli.md#path-"
"b--zip-and-double-click-batch-file-alternative)."
msgstr ""
"比起安裝程式更想用指令碼？`sbom-ui.bat` 這個替代做法，在[免指令列快速開始的方"
"法 B](../start/no-cli.md#path-b--zip-and-double-click-batch-file-alternative)"
"有逐步說明。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/start/first-scan.md:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Web UI"
msgstr "網頁介面"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/start/first-scan.md:24
msgid ""
"No commands beyond launching it: run in the browser, scan, and download "
"results."
msgstr "除了啟動之外幾乎不需要指令：在瀏覽器裡執行、掃描，然後下載結果。"

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/start/first-scan.md:25
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"git clone https://github.com/sktelecom/bomlens.git && cd bomlens\n"
"./scripts/scan-sbom.sh --ui     # opens http://localhost:8080; results save under the current folder\n"
"#   Windows: double-click scripts\\sbom-ui.bat\n"
msgstr ""
"git clone https://github.com/sktelecom/bomlens.git && cd bomlens\n"
"./scripts/scan-sbom.sh --ui     # opens http://localhost:8080; results save under the current folder\n"
"#   Windows: double-click scripts\\sbom-ui.bat\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/start/first-scan.md:32
msgid ""
"The folder you run from is the output base — each scan saves to a `{Project}"
"_{Version}/` subfolder under it (details in [Where outputs go](../reference/"
"cli.md#where-outputs-go)). If the port is taken, prefix `UI_PORT=9090`. To "
"scan the current folder as the source, run from that project folder; for a "
"GitHub URL, ZIP, SBOM, firmware, or Docker image you supply the input in the "
"UI, so any folder works."
msgstr ""
"你執行指令的資料夾就是輸出基準——每次掃描都會存到它底下的 `{Project}"
"_{Version}/` 子資料夾（細節見[產出物存放位置](../reference/cli.md#where-"
"outputs-go)）。如果連接埠已被占用，請在前面加上 `UI_PORT=9090`。要把目前資料"
"夾當作原始碼來掃描，就在那個專案資料夾裡執行；GitHub URL、ZIP、SBOM、韌體或 "
"Docker 映像檔則是在介面中提供輸入，所以在任何資料夾執行都可以。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/start/first-scan.md:34
msgid ""
"![BomLens web UI — name a project, pick a scan target, and choose what to "
"generate](../images/web-ui-en.png)"
msgstr ""
"![BomLens 網頁介面——填寫專案名稱、選擇掃描目標，並勾選要產生的項目](../"
"images/web-ui-en.png)"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: docs/start/first-scan.md:39
msgid "Enter a project name and version."
msgstr "輸入專案名稱與版本。"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: docs/start/first-scan.md:39
msgid ""
"Pick a scan target: current folder, GitHub URL, ZIP upload, SBOM upload, "
"firmware upload, or Docker image."
msgstr ""
"選擇掃描目標：目前資料夾、GitHub URL、ZIP 上傳、SBOM 上傳、韌體上傳或 Docker "
"映像檔。"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: docs/start/first-scan.md:39
msgid "Click Run scan — logs stream live."
msgstr "點選「執行掃描」——執行記錄會即時顯示。"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#: docs/start/first-scan.md:39
msgid ""
"View or download the SBOM, the notice, the risk report, and the security "
"report."
msgstr "檢視或下載 SBOM、授權聲明、風險報告與安全報告。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/start/first-scan.md:41
msgid ""
"Screen layout and per-target details are in the [web UI reference](../"
"reference/ui.md)."
msgstr "畫面配置與各掃描目標的細節，見[網頁介面參考](../reference/ui.md)。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/start/first-scan.md:42
#, no-wrap
msgid "Your first SBOM (CLI)"
msgstr "你的第一份 SBOM (CLI)"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/start/first-scan.md:45
msgid ""
"Advanced — for automation and CI. Run from the cloned repo. The command "
"below scans the bundled Node.js example; point `--target` at your own "
"folder, or drop `--target` to scan the current directory instead."
msgstr ""
"進階用法——適合自動化與 CI。請在 clone 下來的儲存庫裡執行。下面的指令會掃描隨"
"附的 Node.js 範例；把 `--target` 指向你自己的資料夾，或是拿掉 `--target` 改為"
"掃描目前的目錄。"

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/start/first-scan.md:47
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# All deliverables for the bundled example project\n"
"./scripts/scan-sbom.sh --project \"MyApp\" --version \"1.0.0\" --target examples/nodejs --all --generate-only\n"
msgstr ""
"# All deliverables for the bundled example project\n"
"./scripts/scan-sbom.sh --project \"MyApp\" --version \"1.0.0\" --target examples/nodejs --all --generate-only\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/start/first-scan.md:53
msgid ""
"This produces a CycloneDX SBOM, an open-source notice, a security report, "
"and a risk report named `MyApp_1.0.0_…`, all in a `MyApp_1.0.0/` subfolder "
"of the current directory."
msgstr ""
"這會產生 CycloneDX SBOM、開放原始碼授權聲明、安全報告與風險報告，檔名皆為 "
"`MyApp_1.0.0_…`，全部放在目前目錄底下的 `MyApp_1.0.0/` 子資料夾裡。"

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/start/first-scan.md:54
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# From a GitHub URL, without cloning first\n"
"./scripts/scan-sbom.sh --project \"MyApp\" --version \"1.0.0\" --git \"https://github.com/org/repo\" --all --generate-only\n"
msgstr ""
"# From a GitHub URL, without cloning first\n"
"./scripts/scan-sbom.sh --project \"MyApp\" --version \"1.0.0\" --git \"https://github.com/org/repo\" --all --generate-only\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/start/first-scan.md:60
msgid ""
"Other inputs — a ZIP source (`--target app.zip`), an existing SBOM (`--"
"analyze sbom.json`), firmware (`--target dev.bin --firmware`), a Docker "
"image (`--target nginx:latest`) — are in the [input-scenarios guide](../"
"guides/by-input.md)."
msgstr ""
"其他輸入形式——ZIP 原始碼 (`--target app.zip`)、既有的 SBOM (`--analyze "
"sbom.json`)、韌體 (`--target dev.bin --firmware`)、Docker 映像檔 (`--"
"target nginx:latest`)——都整理在[依輸入類型的指南](../guides/by-input.md)。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/start/first-scan.md:62
#, no-wrap
msgid "> `--generate-only` saves the outputs locally without uploading (the vulnerability scan still runs). `--all` produces the notice, the SBOM, and the risk report in one run. The full options are in the [CLI reference](../reference/cli.md#options-reference); to upload the result to TRUSCA or a Dependency-Track server, use `--trusca <project_id>` (or `UPLOAD_TARGET`) — the steps are in the [upload guide](../guides/upload.md).\n"
msgstr "> `--generate-only` 只把產出物存在本機、不上傳（弱點掃描照樣會執行）。`--all` 會一次產生授權聲明、SBOM 與風險報告。完整的選項見 [CLI 參考](../reference/cli.md#options-reference)；要把結果上傳到 TRUSCA 或 Dependency-Track 伺服器，請使用 `--trusca <project_id>`（或 `UPLOAD_TARGET`）——步驟見[上傳指南](../guides/upload.md)。\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/start/first-scan.md:63
#, no-wrap
msgid "Understanding the results"
msgstr "認識結果檔案"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/start/first-scan.md:66
msgid ""
"Each scan lands in a `{Project}_{Version}/` subfolder, and the files inside "
"are named `{Project}_{Version}_…`, for example `MyApp_1.0.0/"
"MyApp_1.0.0_bom.json`:"
msgstr ""
"每次掃描都會落在一個 `{Project}_{Version}/` 子資料夾裡，裡面的檔案則以 "
"`{Project}_{Version}_…` 命名，例如 `MyApp_1.0.0/MyApp_1.0.0_bom.json`："

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/start/first-scan.md:73
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| File | What it is |\n"
"|------|------------|\n"
"| `{Project}_{Version}_bom.json` | the SBOM (CycloneDX 1.6) |\n"
"| `{Project}_{Version}_NOTICE.{txt,html}` | open-source notice (고지문) grouped by license |\n"
"| `{Project}_{Version}_security.{json,md,html}` | Trivy vulnerability report |\n"
"| `{Project}_{Version}_risk-report.{md,html}` | open-source risk report (licenses + vulnerabilities), generated by default |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 檔案 | 內容 |\n"
"|------|------------|\n"
"| `{Project}_{Version}_bom.json` | SBOM (CycloneDX 1.6) |\n"
"| `{Project}_{Version}_NOTICE.{txt,html}` | 依授權條款分組的開放原始碼授權聲明 |\n"
"| `{Project}_{Version}_security.{json,md,html}` | Trivy 弱點報告 |\n"
"| `{Project}_{Version}_risk-report.{md,html}` | 開放原始碼風險報告（授權條款 + 弱點），預設會產生 |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/start/first-scan.md:75
msgid "The SBOM is [CycloneDX 1.6](https://cyclonedx.org/) JSON:"
msgstr "SBOM 是 [CycloneDX 1.6](https://cyclonedx.org/) 格式的 JSON："

#. type: Fenced code block (json)
#: docs/start/first-scan.md:76
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"bomFormat\": \"CycloneDX\",\n"
"  \"specVersion\": \"1.6\",\n"
"  \"version\": 1,\n"
"  \"metadata\": {\n"
"    \"timestamp\": \"2026-01-15T10:30:00Z\",\n"
"    \"component\": {\n"
"      \"type\": \"application\",\n"
"      \"name\": \"MyApp\",\n"
"      \"version\": \"1.0.0\"\n"
"    }\n"
"  },\n"
"  \"components\": [\n"
"    {\n"
"      \"type\": \"library\",\n"
"      \"name\": \"express\",\n"
"      \"version\": \"4.18.2\",\n"
"      \"purl\": \"pkg:npm/express@4.18.2\",\n"
"      \"licenses\": [\n"
"        { \"license\": { \"id\": \"MIT\" } }\n"
"      ]\n"
"    }\n"
"  ]\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"{\n"
"  \"bomFormat\": \"CycloneDX\",\n"
"  \"specVersion\": \"1.6\",\n"
"  \"version\": 1,\n"
"  \"metadata\": {\n"
"    \"timestamp\": \"2026-01-15T10:30:00Z\",\n"
"    \"component\": {\n"
"      \"type\": \"application\",\n"
"      \"name\": \"MyApp\",\n"
"      \"version\": \"1.0.0\"\n"
"    }\n"
"  },\n"
"  \"components\": [\n"
"    {\n"
"      \"type\": \"library\",\n"
"      \"name\": \"express\",\n"
"      \"version\": \"4.18.2\",\n"
"      \"purl\": \"pkg:npm/express@4.18.2\",\n"
"      \"licenses\": [\n"
"        { \"license\": { \"id\": \"MIT\" } }\n"
"      ]\n"
"    }\n"
"  ]\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/start/first-scan.md:103
#, no-wrap
msgid "Key fields"
msgstr "主要欄位"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/start/first-scan.md:111
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Field | Meaning |\n"
"|-------|---------|\n"
"| `metadata.component` | the scanned project (name, version) |\n"
"| `components` | the open-source components found |\n"
"| `components[].purl` | Package URL — the unique package identifier |\n"
"| `components[].licenses` | license info (SPDX ID) |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 欄位 | 說明 |\n"
"|-------|---------|\n"
"| `metadata.component` | 被掃描的專案（名稱、版本） |\n"
"| `components` | 找到的開放原始碼元件 |\n"
"| `components[].purl` | Package URL——套件的唯一識別碼 |\n"
"| `components[].licenses` | 授權條款資訊 (SPDX ID) |\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/start/first-scan.md:112
#, no-wrap
msgid "Quick checks on the SBOM"
msgstr "快速檢查 SBOM 的內容"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/start/first-scan.md:115
msgid ""
"The examples below use `jq`. On WSL2 (Ubuntu) install it with `sudo apt-get "
"install jq`, on Windows Git Bash with `winget install jqlang.jq`. If "
"installing it is a hassle, the web UI overview shows the component count and "
"licenses directly:"
msgstr ""
"下面的範例使用 `jq`。在 WSL2 (Ubuntu) 上用 `sudo apt-get install jq` 安裝，"
"Windows Git Bash 則用 `winget install jqlang.jq`。覺得安裝麻煩的話，網頁介面"
"的「摘要」會直接顯示元件數量與授權條款："

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/start/first-scan.md:117
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Component count\n"
"jq '.components | length' MyApp_1.0.0/MyApp_1.0.0_bom.json\n"
"\n"
"# Unique licenses\n"
"jq '[.components[].licenses[]?.license.id] | unique' MyApp_1.0.0/MyApp_1.0.0_bom.json\n"
msgstr ""
"# Component count\n"
"jq '.components | length' MyApp_1.0.0/MyApp_1.0.0_bom.json\n"
"\n"
"# Unique licenses\n"
"jq '[.components[].licenses[]?.license.id] | unique' MyApp_1.0.0/MyApp_1.0.0_bom.json\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/start/first-scan.md:125
#, no-wrap
msgid "Requirements"
msgstr "系統需求"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/start/first-scan.md:128
msgid "BomLens needs only a Docker *engine* — not a specific product."
msgstr "BomLens 只需要一個 Docker *引擎*——不綁定特定產品。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/start/first-scan.md:135
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Item | Minimum |\n"
"|------|---------|\n"
"| Docker | 20.10+ |\n"
"| Disk | 4 GB+ (for the Docker image) |\n"
"| OS | Linux, macOS, Windows |\n"
"| Arch | AMD64, ARM64 |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 項目 | 最低要求 |\n"
"|------|---------|\n"
"| Docker | 20.10+ |\n"
"| 磁碟空間 | 4 GB+（供 Docker 映像檔使用） |\n"
"| 作業系統 | Linux、macOS、Windows |\n"
"| 架構 | AMD64、ARM64 |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/start/first-scan.md:137
msgid ""
"If you already run a Docker engine (Docker Desktop, Rancher Desktop, docker-"
"ce in WSL2, anything), just confirm it works:"
msgstr ""
"如果你已經在跑 Docker 引擎（Docker Desktop、Rancher Desktop、WSL2 裡的 "
"docker-ce，任何一種都行），只要確認它能正常運作："

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/start/first-scan.md:138
#, no-wrap
msgid "docker run --rm hello-world\n"
msgstr "docker run --rm hello-world\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/start/first-scan.md:142
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installing Docker on Windows for the first time"
msgstr "在 Windows 上第一次安裝 Docker"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/start/first-scan.md:145
msgid ""
"Docker Desktop is simplest, but it needs a paid license above a certain "
"organization size. Free options:"
msgstr ""
"Docker Desktop 最簡單，但組織規模超過一定門檻就需要付費授權。免費的選擇："

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/start/first-scan.md:151
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Option | Notes |\n"
"|--------|-------|\n"
"| **WSL2 + docker-ce** (free) | Install docker-ce inside WSL2 Ubuntu and run `scan-sbom.sh` there. No `.bat`, no Windows named pipe, no path-conversion issues. |\n"
"| **Rancher Desktop** (free, GUI) | A drop-in GUI replacement for Docker Desktop with a `docker` CLI. Works with the `.bat` double-click and desktop-app flows. |\n"
"| Docker Desktop | Easiest, but check licensing for organizational use. |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 選項 | 說明 |\n"
"|--------|-------|\n"
"| **WSL2 + docker-ce**（免費） | 在 WSL2 的 Ubuntu 裡安裝 docker-ce，並在裡面執行 `scan-sbom.sh`。不需要 `.bat`、不需要 Windows 具名管道，也沒有路徑轉換的問題。 |\n"
"| **Rancher Desktop**（免費，GUI） | 可直接取代 Docker Desktop 的圖形介面，附帶 `docker` CLI。雙擊 `.bat` 與桌面版應用程式的流程都能照用。 |\n"
"| Docker Desktop | 最容易，但組織內使用時要確認授權條款。 |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/start/first-scan.md:153
msgid "WSL2 + docker-ce, the short version (admin PowerShell):"
msgstr "WSL2 + docker-ce 的精簡版做法（以管理員身分開啟 PowerShell）："

#. type: Fenced code block (powershell)
#: docs/start/first-scan.md:154
#, no-wrap
msgid "wsl --install -d Ubuntu          # reboot, then finish Ubuntu setup\n"
msgstr "wsl --install -d Ubuntu          # reboot, then finish Ubuntu setup\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/start/first-scan.md:159
msgid "Then inside WSL (Ubuntu):"
msgstr "接著在 WSL (Ubuntu) 裡執行："

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/start/first-scan.md:160
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"sudo apt-get update && curl -fsSL https://get.docker.com | sudo sh\n"
"sudo usermod -aG docker \"$USER\"  # log out and back in to apply\n"
"docker pull ghcr.io/sktelecom/bomlens:latest\n"
msgstr ""
"sudo apt-get update && curl -fsSL https://get.docker.com | sudo sh\n"
"sudo usermod -aG docker \"$USER\"  # log out and back in to apply\n"
"docker pull ghcr.io/sktelecom/bomlens:latest\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/start/first-scan.md:167
msgid ""
"Clone the repo inside WSL and run `./scripts/scan-sbom.sh ...` as above. For "
"the CLI on Windows without WSL2, install [Git for Windows](https://git-"
"scm.com/download/win) (Git Bash) and use `scripts\\scan-sbom.bat`."
msgstr ""
"之後在 WSL 裡 clone 儲存庫，照上面的方式執行 `./scripts/scan-sbom.sh ...`。若"
"不使用 WSL2 而要在 Windows 上用 CLI，請安裝 [Git for Windows](https://git-"
"scm.com/download/win)(Git Bash)，並改用 `scripts\\scan-sbom.bat`。"

