"| 參與貢獻 | [貢獻指南](https://github.com/sktelecom/bomlens/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md) |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/start/first-scan.md:181
#, no-wrap
msgid "> **Related**: [CLI reference](../reference/cli.md) | [Input scenarios](../guides/by-input.md)\n"
msgstr "> **相關文件**：[CLI 參考](../reference/cli.md) | [依輸入類型](../guides/by-input.md)\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#: docs/start/no-cli.md:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "The shortest no-command-line path to turn source code into an open-source notice, all in the browser."
msgstr "不必用指令列，把原始碼變成開放原始碼授權聲明的最短路徑——全部在瀏覽器裡完成。"

#. type: Title #
#: docs/start/no-cli.md:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "No-CLI quick start (no command line)"
msgstr "免指令列快速開始（不需要 CLI）"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/start/no-cli.md:8
msgid ""
"You do not need to have ever typed a command. This page covers the shortest "
"path for an open-source license manager to turn source code received from a "
"dev team into an open-source notice. It is all clicks in a browser."
msgstr ""
"你不需要有打過任何指令的經驗。這一頁只講一件事：開放原始碼授權條款負責人拿到"
"開發團隊給的原始碼後，要做出開放原始碼授權聲明的最短路徑。全程都在瀏覽器裡點"
"選完成。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/start/no-cli.md:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "What is an open-source notice"
msgstr "什麼是開放原始碼授權聲明"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/start/no-cli.md:12
msgid ""
"A document that lists the open-source components in a product and their "
"licenses, provided alongside the product when it ships. Many open-source "
"licenses (MIT, Apache-2.0, BSD, and others) require the copyright notice and "
"the full license text to be included with the product, so a notice that "
"gathers them is needed."
msgstr ""
"一份文件，整理產品內所含的開放原始碼元件與它們的授權條款，隨產品出貨時一併提"
"供。許多開放原始碼授權條款（MIT、Apache-2.0、BSD 等）都要求把著作權標示與授權"
"條款全文隨產品附上，因此需要一份把這些內容集中起來的授權聲明。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/start/no-cli.md:14
msgid ""
"This tool analyzes source code to build a component list (an [SBOM](../"
"concepts/what-is-sbom.md)), then groups components by license to generate "
"two notice files."
msgstr ""
"這個工具會分析原始碼，建立元件清單 ([SBOM](../concepts/what-is-sbom.md))，再"
"依授權條款把元件分組，產生兩種授權聲明檔案。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/start/no-cli.md:17
msgid "`..._NOTICE.txt` — a text format to ship as-is with the distribution"
msgstr "`..._NOTICE.txt` —— 可直接隨散布物出貨的文字格式"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/start/no-cli.md:17
msgid "`..._NOTICE.html` — a format that reads well in a browser"
msgstr "`..._NOTICE.html` —— 適合用瀏覽器閱讀的格式"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/start/no-cli.md:19
msgid ""
"The prefix (`...`) is the project name and version you entered. For example, "
"if the project is `MyApp` and the version is `1.0.0`, the file is "
"`MyApp_1.0.0_NOTICE.txt`."
msgstr ""
"檔名前面那一段 (`...`) 是你輸入的專案名稱與版本。舉例來說，專案是 `MyApp`、版"
"本是 `1.0.0`，檔案就會是 `MyApp_1.0.0_NOTICE.txt`。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/start/no-cli.md:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "What you need and how long it takes"
msgstr "需要準備什麼、要花多久"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/start/no-cli.md:23
msgid ""
"All you need is a Docker engine. On Windows, for a first install, **Rancher "
"Desktop** is recommended — it is free and fits the double-click flow well. "
"If you already use Docker, leave it as is and move on. (A detailed "
"comparison of the other options is in [Getting started](../start/first-"
"scan.md).)"
msgstr ""
"你需要的只有一套 Docker 引擎。在 Windows 上第一次安裝的話，建議用 **Rancher "
"Desktop**——它免費，也很適合雙擊操作的流程。已經在用 Docker 的話，維持原樣繼續"
"往下看就好。（其他選項的詳細比較放在[快速開始](../start/first-scan.md)。）"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/start/no-cli.md:25
msgid "The first time, install and download take a while. Roughly:"
msgstr "第一次的安裝與下載會花一點時間。大致如下："

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/start/no-cli.md:29
msgid "Installing and first launch of Rancher Desktop: about 5–10 minutes"
msgstr "安裝 Rancher Desktop 並第一次啟動：約 5–10 分鐘"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/start/no-cli.md:29
msgid ""
"First download of the scanner image (about 250 MB): usually a minute or two "
"(varies by network, only the first time)"
msgstr ""
"第一次下載掃描器映像檔（約 250 MB）：通常一兩分鐘（依網路狀況而異，只有第一次"
"需要）"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/start/no-cli.md:29
msgid ""
"First scan of a project, which fetches a language image (0.6–1.7 GB): a few "
"more minutes, also once per language"
msgstr ""
"第一次掃描專案時取得語言映像檔 (0.6–1.7 GB)：再多花幾分鐘，這也是每種語言只"
"需一次"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/start/no-cli.md:31
msgid "Once set up, opening the app and scanning afterward takes 1–2 minutes."
msgstr "準備好之後，之後每次開啟應用程式並完成掃描只要 1–2 分鐘。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/start/no-cli.md:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "Walkthrough"
msgstr "跟著做"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/start/no-cli.md:35
msgid ""
"There are two paths. The desktop app is the simplest, so it is recommended. "
"The overall flow:"
msgstr "有兩條路。桌面版應用程式最簡單，因此建議走這一條。整體流程如下："

#. type: Fenced code block (mermaid)
#: docs/start/no-cli.md:36
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"flowchart TD\n"
"    A[\"Install Docker engine<br/>(Rancher Desktop)\"] --> B[\"Get the desktop app<br/>.exe from releases/latest\"]\n"
"    B --> C[\"Double-click<br/>(if SmartScreen: More info, Run)\"]\n"
"    C --> D[\"First-run image download<br/>about 250 MB, once\"]\n"
"    D --> E[\"Enter project name and version\"]\n"
"    E --> F[\"Upload source ZIP and scan\"]\n"
"    F --> G[\"Download NOTICE.txt / NOTICE.html\"]\n"
msgstr ""
"flowchart TD\n"
"    A[\"安裝 Docker 引擎<br/>(Rancher Desktop)\"] --> B[\"取得桌面版應用程式<br/>releases/latest 的 .exe\"]\n"
"    B --> C[\"雙擊執行<br/>（遇到 SmartScreen：其他資訊、仍要執行）\"]\n"
"    C --> D[\"首次執行下載映像檔<br/>約 250 MB，只有一次\"]\n"
"    D --> E[\"輸入專案名稱與版本\"]\n"
"    E --> F[\"上傳原始碼 ZIP 並掃描\"]\n"
"    F --> G[\"下載 NOTICE.txt / NOTICE.html\"]\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/start/no-cli.md:46
#, no-wrap
msgid "Path A — desktop app (recommended)"
msgstr "方法 A——桌面版應用程式（建議）"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: docs/start/no-cli.md:51
msgid ""
"**Install a Docker engine**. Download the Windows installer from "
"[rancherdesktop.io](https://rancherdesktop.io/), install it, and run it. If "
"it asks whether to use Kubernetes during install, you can turn it off. When "
"the taskbar icon settles (usually 1–2 minutes), it is ready."
msgstr ""
"**安裝 Docker 引擎**。到 [rancherdesktop.io](https://rancherdesktop.io/) 下"
"載 Windows 版安裝程式，安裝後執行它。安裝過程若問你要不要使用 Kubernetes，關"
"掉也可以。工作列圖示穩定下來（通常 1–2 分鐘）就代表準備好了。"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: docs/start/no-cli.md:51
msgid ""
"**Get and run the app**. Click [Download BomLens for Windows (.exe)](https://"
"github.com/sktelecom/bomlens/releases/latest/download/BomLens-Setup.exe) and "
"double-click the file. It is unsigned for now, so if Windows shows a "
"\"Windows protected your PC\" warning, click \"More info\" and choose \"Run "
"anyway\". The app opens with no console window."
msgstr ""
"**取得並執行應用程式**。點選 [下載 Windows 版 BomLens (.exe)](https://"
"github.com/sktelecom/bomlens/releases/latest/download/BomLens-Setup.exe)，再"
"雙擊下載到的檔案。目前還沒有簽章，所以 Windows 若跳出「Windows 已保護您的電"
"腦」警告，請點「其他資訊」，再選「仍要執行」。應用程式會直接開啟，不會出現主"
"控台視窗。"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: docs/start/no-cli.md:51
msgid ""
"**First-run image download**. The scanner image is pulled just once. The app "
"shows progress as below, so leave the window open and wait. On later "
"launches, the app pulls a newer image automatically when one has been "
"published, so there is nothing to redownload or reinstall by hand."
msgstr ""
"**首次執行下載映像檔**。掃描器映像檔只會下載一次。應用程式會像下面這樣顯示進"
"度，請不要關掉視窗，耐心等待。之後啟動時，只要有更新的映像檔發佈，應用程式就"
"會自動下載，因此不需要手動重新下載或重新安裝。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/start/no-cli.md:53
msgid ""
"![Click \"More info\" on the SmartScreen warning and proceed with \"Run "
"anyway\"](../images/smartscreen.png)"
msgstr ""
"![在 SmartScreen 警告畫面點「其他資訊」，再以「仍要執行」繼續](../images/"
"smartscreen.png)"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/start/no-cli.md:55
msgid ""
"![The desktop app startup screen, showing image download and preparation "
"progress](../images/desktop-startup.png)"
msgstr ""
"![桌面版應用程式的啟動畫面，顯示映像檔下載與準備進度](../images/desktop-"
"startup.png)"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/start/no-cli.md:57
msgid ""
"If Docker is not installed or is stopped, the app tells you what to do "
"instead of starting a scan."
msgstr "若 Docker 沒有安裝或已停止，應用程式不會開始掃描，而是告訴你該做什麼。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/start/no-cli.md:59
msgid ""
"![The guidance screen the app shows when Docker is missing](../images/"
"desktop-docker-missing.png)"
msgstr ""
"![Docker 不存在時，應用程式顯示的指引畫面](../images/desktop-docker-"
"missing.png)"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/start/no-cli.md:61
msgid "Now go to [Scan and get the notice](#scan-and-get-the-notice) below."
msgstr "接下來請看下面的[掃描並取得授權聲明](#scan-and-get-the-notice)。"

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/start/no-cli.md:62
#, no-wrap
msgid "Path B — ZIP and double-click batch file (alternative)"
msgstr "方法 B——ZIP 與雙擊批次檔（替代方案） {#path-b--zip-and-double-click-batch-file-alternative}"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/start/no-cli.md:65
msgid "If you prefer a script over the desktop app, this path works too."
msgstr "比起桌面版應用程式更想用指令碼的話，這條路也行得通。"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: docs/start/no-cli.md:69
msgid "**Install a Docker engine**. Same as step 1 of Path A."
msgstr "**安裝 Docker 引擎**。與方法 A 的第 1 步相同。"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: docs/start/no-cli.md:69
msgid ""
"**Download the tool**. On the [latest release page](https://github.com/"
"sktelecom/bomlens/releases/latest), download `bomlens-cli-windows.zip` from "
"the assets and unzip it. You should see a `scripts` folder inside the "
"unzipped folder. (The green Code button on the repository page also gives "
"you a ZIP, but that one is an unreleased snapshot of the current source, not "
"a tagged release.)"
msgstr ""
"**下載工具**。在[最新發行頁面](https://github.com/sktelecom/bomlens/releases/"
"latest)的 assets 裡下載 `bomlens-cli-windows.zip` 並解壓縮。解壓後的資料夾裡"
"應該看得到一個 `scripts` 資料夾。（儲存庫頁面上綠色的 Code 按鈕也可以下載 "
"ZIP，但那是目前原始碼未發行的快照，不是打上標籤的正式發行版。）"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: docs/start/no-cli.md:69
msgid ""
"**Run the web UI**. Double-click `sbom-ui.bat` in the `scripts` folder. At "
"first a black window shows \"downloading the scanner image (about 250 MB)\", "
"and once done a browser opens `http://localhost:8080`. Each scan's results "
"are saved to a `{Project}_{Version}\\` subfolder under `C:\\Users\\<your-"
"name>\\sbom-output`."
msgstr ""
"**執行網頁介面**。雙擊 `scripts` 資料夾裡的 `sbom-ui.bat`。一開始會有黑色視窗"
"顯示「正在下載掃描器映像檔（約 250 MB）」，下載完成後瀏覽器就會開啟 `http://"
"localhost:8080`。每次掃描的結果會存到 `C:\\Users\\<你的使用者名稱>\\sbom-"
"output` 底下的 `{Project}_{Version}\\` 子資料夾。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/start/no-cli.md:71
msgid ""
"To check that everything is ready, double-click `scripts\\check-setup.bat` "
"in the unzipped folder. It checks Docker installation and status, the "
"scanner image, and port status, in your Windows display language."
msgstr ""
"要確認一切就緒，請雙擊解壓後資料夾裡的 `scripts\\check-setup.bat`。它會依你"
"的 Windows 顯示語言，檢查 Docker 的安裝與執行狀態、掃描器映像檔以及連接埠狀"
"態。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/start/no-cli.md:73
msgid ""
"![The console window on the first run of sbom-ui.bat, showing the image "
"download notice](../images/bat-console.png)"
msgstr ""
"![第一次執行 sbom-ui.bat 時的主控台視窗，顯示映像檔下載提示](../images/bat-"
"console.png)"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/start/no-cli.md:75
msgid "![The BomLens web UI](../images/web-ui.png)"
msgstr "![BomLens 網頁介面](../images/web-ui.png)"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/start/no-cli.md:76
#, no-wrap
msgid "If macOS says the app is damaged"
msgstr "macOS 顯示應用程式已損毀時 {#if-macos-says-the-app-is-damaged}"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/start/no-cli.md:79
msgid ""
"On macOS you may see a warning that \"BomLens\" is damaged and can't be "
"opened, offering only \"Move to Trash\". The app is not actually damaged. "
"The current macOS build is not yet signed and notarized with an Apple "
"Developer ID, so macOS quarantines the downloaded app and Gatekeeper blocks "
"it. It is the same kind of block as the SmartScreen warning on Windows."
msgstr ""
"在 macOS 上，你可能會看到「『BomLens』已損毀，無法打開」的警告，而且只給你"
"「移到垃圾桶」這個選項。應用程式其實沒有損毀。目前的 macOS 版本還沒有用 "
"Apple Developer ID 完成程式碼簽章與公證 (notarization)，所以 macOS 會把下載"
"來的應用程式隔離 (quarantine)，Gatekeeper 就把它擋下來。這和 Windows 上的 "
"SmartScreen 警告是同一類的封鎖。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/start/no-cli.md:81
msgid ""
"This message behaves differently from the ordinary \"unidentified "
"developer\" warning. On recent macOS, right-clicking the app and choosing "
"Open, or the \"Open anyway\" button in System Settings, usually does not "
"clear it. The reliable way is to remove the quarantine attribute from a "
"terminal."
msgstr ""
"這個訊息的行為和常見的「未識別的開發者」警告不一樣。在較新的 macOS 上，對應用"
"程式按右鍵選「打開」，或按「系統設定」裡的「強制打開」按鈕，通常都解不開。可"
"靠的做法是從終端機移除隔離屬性。"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: docs/start/no-cli.md:84
msgid "Open the `.dmg` and drag `BomLens.app` into your Applications folder."
msgstr "開啟 `.dmg`，把 `BomLens.app` 拖進「應用程式」資料夾。"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: docs/start/no-cli.md:84
msgid ""
"Open Terminal and run the command below, then open BomLens from Applications "
"as usual."
msgstr ""
"開啟「終端機」執行下面的指令，然後照平常的方式從「應用程式」開啟 BomLens。"

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/start/no-cli.md:85
#, no-wrap
msgid "   xattr -dr com.apple.quarantine /Applications/BomLens.app\n"
msgstr "   xattr -dr com.apple.quarantine /Applications/BomLens.app\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/start/no-cli.md:90
msgid ""
"If it still won't open on an Apple Silicon Mac, run this once and try again:"
msgstr "在 Apple Silicon 的 Mac 上若還是打不開，執行一次下面的指令再試一次："

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/start/no-cli.md:91
#, no-wrap
msgid "codesign --force --deep -s - /Applications/BomLens.app\n"
msgstr "codesign --force --deep -s - /Applications/BomLens.app\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/start/no-cli.md:96
msgid ""
"This step is only needed because the current macOS build is not yet signed "
"and notarized, and it goes away once the app is signed."
msgstr ""
"這個步驟只是因為目前的 macOS 版本還沒完成簽章與公證才需要，等應用程式簽章之後"
"就不會再遇到。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/start/no-cli.md:97
#, no-wrap
msgid "Scan and get the notice"
msgstr "掃描並取得授權聲明 {#scan-and-get-the-notice}"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/start/no-cli.md:100
msgid "From here the desktop app and the web UI are the same."
msgstr "從這裡開始，桌面版應用程式與網頁介面的操作相同。"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: docs/start/no-cli.md:104
msgid "Enter the project name and version."
msgstr "輸入專案名稱與版本。"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: docs/start/no-cli.md:104
msgid ""
"For the scan target, choose \"ZIP upload\" and upload the source code ZIP "
"received from the dev team."
msgstr "在「掃描目標」選「ZIP 上傳」，上傳開發團隊給你的原始碼 ZIP 檔。"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: docs/start/no-cli.md:104
msgid ""
"Click run. The progress log streams in real time, and the result overview "
"appears when it finishes."
msgstr "按下「執行掃描」。執行記錄會即時顯示，結束後就會出現結果概要。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/start/no-cli.md:106
#, no-wrap
msgid "> To scan a folder already on your disk instead of a ZIP, the desktop app has an **Add folder** button. On the `sbom-ui.bat` path, set `SBOM_UI_MOUNT_DIR` to that folder before running so the web UI can reach it (the CLI equivalent is `--ui --mount <dir>`).\n"
msgstr "> 如果要掃描的是磁碟上已經有的資料夾而不是 ZIP，桌面版應用程式有**新增資料夾…**按鈕。走 `sbom-ui.bat` 這條路的話，執行前把 `SBOM_UI_MOUNT_DIR` 設成那個資料夾，網頁介面就能存取它（對應的 CLI 寫法是 `--ui --mount <dir>`）。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/start/no-cli.md:108
msgid ""
"![The scan result overview — components, vulnerabilities and licenses](../"
"images/web-ui-scan.png)"
msgstr "![掃描結果概要——元件、弱點與授權條款](../images/web-ui-scan.png)"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/start/no-cli.md:110
msgid ""
"When the scan finishes, download the notice from the results screen as per-"
"format chips (`HTML`, `TXT`). The SBOM (`..._bom.json`) and the risk report "
"(`..._risk-report.html`) generated alongside are available on the same "
"screen, and you can also download everything as a single ZIP. Downloaded "
"files are saved to the results folder as well."
msgstr ""
"掃描結束後，就能在結果畫面依格式（`HTML`、`TXT`）分別下載授權聲明。一起產生"
"的 SBOM (`..._bom.json`) 與開放原始碼風險報告 (`..._risk-report.html`) 也在同"
"一個畫面上，你也可以用「全部下載 (ZIP)」一次取得全部檔案。下載的檔案同時也會"
"存到結果資料夾。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/start/no-cli.md:112
msgid ""
"![Download the notice per format from the results screen, or get everything "
"as a ZIP](../images/app-results.png)"
msgstr ""
"![在結果畫面依格式下載授權聲明，或用一個 ZIP 取得全部檔案](../images/app-"
"results.png)"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/start/no-cli.md:113
#, no-wrap
msgid "When you get stuck"
msgstr "卡住的時候"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/start/no-cli.md:124
msgid ""
"**I don't know what's wrong**: double-click `scripts\\check-setup.bat` to "
"check Docker, the image, and port status at once, and it tells you what to "
"do next. It follows your Windows display language: Korean on a Korean "
"system, English everywhere else. To force one, put `SBOM_LANG=en` (or `ko`) "
"in the settings file described below."
msgstr ""
"**不知道問題出在哪**：雙擊 `scripts\\check-setup.bat`，它會一次檢查 Docker、"
"映像檔與連接埠狀態，並告訴你下一步該做什麼。它會跟著你的 Windows 顯示語言：韓"
"文系統顯示韓文，其他一律英文。想固定用哪一種，就在下面說明的設定檔裡寫上 "
"`SBOM_LANG=en`（或 `ko`）。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/start/no-cli.md:124
msgid ""
"**A \"Windows protected your PC\" warning appears**: this is because the "
"desktop app is still unsigned. Click \"More info\" and choose \"Run anyway\"."
msgstr ""
"**跳出「Windows 已保護您的電腦」警告**：這是因為桌面版應用程式目前還沒有簽"
"章。點「其他資訊」再選「仍要執行」就好。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/start/no-cli.md:124
msgid ""
"**macOS says the app is \"damaged\"**: this is the same unsigned-app block, "
"not real damage. See [If macOS says the app is damaged](#if-macos-says-the-"
"app-is-damaged) to clear it from a terminal."
msgstr ""
"**macOS 說應用程式「已損毀」**：這不是真的損毀，而是同一種未簽章封鎖。請看 "
"[macOS 顯示應用程式已損毀時](#if-macos-says-the-app-is-damaged)，那裡有從終端"
"機解開的方法。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/start/no-cli.md:124
msgid ""
"**It says \"Docker is not installed\"**: make sure Rancher Desktop is "
"installed and running."
msgstr ""
"**顯示「Docker 未安裝」**：請確認 Rancher Desktop 已經安裝並且正在執行。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/start/no-cli.md:124
msgid ""
"**It says \"the Docker engine is not running\"**: start Rancher Desktop, "
"wait for the icon to settle, then run it again."
msgstr ""
"**顯示「Docker 引擎未在執行」**：請啟動 Rancher Desktop，等圖示穩定下來後再執"
"行一次。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/start/no-cli.md:124
msgid ""
"**The scan finished but there are no files in the results folder**: this can "
"happen if the results folder is outside Docker's file-sharing scope. This "
"tool saves to `sbom-output` under your home directory (`C:\\Users\\...`), "
"which is usually safe. If you still don't see them, download them directly "
"with the download buttons in the browser."
msgstr ""
"**掃描完成了，結果資料夾裡卻沒有檔案**：結果資料夾位在 Docker 的檔案共享範圍"
"之外時，就可能這樣。這個工具會存到你家目錄 (`C:\\Users\\...`) 底下的 `sbom-"
"output`，通常是安全的。若還是看不到檔案，請直接用瀏覽器畫面上的下載按鈕取得。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/start/no-cli.md:124
msgid ""
"**The browser doesn't open automatically**: type `http://localhost:8080` "
"into the address bar yourself. If port 8080 was busy the launcher moves to "
"the next free port and prints the address it chose, so use that one."
msgstr ""
"**瀏覽器沒有自動開啟**：請自己在網址欄輸入 `http://localhost:8080`。若 8080 "
"連接埠已被占用，啟動程式會改用下一個空閒的連接埠，並印出它選用的位址，請改用"
"那個位址。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/start/no-cli.md:124
msgid ""
"**\"Image download failed\" on a company network**: this is almost always a "
"proxy. The image is downloaded by the **Docker daemon**, not by the "
"launcher, so proxy settings in your command prompt have no effect — set them "
"in Docker Desktop (`Settings > Resources > Proxies`) or Rancher Desktop "
"(`Preferences > WSL > Proxy`). If the proxy also intercepts `localhost`, add "
"`localhost` to its bypass list, otherwise the browser shows an error even "
"when the scan is running fine."
msgstr ""
"**在公司網路上出現「映像檔下載失敗」**：這幾乎都是代理伺服器造成的。映像檔是"
"由 **Docker daemon** 下載，不是啟動程式，所以在命令提示字元裡設定的代理伺服器"
"沒有作用——請在 Docker Desktop (`Settings > Resources > Proxies`) 或 Rancher "
"Desktop (`Preferences > WSL > Proxy`) 裡設定。如果代理伺服器連 `localhost` 都"
"一併攔截，請把 `localhost` 加進它的略過清單，否則即使掃描正常執行，瀏覽器還是"
"會顯示錯誤。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/start/no-cli.md:124
msgid ""
"**No usable network at all**: the launcher can install from a file instead "
"of downloading. Ask for `bomlens-image.tar`, put it next to the `.bat` "
"files, and it is used automatically — no network, no command line. See "
"\"Settings file\" below."
msgstr ""
"**完全沒有可用的網路**：啟動程式可以改用檔案安裝，不必下載。請索取 `bomlens-"
"image.tar`，放到那些 `.bat` 檔旁邊，它就會被自動採用——不需要網路，也不需要指"
"令列。請參考下面的「設定檔」。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/start/no-cli.md:125
#, no-wrap
msgid "Settings file (no command line needed)"
msgstr "設定檔（不需要指令列）"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/start/no-cli.md:128
msgid ""
"Environment variables you type in a command prompt do not apply when you "
"double-click a `.bat`, so the launchers also read a plain text file. Copy "
"`scripts\\bomlens.settings.example.txt` to `bomlens.settings.txt` in the "
"same folder and uncomment what you need:"
msgstr ""
"你在命令提示字元裡設定的環境變數，在雙擊 `.bat` 時並不會生效，因此啟動程式也"
"會讀取一個純文字檔。把 `scripts\\bomlens.settings.example.txt` 複製成同一個資"
"料夾裡的 `bomlens.settings.txt`，再把需要的那幾行取消註解："

#. type: Fenced code block
#: docs/start/no-cli.md:129
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"SBOM_LANG=en\n"
"UI_PORT=9090\n"
"SBOM_PULL=never\n"
"SBOM_IMAGE_TAR=D:\\bomlens-image.tar\n"
msgstr ""
"SBOM_LANG=en\n"
"UI_PORT=9090\n"
"SBOM_PULL=never\n"
"SBOM_IMAGE_TAR=D:\\bomlens-image.tar\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/start/no-cli.md:137
msgid ""
"The file is commented in both English and Korean. A real environment "
"variable, if you set one, still wins over the file."
msgstr ""
"這個檔案的註解同時附有英文與韓文。若你確實設了環境變數，環境變數還是優先於這"
"個檔案。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/start/no-cli.md:139
msgid ""
"For more detail and command-line usage, see [Getting started](../start/first-"
"scan.md) and the [Notice and security guide](../guides/reports.md)."
msgstr ""
"更詳細的說明與指令列用法，請看[快速開始](../start/first-scan.md)與[授權聲明與"
"安全報告指南](../guides/reports.md)。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/start/no-cli.md:142
#, no-wrap
msgid "> **Related**: [Getting started](../start/first-scan.md) | [Notice and security guide](../guides/reports.md)\n"
msgstr "> **相關文件**：[快速開始](../start/first-scan.md) | [授權聲明與安全報告指南](../guides/reports.md)\n"

